-to-day lives are much like what you endure in these battles."Oh, don’t pity me. My only point is that I would gladly spare you the intensity of fate’s dying gasps if I could, trust me."Trust me, darling."v\i[TAROTAMULET]As the amulet twists and writhes, you can feel the tension of invisible threads being pulled taut."8They are wrapped around the amulet, and around you."sSomewhere behind you they frayed into thousands of strands, and ahead of you they extend to somewhere distant."There they all end.":You understand by now, don’t you? Makya is history.">You, darling, are a history to me – a singular history."3And I am a singular history projected forward."�You have the benefit of what we’ll call a privileged reference frame, and I thank you dearly for letting me glimpse through your eyes at it."0Not to mention making a few… alterations."+Don’t think too hard on it, dearest.".\i[TAROTAMULET]The amulet has gone still."^Something is changing – the threads are being woven back together, or severed, or both."4Someone is taking matters into their own hands."No, that isn’t me."0We both know who it is, though, don’t we?"dYou should probably stop her from doing that, or one of us could end up in the other’s place."IYou were not made for the terminus, and I was not made for a utopia."=And no human was made for the paradise she’s planning.",…\PN, you know who I am, don’t you?"]We won’t be speaking for a little while, but know that I’m watching over you, child."My child."…Agonizingly familiar."[But, still, she is a stranger to you, this woman who almost has your mother’s voice."BHeard about this place called the <imp>Battle Monument</imp>."YThe whole idea is that you can fight through a gauntlet of AI trainers. Neat, right?"nAnyways, I'll be hanging around the Battle Monument for the foreseeable future, so meet me here, ya hear?"JI've got some new team configurations I really wanna try against you."$I’m swallowing my pride here."EI need your help with something... more i