ug some major issues with the older supply chain databases.">Kurt and Pearce were talking about just wiping the thing."}Just because they used to be Helena's lieutenants doesn't mean she won't have their hide if she catches them cutting corners!"/"LuxTech Campus, where the future begins!"">Are you one of the new hires? Get me a coffee, chop chop."3Well, go get some, then. I don't have all day.""Wow, this is some good stuff!"<I can already feel the energy coursing through my body."?I won't be needing to tide myself over with these anymore."PWell I don't see any on you. We don't pay you to waste our time with jokes!"&This coffee ain't that great kid."&In fact, its awful. You're fired."9Pack up your things and leave, wherever you work at." LuxPark: A place of smiles."KHelena is always out when I come to battle her. It's very frustrating!"AI guess in the meanwhile I should get some more training in."Want to fight?"I had hoped..."Splendid!"KYou're great! Battling you will be good practice for Helena, for sure."`My Pokemon can't just keep going after a battle like that. We'll be right as rain tomorrow."3I'm figuring out vacation spots here in Makya."qVisiting the ice cave seems wonderful, but the looming threat of Avatars really throws a wrench in things..."!The door is securely locked."UA sign reads "Schedule your gym appointments in the large building to the west.""&I decided to come here on a whim."This park sucks."-I can't believe they even called it one."LuxTech Campus Gym"Leader: Helena"(Shocking strategy, typhoon tactics!":LuxTech's Makya campus is more than just a workplace."VWe're also the undisputed capital of scientific research across the whole region!"+At least that's what I tell investors."�Helena juggles leadership in this company with contract work for the Makyan government, and even then still finds time to train Pokemon for her gym."VIf you plan on facing her, you best be wary of her Wailmer, as well as her Luxio."BI've heard she pulls out a Toxtricity every so often as well."West: County Park"East: Lingering Delta"/LuxTech makes great products, and cheaply."LSetting up an office in Makya hasn't helped their PR situation, though."�In theory, they're thoroughly vetting all hires for past Chasm ties, and Helena's just an advisor... but we all know she's running the show."kNot a good look for the company that recently switched mottos to "Innovation, Inspiration, Integrity.""Yikes."9Get your lunches, imported premium from sunny Alola!"CThe people around here said that I can't swim in the fountain."2Why can't I? It's still water in a container!"=All of my test materials got stolen mid-shipment. Again."UApparently not everyone got the memo that Makya shouldn't work that way anymore."^I really hope that Helena can convince the Makyan Rangers to start patrolling our routes."No"Yes"Don't give coffee."Give coffee."Not interested."Let's go!"5You ever have someone bother you out of nowhere?"UJust have your Pokemon give 'em one of these, and they'll leave you alone quick."Yeah, that'll do."WEither you give 'em one of those, or you bribe 'em with some stuff you don't need."$Oh, I see you have a MasterDex."aI have one of those myself, I got it from when I worked under Miss - er, Professor Tamarind."?I used to help her keep the grunts from getting too rowdy."<As nice as my job is now, it's certainly less exciting."KYou might be wondering how I nabbed myself a timeslot to fight Helena."!But I'll never tell, teehee!"\My team, however, is an open book. Immunities to Water, Electric, and to stat lowering."7Stick around to fight me, and I'll show it to you."=Third gym's the charm, or something like that. Fight me?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."DI'm gonna show you the difference between strategy and tactics!"4Just like that, my team's put to the sidelines."QA knack for tactics, that's what you got. Helena'll be impressed, I know it."DHealing center's uhh... to the west. So go off and do that now