ts awful. You're fired."9Pack up your things and leave, wherever you work at." LuxPark: A place of smiles."KHelena is always out when I come to battle her. It's very frustrating!"AI guess in the meanwhile I should get some more training in."Want to fight?"I had hoped..."Splendid!"KYou're great! Battling you will be good practice for Helena, for sure."`My Pokemon can't just keep going after a battle like that. We'll be right as rain tomorrow."3I'm figuring out vacation spots here in Makya."qVisiting the ice cave seems wonderful, but the looming threat of Avatars really throws a wrench in things..."!The door is securely locked."UA sign reads "Schedule your gym appointments in the large building to the west.""&I decided to come here on a whim."This park sucks."-I can't believe they even called it one."LuxTech Campus Gym"Leader: Helena"(Shocking strategy, typhoon tactics!":LuxTech's Makya campus is more than just a workplace."VWe're also the undisputed capital of scientific research across the whole region!"+At least that's what I tell investors."�Helena juggles leadership in this company with contract work for the Makyan government, and even then still finds time to train Pokemon for her gym."VIf you plan on facing her, you best be wary of her Wailmer, as well as her Luxio."BI've heard she pulls out a Toxtricity every so often as well."West: County Park"East: Lingering Delta"/LuxTech makes great products, and cheaply."LSetting up an office in Makya hasn't helped their PR situation, though."�In theory, they're thoroughly vetting all hires for past Chasm ties, and Helena's just an advisor... but we all know she's running the show."kNot a good look for the company that recently switched mottos to "Innovation, Inspiration, Integrity.""Yikes."9Get your lunches, imported premium from sunny Alola!"CThe people around here said that I can't swim in the fountain."2Why can't I? It's still water in a container!"=All of my test materials got stolen mid-shipment. Again."U