 The same principle applies!"=You just don't get it. You don't understand my darkness."JLet me show you the coldness, the pressure, the darkness of my heart!"EYou seem to understand the darkness that lurks beneath yourself."@It is the same darkness that is at the bottom of the waves."&I am certain we shall meet again."Run the credits?"Dialogue here."<It's a vending machine.\n Which drink would you like?\G""\GA Fresh Water dropped down!"/\GBonus! Another Fresh Water dropped down."(\GYou have no room left in the Bag."#\GYou don't have enough money."\GA Soda Pop dropped down!",\GBonus! Another Soda Pop dropped down."\GA Lemonade dropped down!",\GBonus! Another Lemonade dropped down.""\GDecided not to buy a drink."Oh. Hello again."1Are you here to find the gym leader as well?"<Wonderful, then you might be half as miserable as I am."ABy all standards, my team is not exactly photogenic anymore."<No one wants a photoshoot with a Lairon! Or an Loudred!"iI love them all to death, but what exactly am I supposed to do here? All my prospects have dried up!"aI even caught a new Pokemon to fill in for them, but the same thing to that Pokemon as well!">My poor Jangmo-o is working overtime to make up for it..."Whatever."DWe're trying to get that damn badge, so we might as well train."jBattling is the only thing we're good at right now, and I think we all have some frustration to vent."?Ugh. If I can't beat you, I probably can't get that badge."^No point wasting time here. Time to trudge through those damn jungles and swamps again..."MYou'll need at least two Pokémon or a partner if you want to battle me."AYou think you can make it past my team? I hope you prepared!"ITime for me to move on. Look out for any other pro trainers like me!"!Your Pokemon are now healed."Decorate time"Oh! Hi! Nice to meet you!"SYou must have approached me because me and my Pokemon are overwhelmingly cute."/Well, you've approached the right Trainer!"[I'm on a mission to make the cutest team on the p