 Chasm HQ"%South-West: Exit to Kilna Ascent"Hey, can I ask a favor?"HI’m really really sorry, but you got some medicine you can spare?"LI’ve got a Pokémon that needs fixing up, and, uh, it’s pretty bad."PUh, well – listen, if you promise to share I’ll let it out of its ball."@I can’t take it to a Pokécenter because… you’ll see."1You hand over some of your Aid Kit medicine."!You hand over a Fresh Water."4Oh, uh, you, uh… you don’t have any either."GSorry to bother you. Guess you’ve got your own issues. G’luck."Ah, man."OK, yeah, I guess."@I gotta figure something out now. I’ll – I’ll get by."G’luck."5This is why I didn’t just go to a Pokécenter."\It’s a Phione. Don’t bother looking it up in your 'dex – they aren’t even real."2Least, that’s what people say. Just a myth."NAnd, y’know how Makya is – I wasn’t about to show it off in public."%Here, let’s get ya fixed up…"JDumb luck. Stumbled across a Manaphy one night and it gave me an egg."NDidn't know if I was cut out for that, but couldn't exactly turn it down."3Figured it was a chance to do right, y’know?"/Phione? They’re the children of Manaphy."gThat’s what I’ve heard anyways. Can’t find any solid records online of someone catching one."LNot everyone even believes they exist. But, uh, hey, this one’s real."+Well, you helped me out, didn’t you?"TDon’t really seem like a Pokémon thief to me. So, yeah, I guess I trust you."KI was trying to train it up, but it’s a pretty fragile little thing."\Didn’t hatch all that long ago, and, well… I’m used to training hardier Pokémon."@Still trying to learn to be a li’l more gentle, you know?"8Wait, guess I haven’t actually introduced myself."IMy name’s <imp>Eifion</imp>, and this is my Phione. How about you?"+…Well, \PN, it’s nice meeting you."gYou too, \pfp. I should be heading out, but thank you, seriously. You bailed me out big time here."'Won’t forget it. See you around!"!Doesn't open from this side."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around."2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."Where is it?"Use your Aid Kit."Give a Fresh Water."Sorry, but no."How did you get it?"What is it?"You trust me?"How'd it get hurt?"4I'm so happy I can finally return to my plants!"$Thank you thank you thank you!!"BI've been waiting for days to do maintenance on these lights."@Wasn't gonna risk it with that Avatar making its home here."1I appreciate you taking care of that for me!",You really did a number on that avatar."NCan't afford to be trapped in here, since I got this Origin Ore to fence.""Yeah, I stole it. What of it?" Or maybe you're interested?"5k, since I like ya."Your loss.""The shiny stuff always sells."%You hand over $5000 in exchange."See ya later. Not!"@Don't mess with me like that, you don't even have the cash."AGHHH!!!"
