 don't even have a Poison-type yet!"=See? I didn't do too bad! I could totally work for them!"SYou got some hot moves! Remind me to introduce you to Lainie -- she'd love ya!"LI'm searchin' for that bolt of lightning to inspire me. Hit me with it!"\Ah, I just found the perfect riff! I need to have Lainie listen to this! She'd love it!"LDamn! I was feelin' it for a second there, but then it just fell apart."1Serves me right for composing during battle."8Maybe if I turn like this he'll catch my good side."/Take a hike, we have a portrait to finish!" Excuse me, I'm posing here."/Don't interfere with the artistic process!"8I somehow managed to paint you into the portrait..."2\wmTake a hike, we have a portrait to finish!"+It's been a rocky enough job as it is.":It looks like it's taking a needed rest on the bench."NA splash of brown, then some red...Gotta get the colours on this perfect!"@This job's been a rocky one even without your interference."BYou ready? Can we – can we skip the talking and just fight?"GOnly the top trainers will have a shot at the yearly championship.";Let's hash out which one of us is worthy of this item!"Interesting..."I guess I can leave now.",I may not place as highly as I thought."No."A Togekiss?"Let's go."MAnyways, I'm traveling up north to the big city for the Battle Festival!"See ya!"*Try to break into the house by force?"sCross the river into <imp>Prizca</imp>, the big city, and I'll be there to give you a 4th and final invention."Hi."7I just wanna say—who planted these berries here?"3The Timburr have enough distractions as it is."Whatever. Here."?This thing will save you time like you wouldn’t believe.",More convenient than flying everywhere."2I’d use one, myself, if not for the nausea.".But uh… it probably won’t affect you!"eMy next official stop is at <imp>Prizca West</imp>, north of the river. Let’s meet up there—"bActually… I’ll be making a pitstop at <imp>LuxTech</imp> first. Stop by, if you’d like."-Or don’t. I don’t control 