ere you, I'd take care not to end up like them wrecked boats out west o' 'ere."1Damn rich folk and their careless sailin'...Iu;␀u5[[g"SThere are <imp>vending machines</imp> in all PokéCenters and Ranger Stations."|At the northernmost part of the Shipping Lane there is a house, and inside of that house a cave, and in that cave an Avatar!"Destroy it!"cI’ve been waiting years to find a trainer good enough to eradicate it, and you’re the one!"KThis key will get you inside, and then just, well, do what I would do!"DOh, and be a dear and don’t ask anymore questions. Good luck!"rIt waits in the suspicious house in the Shipping Lane! Destroy it, and rid me of the damnable thing for good!"hOh? Have you sent the avatar back from whence it came?! Excellent! Your talents are second-to-none!"tCongratulations on reaching me! And congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"qShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now! Now, you know the drill."]Do you want to face my standard panoply of agony, or the fullest onslaught I can muster?"SSure! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"6Lovely! Make no mistake: I take no half measures."qI’m gonna test you with fire and acid, claw and fang! Pain will be your teacher, and I will be your judge!"Let us begin!"2Wow! I’m feeling the burn -- how about you?"%I’ll get your Pokémon healed."=That for them, and this for you: the Perseverance Badge!"ZI yearn for the day I might challenge you again! Either here, or in the Championship!"So long!"QI’m so happy you said that! Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"II know that there is only way to test someone: Over! Whelming! PAIN!"Now overcome it, or fall!"UAnd so my team is snuffed out with nary a scratch on yours. A miserable failure."hI always try to leave challengers with a few scars to remember us by, but you were simply too good."@And you’ve certainly earned this: the Perseverance Badge."APerhaps... there is something we absolutely must talk about!"/Something worthy of your skill, I promise."(Let us relocate to the antechamber!",Unyielding! Devastating! Indefatigable!",Not to mention: the Perseverance Badge!"aIf you can overcome my gym in such blazing style, I can surely expect great things from you."GSo long, challenger! I’ll see you again, and that’s a promise!";What, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid?"Shall we duel once more?"2Once more the flames die with you the victor!"$Good! I’ve learned from this!";One day I’ll show you my true power -- you’ll see!"7Good! Good! Never let that fire within you go out!"TYour victory was delightfully explosive! I could use more challengers like you!"nThis is not a lab! It is a gym! In labs we have safety precautions. Here, unsafe conditions are the goal!"LOh-ho? So you want safe passage? Very well. You've earned the shortcut."iThe wild reaches of Makya won't have safety guidelines. If you can endure this, you can endure them."5White text flies by on a dark purple background."Yo, champ in the making!"EEko is the gym leader here, and they love pain in all its forms."@Therefore they picked Fire and Poison as their specialties."iGround-types are rather strong in this gym. Psychic-types and Rock-types are none too shabby either.">The final piece to this gym's puzzle are the teleporters."_See those blue pads? The ones the trainers are protecting will teleport you past the maze."IIf you don't unlock them, you'll find yourself walking a harsh path!"'Grats on beating the gym!"+You pushed through the pain just fine."`I hope you won't find this cruel. The suffering I'm about to inflict is strictly necessary."...Noted. Please avail yourself of this teleporter. Taking the long way may subject any afflicted Pokemon to undue injury."lThank you for your participation. Step carefully, now! Wouldn't want any lingering side effects... heh."JA 3-D model displays the the chemical makeup of Makyan Tangela venom."ALet me tend to your Pokémon while you bask in your victory."@Sorry for blocking the way, but I'm desperately dehydrated.">You have a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>! I'll be taking that..."/The man takes a Fresh Water from your bag."(Ahhhh.... that helps a lot. Thanks." Consider the lockdown over."�The scientists keep offering me liquids in beakers, but I've had too many close calls with caustic chemicals to just trust 'em on the contents."MI can't leave my post, so blocking the gym entrance is my only leverage."_I'm plopping down here until a challenger like yourself grabs me a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>."tThere's a couple <imp>vending machines</imp> scattered around Novo Town, so it should be easy to find a bottle.")Our glorious Champion! Good evening!"cOr morning! I’m not in the business of keeping count of the hours. That’s for the interns!"QNow, why are you here? Hoping for a rematch? Looking to learn more about me?"~Sorry! I’m busy! Drastically, obscenely busy! There is much work to be done, and I absolutely cannot spoil what it might be!"7Goodbye, \PN. We’ve already had our last battle."5Heal Bell would be so nice to have for this gym."1I did a mistake letting my Skitty forget it."VI'll have to visit the Move Maniac so my Skitty can <imp>relearn</imp> Heal Bell."`He's hanging in the Novo PokeCenter.... and in practically every other PokeCenter, somehow.")I thought this gym would be a cinch."EA whole team of fish couldn't possibly lose to a Fire- type gym!":I totally forgot that Poison is strong against Water."CBruh... this waiting room doesn't have any places to sit down."3No pain, no gain? Must be what Eko's thinking."TWhat, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid? Shall we duel once more?"$Congratulations on reaching me!"TAnd congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"XShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now!"(Are you ready for the grand finale?"ZGo on, then! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"PVery well, challenger! I present to you the fullest onslaught I can muster!"3Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"ILovely! Make no mistake: my panoply of agony takes no half measures."7I’ll test you with fire and acid, claw and fang!"@Let me tend to the Pokémon while you bask in your victory."YI’ve got a mission for you, challenger! Something worthy of your skill, I promise."-Your victory was delightfully explosive!"+I could use more challengers like you!"3Wow! I’m feeling the burn – how about you?"Not yet."Of course.[g"_¡Hay <imp>máquinas expendedoras</imp> en todos los Centros Pokémon y Estaciones Ranger."�En la parte más al norte de la Ruta Pezquera hay una casa, y dentro de esa casa hay una cueva, ¡Y dentro de esa cueva hay un Avatar!"¡Destrúyelo!"a¡He estado esperando por años un buen entrenador para erradicarlo, y tú eres el indicado!"MEsta llave te llevará dentro, y luego pues, bueno, ¡Haz lo que haría!"COh, y sé un encanto y no preguntes nada más. ¡Buena suerte!"s¡Te espera en la casa sospechosa en la Ruta Pesquera! ¡Destrúyelo, y deshácete de esa maldita cosa por mi!"j¿Oh? ¡¿Has enviado el avatar al lugar del que vino?! ¡Excelente! ¡Tus talentos son insuperables!"�¡Felicidades en llegar hasta mi! ¡Y felicidades a todos tus Pokémon! ¡Especialmente a aquellos que arden en el campo de combate!"}¡Muéstranos de lo que están hechos y pasa alrededor del dolor! ¡Sólo por un poco más! Ahora, ya conoces el cuento."]¿Quieres enfrentar a mi panoplia de agonía, o a toda la arremetida que puedo comandar?"f¡Seguro! ¡Tómate tu tiempo! ¡Consíguele a tus Pokémon algunos antídotos, o un extinguidor!"?¡Perfecto! No te equivoques: No me quedo a medias tintas."m¡Voy a enfrentarte con fuego, ácido, garra y colmillo! El dolor será tu profesor, y yo seré tu juez!"¡Empecemos!"5¡Wow! Estoy sintiendo la quemadura – ¿Y tú?"Curaré a tus Pokémon."@Eso para ellos, y esto para ti: ¡La Medalla Perseverancia!"b¡Ansío el día en el que te pueda enfrentarte de nuevo! ¡Ya sea aquí, o en el Campeonato!"¡Nos vemos!"d¡Me alegra escuchar eso! Todos los otros líderes de gimnasio son unos cobardes, ¡Pero no yo!"WSé que sólo hay una forma de poner a prueba a alguien: ¡Abru! ¡Mante! ¡DOLOR!"&¡Ahora véncelo, o cae ante él!"UY entonces mi equipo se apaga con apenas un rasguño tuyo. Un fracaso miserable."�Siempre intento dejar a los aspirantes con unas cuantas cicatrices para que nos recuerden, pero tú eres simplemente demasiado bueno."@Y ciertamente te has ganado esto: la Medalla Perseverancia."AQuizá… ¡Hay algo de lo que absolutamente debemos hablar!".Algo que merece tu habilidad, lo prometo." ¡Vayamos a la antecámara!"/¡Inflexible! ¡Devastante! ¡Infatigable!"2Por no mencionar: ¡La Medalla Perseverancia!"iSi puedes superar mi gimnasio en tal ardiente estilo, puedo seguramente esperar grandes cosas de ti."I¡Hasta luego, aspirante! ¡Te veré de nuevo, y eso es una promesa!"A¿Qué, extrañas el roce del fuego y la mordida del ácido?"%¿Nos batimos en duelo otra vez?":¡Una vez más las llamas se apagan ante el vencedor!"$¡Bien! ¡He aprendido de esto!"=Un día te mostraré mi verdadero poder – ¡Ya verás!"A¡Bien! ¡Bien! ¡No dejes que tu llama interior se extinga!"a¡Tu victoria fue maravillosamente explosiva! ¡Podría acostumbrarme a aspirantes como tú!"�¡Esto no es un laboratorio! En los laboratorios tenemos medidas de prevención. Aquí, ¡Condiciones poco seguras son el objetivo!"H¿Oh-ho? ¿Quieres un pasaje seguro? Muy bien. Te ganaste el atajo."pLos extremos salvajes de Makya no tendrán guías de seguridad. Si puedes soportar esto, puedes soportarlo."4Texto blanco vuela encima de un fondo púrpura."¡Hey, aspirante!"HEko, el líder de gimnasio aquí, ama el dolor en todas sus formas."APor lo tanto eligió Fuego y Veneno como sus especialidades."tLos tipo Tierra son bastante fuertes en este gimnasio. Los tipos Psíquico y Roca no lo hacen nada mal tampoco."OLa última pieza en el puzle de este gimnasio son los teletransportadores."s¿Ves esas plataformas? Las que los entrenadores están protegiendo te teletransportarán fuera del laberinto."KSi no las desbloqueas, ¡Te encontrarás caminando un cámino áspero!"*¡Felicidades por vencer el gimnasio!",Aguantaste el dolor sin complicaciones."jEspero que no encuentres esto cruel. El sufrimiento que te voy a infligir es estrictamente necesario."�…Entendido. Por favor haz uso de este teletransportador. Tomar el camino largo puede causar heridas innecesarias a los Pokémon afectados."xGracias por tu participación. ¡Ahora camina con cuidado! No querrías ningún efecto secundario perdurando… je."YUn modelo 3D muestra un maquillaje quimíco basado en el veneno de Tangela de Makya."CDéjame atender a tus Pokémon mientras disfrutas tu victoria."NPerdón por bloquear el camino, pero estoy desesperadamente deshidratado."<¡Tienes una <imp>Agua Fresca</imp>! Voy a tomar eso..."1El hombre toma un Agua Fresca de tu mochila."0Ahhhh.... no sabes como ayuda eso. Gracias."#Considera el cierre terminado."�Los científicos no dejan de ofrecerme líquidos en matraces, pero ya he tenido suficientes problemas con químicos corrosivos como para confiar en los contenidos."aNo puedo dejar mi puesto, así que bloquear la entrada del gimnasio es mi única influencia."YEstaré aquí hasta que un aspirante como tú me consiga una <imp>Agua Fresca</imp>."�Hay un par <imp>máquinas expendedoras</imp> desperdigadas por todo Pueblo Novo, así que debería ser fácil encontrar una botella."2¡Nuestro glorioso Campeón! ¡Buenas tardes!"W¡O días! No me estoy molestando en contar las horas. ¡Eso es para los internos!"fAhora, ¿Por qué estás aquí? ¿Esperando por una revancha? ¿Buscando aprender más sobre mí?"�¡Lo siento! ¡No tengo tiempo! ¡Cero, absolutamente nada! ¡Hay demasiado trabajo que hacer, y para nada puedo contar lo que podría ser!"5Adiós, \PN. Ya tuvimos nuestro último combate."CHabría sido tan genial tener Campana Cura para este gimnasio."9Cometí el error de dejar que mi Skitty lo olvidara."eTendré que visitar el Recuerda Movimientos para que mi Skitty <imp>recuerda</imp> Campana Cura."mSiempre está en el Centro Pokémon de Novo... y en prácticamente cada Centro Pokémon, de algún modo."0Pensé que este gimnasio sería pan comido."S¡Un equipo entero de peces no podía perder contra un gimnasio de tipo Fuego!";Olvidé completamente que Veneno es fuerte contra Agua"@Esta... esta sala de espera no tiene lugares para sentarse."M¿Sin esfuerzo no hay recompensa? Eso es lo que Eko debe estar pensando."k¿Qué, extrañas el golpe de las llamas y la mordida del ácido? ¿Nos batimos en duelo una vez más?"'¡Felicidades en llegar hasta mí!"[¡Y felicidades a todos tus Pokémon! ¡Especialmente a aquellos que están en llamas!"]¡Muéstrame de lo que estás hecho y hazte paso por el dolor! ¡Sólo por un poco más!" ¿Listo para la gran final?"m¡Ve, entonces! ¡Tómate tu tiempo! ¡Consigue un par de antídotos para tus Pokémon, o un matafuegos!"L¡Muy bien, aspirante! ¡Te presento todo el arsenal que puedo manejar!"E¡Todos los otros líderes de gimnasio son cobardes, pero no yo!"Q¡Encantador! No te equivoces: mi panoplia de agonía no va a medias tintas."@¡Te pondré a prueba con fuego y ácido, garra y colmillo!"JDéjame atender a tus Pokémon mientras te regocihjas en tu victoria."X¡Tengo una misión para ti, aspirante! Algo merecedor de tu habilidad, lo prometo."0¡Tu victoria fue deliciosamente explosiva!"4¡Podría encontrarme más aspirantes como tú!"1¡Wow! Estoy sintiendo el fuego – ¿y tú?"Aún no."Por supuesto.;[g"SThere are <imp>vending machines</imp> in all PokéCenters and Ranger Stations."|At the northernmost part of the Shipping Lane there is a house, and inside of that house a cave, and in that cave an Avatar!"Destroy it!"cI’ve been waiting years to find a trainer good enough to eradicate it, and you’re the one!"KThis key will get you inside, and then just, well, do what I would do!"DOh, and be a dear and don’t ask anymore questions. Good luck!"rIt waits in the suspicious house in the Shipping Lane! Destroy it, and rid me of the damnable thing for good!"hOh? Have you sent the avatar back from whence it came?! Excellent! Your talents are second-to-none!"tCongratulations on reaching me! And congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"qShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now! Now, you know the drill."]Do you want to face my standard panoply of agony, or the fullest onslaught I can muster?"SSure! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"6Lovely! Make no mistake: I take no half measures."qI’m gonna test you with fire and acid, claw and fang! Pain will be your teacher, and I will be your judge!"Let us begin!"2Wow! I’m feeling the burn -- how about you?"%I’ll get your Pokémon healed."=That for them, and this for you: the Perseverance Badge!"ZI yearn for the day I might challenge you again! Either here, or in the Championship!"So long!"QI’m so happy you said that! Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"II know that there is only way to test someone: Over! Whelming! PAIN!"Now overcome it, or fall!"UAnd so my team is snuffed out with nary a scratch on yours. A miserable failure."hI always try to leave challengers with a few scars to remember us by, but you were simply too good."@And you’ve certainly earned this: the Perseverance Badge."APerhaps... there is something we absolutely must talk about!"/Something worthy of your skill, I promise."(Let us relocate to the antechamber!",Unyielding! Devastating! Indefatigable!",Not to mention: the Perseverance Badge!"aIf you can overcome my gym in such blazing style, I can surely expect great things from you."GSo long, challenger! I’ll see you again, and that’s a promise!";What, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid?"Shall we duel once more?"2Once more the flames die with you the victor!"$Good! I’ve learned from this!";One day I’ll show you my true power -- you’ll see!"7Good! Good! Never let that fire within you go out!"TYour victory was delightfully explosive! I could use more challengers like you!"nThis is not a lab! It is a gym! In labs we have safety precautions. Here, unsafe conditions are the goal!"LOh-ho? So you want safe passage? Very well. You've earned the shortcut."iThe wild reaches of Makya won't have safety guidelines. If you can endure this, you can endure them."5White text flies by on a dark purple background."Yo, champ in the making!"EEko is the gym leader here, and they love pain in all its forms."@Therefore they picked Fire and Poison as their specialties."iGround-types are rather strong in this gym. Psychic-types and Rock-types are none too shabby either.">The final piece to this gym's puzzle are the teleporters."_See those blue pads? The ones the trainers are protecting will teleport you past the maze."IIf you don't unlock them, you'll find yourself walking a harsh path!"'Grats on beating the gym!"+You pushed through the pain just fine."`I hope you won't find this cruel. The suffering I'm about to inflict is strictly necessary."...Noted. Please avail yourself of this teleporter. Taking the long way may subject any afflicted Pokemon to undue injury."lThank you for your participation. Step carefully, now! Wouldn't want any lingering side effects... heh."JA 3-D model displays the the chemical makeup of Makyan Tangela venom."ALet me tend to your Pokémon while you bask in your victory."@Sorry for blocking the way, but I'm desperately dehydrated.">You have a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>! I'll be taking that..."/The man takes a Fresh Water from your bag."(Ahhhh.... that helps a lot. Thanks." Consider the lockdown over."�The scientists keep offering me liquids in beakers, but I've had too many close calls with caustic chemicals to just trust 'em on the contents."MI can't leave my post, so blocking the gym entrance is my only leverage."_I'm plopping down here until a challenger like yourself grabs me a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>."tThere's a couple <imp>vending machines</imp> scattered around Novo Town, so it should be easy to find a bottle.")Our glorious Champion! Good evening!"cOr morning! I’m not in the business of keeping count of the hours. That’s for the interns!"QNow, why are you here? Hoping for a rematch? Looking to learn more about me?"~Sorry! I’m busy! Drastically, obscenely busy! There is much work to be done, and I absolutely cannot spoil what it might be!"7Goodbye, \PN. We’ve already had our last battle."5Heal Bell would be so nice to have for this gym."1I did a mistake letting my Skitty forget it."VI'll have to visit the Move Maniac so my Skitty can <imp>relearn</imp> Heal Bell."`He's hanging in the Novo PokeCenter.... and in practically every other PokeCenter, somehow.")I thought this gym would be a cinch."EA whole team of fish couldn't possibly lose to a Fire- type gym!":I totally forgot that Poison is strong against Water."CBruh... this waiting room doesn't have any places to sit down."3No pain, no gain? Must be what Eko's thinking."TWhat, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid? Shall we duel once more?"$Congratulations on reaching me!"TAnd congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"XShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now!"(Are you ready for the grand finale?"ZGo on, then! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"PVery well, challenger! I present to you the fullest onslaught I can muster!"3Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"ILovely! Make no mistake: my panoply of agony takes no half measures."7I’ll test you with fire and acid, claw and fang!"@Let me tend to the Pokémon while you bask in your victory."YI’ve got a mission for you, challenger! Something worthy of your skill, I promise."-Your victory was delightfully explosive!"+I could use more challengers like you!"3Wow! I’m feeling the burn – how about you?"Not yet."Of course.000Iu;␀g	[["7Wow! Well done!