 Pokémon son increíbles!"!¡Hora de verlos en acción!"1¡Perforaste justo en medio de mis defensas!"?¿Siquiera existe algo como tener suficiente información?"FAlgunos Pokémon pueden afectar su área alrededor con sencillez."STu efecto parece ser un aura de miedo, basado en lo que estoy sintiendo ahora."4Genial prueba, pero necesito más información."0¡Parece aliviado que ya no esté flotando!"rUno de los científicos me dió un puñado de rocas extrañas, y me dijo que le dieron algunas a mi Mudsdale."[Fiuu. Uno de los científicos fue capaz de revertir los efectos de las Piedras Pómez."¡Crisis evitada!"/¡Lo hiciste genial en ese test, Swadloon!"¡Eres el mejor!")¡Se revuelve, incapaz de sujetarse!",Swadloon mira con amor a su entrenador."RTe ves lo suficientemente habilidoso para participar. ¡Por favor, continúa!"A¿Empiezas un combate doble contra el Entrenador Artificial?"8Habitación de Pruebas de Estrategias para Combates"B¿Empiezas un combate triple contra el Entrenador Artificial?"6Habitación de Pruebas Entrenadores Artificiales."JVerdaderamente, nada dispara mis neuronas más como la programación."¡Y es por esa razón que me embarqué en una misión--construir los entrenadores hechos con inteligencia artificial perfectos!"&¡Te lo ruego, combate con ellos!"jNo hay recompensa que ganar por vencerlos, y tus Pokémon no van a aprender nada de la experiencia..."VPero tanto tú como yo, bueno, ganaremos terabyes de conocimiento sobre combates."CTengo que recordarte--el conocimiento es su propia recompensa."�Si te preocupas sobre la dificultad, ten en cuenta que los combatientes ajustarán sus niveles para coincidir con tu nivel de habilidad."hEstoy seguro que aprenderás mucho de la experiencia de combatir con mis Entrenadores Artificiales."UDe hecho, apuesto a que estos serán una excelente herramienta de entrenamiento.".Mi contrato gubernamental depende de eso."|Si mi proyecto tiene éxito, será implementando en una atracción turísticas que están construyendo en la costa sur."F¿Empezar un combate individual contra Entrenadores Artificiales?"No"Sí;[a"ZSketch is an amazing move! We're still trying to find the limits of Smeargle biology."Help me find it!"4Excellent work! I have all the research I need."Enjoy your day.">I'll need to review this data for a bit, come back later."_Wow! We're supposed to be professionals, but your battling prowess made everyone run away."6You've beaten everyone, so as promised, a reward."fNormally we give out Performance Analyzers here, but since you already have one, I'll upgrade it!".Now, go on and win that championship, hm?"aWith all the work Helena's putting in, she deserves to have a good sport like you as victor."jAh, so you've made it to me. However, it looks like some of my teammember's here remain unchallenged."6Go back and fight them all, then come back to me."`I have no more to offer you, I'm afraid. Your battling data was excellent, so it's a shame."vOne of the scientists here gave me a batch of these weird rocks, and told me to give some of them to my Mudsdale.";I now understand why she said "some" instead of "all"."QI'm not sure what I'm supposed to do except wait until the effect wears off."QHere, I have one more. You should take it, I've done enough damage as it is."SI hope someone comes along soon. Me and my Pokemon are starting to get hungry."THello Trainer, have you been collecting a good number of Pokemon by any chance?"ZLuxTech is sponsoring any Trainers that have amassed a significant number of Pokemon."NOh! It seems like you've already acquired 20% of the Dex. Excellent work."Here is your reward."LIf you manage to acquire 40% of the Dex, I have another reward for you."`When you've collected 20% of all Pokemon in the dex, speak to me again. I'll have a reward."NWonderful, that's 40% of the Dex! You've got quite a collection, Trainer."8As promised, here is compensation for your efforts."BIf you manage 60% completion, I'll have more rewards for you."OIf you manage to acquire 40% of the Dex, I'll have another reward for you."Come speak to me then."JCongratulations, Trainer. You've managed to complete 60% of your Dex.":LuxTech thanks you for your work. Here's your reward."]As you might have guessed, there is another reward for the completion of 80% of the Dex."5Come back when you have achieved that milestone."AIf you manage a 60% completion, I have more rewards for you.""80%! Fantastic work, Trainer."PYou might be one of the few to ever accomplish the feat of 100% completion."GRegardless of whether you do that, I have your 80% reward for you."UWell, if you manage to collect every Pokemon, LuxTech still has payment planned."Best of luck."PI never thought I would see a full Dex completion in my life, to be honest."iI might try to have the higher ups commemorate your accomplishment with a metal plaque or something."&That's it! A full Dex completion!"LAmazing, Trainer! To actually acquire every Pokemon species in Makya..."nOh what science could learn from your collection! The mysteries of Pokemon can be found at your doorstep!"jAs promised, Trainer, your Dex completion reward. I convinced my boss to pay for one of these things."cTruly, you're the envy of all collectors. I wish you the best of luck in whatever you do next."OIf you manage to collect every Pokemon, LuxTech still has payment planned."VI'd love to tell you about what I'm studying, but that might ruin the experiment!"Sorry about the tricks."?It's really hard to repeat this one, but I'll try my best."2The area up ahead is the battle testing site."WIt's where LuxTech scientists observe the capabilities of Pokemon in test battles."ZIt is recommended that you don't participate until you have at least four gym badges."eHowever, if you make it to the end, we do have a reward for you--some tech that no one else has."UParticipate in battles against our scientists, and you may earn a hi-tech prize."|Do be careful though, if you're not yet at the right skill level. Four badges is the threshold our data suggests is optimal."_My dad brings me to work every day after school since I like to watch the Pokemon battles."VYou get to see all sorts of Pokemon here. Sometimes the Trainers let me pet them!",Pokemon defense mechanisms are amazing!" Time to see them in action!"+You pierced right through my defenses!"/Is there ever such a thing as enough data?"<Some Pokemon can affect the area around them with ease."RYour effect seems to be an aura of fear, based on what I'm feeling right now."&Great test, but I need more data."0It looks relieved to no longer be floating!"hOne of the scientists here gave me a batch of weird rocks, and told me to give some to my Mudsdale."ZPhew. One of the scientists was able to help reverse the effects of the Float Stones."Crisis averted!""You aced that test, Swadloon!"You're the best!"0It flounders about, unable to get purchase!"1Swadloon is looking lovingly at its trainer."AYou look skilled enough to participate. Please, go on ahead!";Begin a doubles battle against the Artificial Trainer?"$Strategic Battling Testing Room":Begin a triple battle against the Artificial Trainer?"%Artificial Battlers Testing Room"7Truly, nothing fires my neurons quite like coding."sIt is for this reason that I embarked on my quest--to construct the perfect artificially intelligent trainers!"#I beg you, please battle them!"lThere's no reward to earn by defeating them, and your Pokemon will learn nothing from the experience..."MBut you and I both, well, we'll gain terabytes of wisdom about battling."5Need I remind you--knowledge is it's own reward."|If you're worried about difficulty, note that the battlers automatically adjust their levels to match your skill level."[I am sure you will learn a lot from the experience of battling my Artificial Trainers."DIn fact, I'm betting on these being an excellent training tool."*My government contract depends on it."uIf my project succeeds, it'll be implemented in some tourist attraction they're building off the southern c