ure. Ice forms a mirror that reflects oneself."iLet us combine the two – crater this ice with a duel and see our true identities in the fractures."cNot without me you don’t! I’d rather you hex me than try and perform a reading without me!"2The both of us, against our beloved traveler!"AFine… I’ll hold my horses. But don’t leave us waiting."FGood! Quail before my inner fire, and reveal your soul to my eye!")…You battle with shocking clarity.")Unbowed, even before the both of us."Fascinating…"9These hairline fractures… the ice shrapnel… hmm."%It portends nonsense. Gibberish."?That both of us are dead already, and the same regardless."AAnd look at the scarring around our oh-so-helpful ritualist?"So your name is \PN."[And, what, you will walk backwards? You are a bridge that opposes heroes and villains?"ESomething about nostalgia, but I think you stepped on that part."gNothing of use, then. Not to us, at least. I hope our makeshift augury at least did you some good."aIf not, forgive this flight of fancy wasting your time. Remember: SHE came up with the idea."IHmm… maybe this trip was worth more than that changeling imagines."dIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> of Prizca with naught to do, find me."SI’ll be at the riverside, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Whoa! Is all well?"[Here – I suppose I can spare some supplies. Let us get your team in shape, shall we?"0Go find out if my… companion… is ready.".She requires far more preparation than I."Have you made ready?"DContent beyond this point will be available in a future update!"Why are you here?"Can I help?"...What?"Hold up."Let's go."OIf you ever find yourself in the urban expanse with naught to do, find me.[1"aAsí que eres tú de nuevo. ¿Presumo que mi amuleto del impostor te mantiene con seguridad?"<Mi nombre – nuestro nombre – es <imp>Imogene</imp>."IEl Ditto está por aquí en algún lado, imagino. No puedo perderla."SEstabamos merodeando en Kalos antes de decidir venir a