Nope."Thanks."Help me."I like you too."Take Heatran."Refuse Heatran forever.",Thanks for completing Pokemon Tectonic!"UPlease consider filling out the Playtest Survey that is linked on the main menu."?Your feedback helps a lot to continue to improve the game.Iu;␀RX[[�"Oh, hello."bYou might be able to tell, but a certain Nurse aid in training is feeling a bit wild today..."^This Happiny has been a troublemaker since day one, always trying to battle the patients."SI got an idea. If you can beat it in a battle, it'll demand to join your team."2It'll thrive with a trainer. What do you say?"CI just want to get it off the cliff so we can get out of here."Place feels dangerous."!Wonderful. Give me a second.".HEY! YOU GOT SOMEONE WHO WANTS TO BATTLE!"GET DOWN HERE!"Thanks for that."<As expected, it's practically dying to join your party."DWell, I suppose that's three months of training down the drain."fMake sure that Pokemon gets hurt a lot. It'll have fun doing it, and it keeps our Centers funded."Peace."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."GDragon-type Pokemon often roost towards the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."No"Yes"^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever."wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."Down: Gigalith's Guts"BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain.[�"Oh, hola."gComo puedes observar, una cierta Enfermera en entrenamiento se está sintiendo con energía hoy…"oEste Happiny no ha dejado de causar problemas desde el primer día, no deja de combatir con los pacientes."UTengo una idea. Si puedes vencerla en un combate, demandará unirse a tu equipo."9Estará mucho mejor con un entrenador. ¿Qué dices?"FSólo quiero sacarlo del acantilado así nos podemos ir de aquí."!Este lugar parece peligroso.""Maravilloso. Dame un segundo."1¡HEY! ¡TIENES ALGUIEN QUE QUIERE COMBATIR!"¡VEN AQUÍ!"Gracias por eso."LComo se esperaba, está practicamente muriendo para unirse a tu equipo."FBueno, supongo que esos son tres meses de entrenamiento al caño."}Asegúrate de que el Pokémon se lastime bastante. Se divertirá haciéndolo, y mantiene a nuestros Centros financiados."Adiós."C¿También estás aquí para bailar en la cima de la montaña?"1Me arrepiento de venir aquí vestida así…"9Ojalá Lainie estuviera aquí para bailar conmigo..."R¿No bailarás conmigo? Bueno, seguramente seas muy divertido en las fiestas."AVe, de vuelta a tu escalada o lo que sea que te guste hacer."¿Siquiera tienes hobbies?"W¡El verdadero poder de los tipo Dragón sólo es desbloqueado durante un Eclipse!"AEl único problema es el mío. Le he fallado a mis Pokémon."IDebo regresar a mis pensamientos, y volveré mucho más concentrado."MLos Pokémon tipo Dragón suelen descansar hacia el pico de la montaña."aEscuchar las canciones de un Hymnus es verdaderamente una experiencia de una vez en la vida."No"Sí"l¡\PN! ¡Mi amado! Las montañas enmarcan tu belleza en un modo que sólo puedo describir como sublime."PTe ves como si pudieras destrozarlas a tu alrededor y construirte un trono.";No tienes que hacerlo. Todo lo que necesitas es a mí."~Por supuesto. Siempre tengo tiempo para hablar contigo. Escuchar tu voz armoniosa hace que mis preocupaciones se disipen."2Podemos hablar de lo que sea. Cualquier cosa."P¿Por qué vendrías aquí si no es por mi? Podrías haberte quedado lejos."s¿Que te atrae a mí? Creo que ya sé lo que es. Ambos lo sabemos. Amaría mostrarte lo que realmente sientes."yEres perfecto. Veo todo mi amor reflejado en tus ojos. Es maravilloso. Quiero sostenerte como nada más en el mundo."*Oh, eres adorable. Tan pura criatura."tSí, mi amor. Siempre regalos. Te conseguiré lo que desees, siempre. Vales más que cualquier objeto material.""...Pero eso debe venir luego."_\PN. Tenía planeado proponerte matrimonio aquí. Pero luego fui bendecido por un milagro."}Mi deseo ferviente e inmortal fue hecho real delante de mis ojos. Nuestro amor fue consagrado en los ojos de los cielos."�Sabía que este regalo para nosotros fue para ser usado de sólo un modo. Tú eres como Yezera: hay un idioma que hablas sobre todos los demás."}He sido tan egoísta, usando mis palabras para expresar la maravilla que eres. Debería haber estado hablando tu idioma."�Déjame mostrarte mi amor. Déjame mostrarte la señal que he recibido. Deja que nuestro amor se haga inmortal por este glorioso augurio, brillando en las pasiones de un combate."'Por supuesto, mi amor. Prepárate."4Te amo. Sólo déjame mostrarte cuanto lo hago."5...No dejaré que te escabullas. Eres mío, \PN."}Aún no entiendes a lo que me refiero. Déjame mostrártelo. Déjame abrir tus ojos al amor que te has estado perdiendo."QEsto estaba predestinado. Atestigua el mensaje que me entregaron los cielos."�Me estás haciendo esperar. Mi corazón está latiendo. No puedo esperar más tiempo. ¿Vas a atestiguar ahora este símbolo de nuestro eterno amor?"�¿Lo ves? El hacedor de deseos, ¡Ha venido a concederme mi deseo! ¡La luz de nuestro amor brilla a través de él! Y de ti, como una estrella, ¡Como un avatar!"|Quería a Yezera, y deseaba a los avatares, y todo eso me trajo aquí. Para cortejar a un dios, y hacerte mío para siempre."5¿Acaso no lo ves? Haré cualquier cosa para ti."�Moveré el cielo y la tierra. Te moveré eternamente. Te asfixiaré en compasión y afecto. Llenaré tu vida con confort y placer."�Robaré para ti. Mataré para ti. Acabaré con este mundo para ti, o lo reharé para hacerlo más placentero para ti. Siempre y cuando seas mío."VSiempre y cuando pueda sostenerte, amarte, y saber que eres mío y de nadie más.";¿Necesito ayuda? ¿Eso es todo lo que puedes decirme?"�¡Te amo más de lo que nadie ha amado cualquier cosa! Acaso esperas que lo matenga dentro, ponerme máscaras, ¿Ser... civil al respecto?"�¡Me lleva a la locura no poder abrazarte aquí y ahora! ¡Como debería ser! ¡Todos los demás están ciegos por no ver tu resplandor!"fEres precioso y brillante y divino. ¿Qué logro más grande podría haber más que hacerte mío?"<Nadie podría aspirar a nada mejor, excepto que ser ti."4Lo que haría para ti. ¿Acaso no lo entiendes?"B¿Por qué me rechazarías? ¡Podría hacer tu vida perfecta!"�Haría lo que sea para ti, ¿Y quieres que lo tire a la basura? ¿Sólo porque te pido que me ames de vuelta? ¿No soy digno de eso, después de todo?"U¡Soy amable, y amoroso, y cariñoso, y modesto, Y puedo ver tu verdadero valor!"\¿No debería ser más digno que tu amor que nadie más? ¿Crees que estoy desquiciado?"oTú eres el loco aquí si crees que estarás mejor sin mi. Un hermoso dios loco que rechaza ser ayudado..."M¡No! Te tendré solo. ¡No podría soportar compartirte con nadie más!"fPor favor, ni siquiera lo notarás. Llenaré tus días de alegría. No necesitarás a nadie más."�Si preguntan por ti, si te quieren, me encargaré de ellos. Podrás servirte – a nosotros – o pueden irse. Nuestros días perfectos no necesitan a nadie más."Después de todo, soy el único que siente este amor intenso. Soy el único que conoce lo que realmente eres. Radiante. Divino."5Sí. Por supuesto. ¡Ja! Todo como debería ser."IEl mundo entero está formándose, mi amor. Eres mío. Para siempre."�Amor, he estado trabajando con Yezera para reiniciar el mundo. Planeaba gobernar con ella, y luego planeé hacerlo un paraíso para nosotros dos."�¿Pero ahora? Estás luchando contra Yezera, y con gusto te elegiré a ti sobre ella. Ella ahora no es nada para mi. Tú eres lo único que importa."�¿Qué tal esto? Ve a encargarte de ella y asegúrate que ella nunca nos moleste. Por mientras, estaré haciendo las preparaciones."�Haré a tu vida un sueño. Un maravilloso, idílico, paradisíaco sueño del cual nunca podrás despertar. Ve a hacer lo que mejor se te da."wOh, los planes que tengo. Mi amor, sólo espera. Por favor. No te apures. Aunque... debes tener trabajo que hacer."QOh, por favor, continúa. No me atrevería a quitarte lo que mejor se te da."Necesito tiempo para prepararme, y tú tienes que atar los cabos sueltos. Corta estos hilos. Ya no necesitas a nadie más."M\PN, voy a hacer a tu vida un sueño. Eres un dios... y ahora eres mío."^Estaremos juntos para siempre. Para siempre es sólo el inicio, y soy un hombre paciente."rAsí que continúa. Deshácete de Yezera. ¡Deshácete de todos! Y luego regresa a mi, así puedo sostenerte."bToma. Llévate a Jirachi contigo. Un signo de mi amor inmortal, y de nuestro vínculo divino."STe amo, \PN. Mi regalo para ti es un dios, ¿Qué más podría ser suficiente?"DTómalo, y sé que eres amado. Más que cualquier otra persona."2¿No? Oh, \PN, no tienes que dejarlo conmigo."�Si no es lo suficientemente bueno para ti, te lo compensaré. Lo que sea que desees, lo tendrás. Sólo déjame solucionar los detalles, ¿Está bien?"dEres hermoso. Eres más perfecto de lo que podría expresar con palabras. Eres mío. Todo mío."}Así que continúa. Podemos esta separados por sólo un poco más. Estaré pensando en ti cada segundo que estés lejos."bTengo preparaciones que hacer. Tiempo que apartar, objetos que procurar, gente que... obviar."gNos encontraremos de nuevo. Y luego no nos encontraremos nunca más, porque nunca nos separaremos."5Adiós, \PN. Te amo más que nada en este mundo."!La piedra resuena con poder."WGrabada en su lado hay dos imagenes, un par de esferas que brillan en rojo y azul."+Presentas el Orbe Rojo y el Orbe Azul."$La piedra se activa al tocarla."%¿Me estás dejando? ¿Por qué?"8Iba a crear un mundo perfecto para ti. ¿Sabes eso?"�Yezera quiero un nuevo mundo. No me importa por qué. Me dió el lienzo perfecto. Una tierra antigua, divina. ¡Una era dorada! ¡Y esta nunca terminaría!""La tendría a ella... o a ti."�Serví sus caprichos, ayudándola, combatiendo contra ti, robando los titanes. Y la serviría en el mundo renacido, amarla para siempre."�Pero ahora que brillaste para mi, no pude regresar a ella. Ella palidece en compración. Así que ahora nadie recibirá este amor inagotable."bNunca construiré un nuevo mundo para lo que amo. Y nunca tendré un dios al que llamar mío."8...Bien. Te arrepentirás de esto. Todos lo harán."XTodos morirán con frío y en soledad, marchitándose sin ser amados ni recordados."nPodrías haber estado feliz. Y ahora el fuego arde en ascuas y ceniza. Espero que te atragantes en estas."¡Tú – no!"X¿Por qué me darías esperanza sólo para quitármela? ¿Por qué me harías esto?"<¡Te he venerado! ¡Te he amado! ¡Siempre te he amado!"w¡Los dioses vienen a la tierra, sólo para darme la espalda! ¿Me merezco esto? ¿He fallado en todas las formas?"6¡No! ¡Soy puro, y sagrado! ¡Mi amor es divino!"�¡Muy bien! Si quieres arrojarme a la oscuridad, hazlo. Si mi amor alumbra de forma tan brillante hasta para los cielos, apartenme."fNada puede pararme. No pueden extinguirme. Serás mío eventualmente. Uno de los dioses lo será."yTodo lo que necesito es amar para siempre. Uno será mío, y solo mío. No pararé hasta que tenga uno que mantener."?Te amo. Te amo más que a nada. Y nunca te veré de nuevo."�Quizás nos encontraremos en otra eternidad, cuando mi propio dios que amar y cyudar. Y luego veremos como te arrepentirás de esto."KJirachi parece perturbado. Parece haber juzgado muy mal la situación."VTambién parece arrepentido. Quizás quiere compensártelo, o mantenerte a salvo."FQuizás incluso esta atraído por tus firmes esperanzas y deseos."EEn cualquier caso, parece estar dispuesto a ser atrapado por ti."TComo Skyler fue bendecido por un mítico otorgador de deseos, nunca lo sabrás."�Jirachi parece muy avergonazado y con gusto se deja ser atrapado. Honestamente, parece que sólo quiere olvidar que esto alguna vez ocurrió."tJirachi parece decepcionado. Sospechas que quería que ser atrapado y combatir un poco más como compensación."cPero, al ser un ser inmortal, tiene bastante tiempo para olvidar que esto alguna vez ocurrió."ZSe retira con el viento montañoso. Quizás lo verás de nuvo en estos picos nevados."Quiero hablar.""No es por lo que estoy aquí."#Todo lo que necesito es a tí."¿Más regalos?"Déjame prepararme."Muy bien."¿...No?"Necesitas ayuda."Vete al infierno."$Lo último como que lo arruina."Sí. Déjame ser tuyo."Tomar a Jirachi."%Rechazar a Jirachi para siempre."Atrapar a Jirachi."$Liberar a Jirachi para siempre."nMi mamá me dijo que no venga aquí, pero realmente quería ver lo que es orinar al lado de una montaña."DYa no eh... tengo que orinar. Por ningún motivo en particular."yPensé que orinar en el punto más alto de Makya sería genial, pero no me estoy sintiendo tan liberado como pensé."QMe aterran las alturas, pero me aterra aún más crecer sin crear recuerdos."2Por eso elijo donde orinar con mucho cuidado."Debajo: Tripas de Gigalith"QLos Pokémon de tipo Dragón suelen descansar en la cumbre de esta montaña.;[�"Oh, hello."bYou might be able to tell, but a certain Nurse aid in training is feeling a bit wild today..."^This Happiny has been a troublemaker since day one, always trying to battle the patients."SI got an idea. If you can beat it in a battle, it'll demand to join your team."2It'll thrive with a trainer. What do you say?"CI just want to get it off the cliff so we can get out of here."Place feels dangerous."!Wonderful. Give me a second.".HEY! YOU GOT SOMEONE WHO WANTS TO BATTLE!"GET DOWN HERE!"Thanks for that."<As expected, it's practically dying to join your party."DWell, I suppose that's three months of training down the drain."fMake sure that Pokemon gets hurt a lot. It'll have fun doing it, and it keeps our Centers funded."Peace."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."GDragon-type Pokemon often roost towards the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."No"Yes"^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever."wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."Down: Gigalith's Guts"BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain.Iu;␀�"[[Q"5How d’ya do? Can’t beat the stench out here."USinuses ain’t stung this bad since that shot of Reuniclus liquid came back up."XAh, I don’t get paid to complain, though. This Trubbish is bein’ real stubborn."5Mind lendin’ a hand? The way folks like us do?"=I’m a trainer. Real trainer, too – I train, y’see."]Train people’s Pokémon for money. We had a scuffle back in Novo Town… which ya won."RIf ya wanna know more than that, shame. We got a business relationship, yeah?"Now give me that rematch."Tch. Cold."iWelp, I’ll just park my ass here till this sack o’ trash works up the nerve to get its feet wet."'Get that toxin pumpin’, ya know?"AYou’re one of them reliable sorts, ain’tcha? Disgusting."KAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence ‘round these parts.",Now c’mon, show me your vicious side."<Got a bin liner to train and nobody to keep me company."Mind lendin’ a hand?"IAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence 'round these parts."-Ya see that? I knew you had a mean side."XDownright sadistic. Always good to have a bit o’ your inner psychopath available."EReal ace up your sleeve kinda deal, y’see what I’m sayin’?"@Babyface like you got plenty of room to blindside somebody."<Love to see it happen, love to see ya take it to heart."'You’re a hero. Look at yourself."GBut don’t get pinned down by the role – have some fun with it."+Play the rival a bit, yeah? Be a heel."VAh, nevermind me. Maybe you’re better at playing the hero, through and through."@Me? I’m a rival. I ain’t your rival, but I was a rival."YI wasn’t ever meant for big things, ya know? But I help keep heroes on their toes."MAnd, hell, maybe I have some fun along the way. Make some friends, yeah?"BThose days are behind me, but ya can’t teach me new tricks."9Fightin’ you feels like old times. I 'preciate it."/The name’s <imp>Alessa</imp>, by the by."I'Fraid I can’t chat any longer, though. I’m off to the big city."ASome bigshot CEO’s kid needs his reserves trained up ASAP."5So, see ya 'round. Don’tcha keep me waitin’."4Make sure you check the items that you pick up."IYou might be caught off guard by a Voltorb minding its own business.",I don't think I'm at the right river..."AI guess I'm gonna go for a swim... Please close your eyes..."3This place doesn't look fun to swim through..."!Can I borrow your surfboard?"No? Ok..."Who are you?"	Nah."
