 duty."#Whew, I can't stand up to you."HI get paid a nice bonus for the overtime, so I don't mind too much."CI'll be collecting a nice check at the end of the month, hoho!"*hiss* A challenger?" You chose the right leader."3Ignore the poser and let’s cut to the chase."4You want the badge. I want to style on someone.">And neither of us want you to fight Bence. He’s a bore."9So, you down? Challenge me… or I guess both of us?"/*hiss* Fine. You’ll be back soon enough."Y-you will be back, right?"1You’re not gonna challenge Bence… right?"*hiss* Good."UDon’t take it personally if you get swept, 'kay? I do that to a lot of people."Learned from the best."/Now I’m the teacher… so pay attention."*hiss* Damn.",Well, you won. Flying colors. A+ grade.";Always good to see someone that can keep pace with me."+And isn’t as smug about it as Bence."Take our badge."hAnd since a little bird told me you’ve got friends in high places, put in a good word for me, eh?"1*hiss* I was afraid you were gonna say that."FYou know we were trained by the girl who swept Team Chasm, right?"<A two versus one? Oh, you are NOT going to regret this!"FDo whatever it is you do for luck, 'cause you’re gonna need it!"+Hah. I knew I’d see your face again."(Clear as day. You’re just better.";Humility isn’t my strong suit, but I’m not stupid."/Least, not as stupid as Bence thinks I am."P*hiss* Bence is too much of a square to get involved with anything illegal."And this is. Probably."NOur mentor walked out one day out of the blue. Left us to manage the gym."�But she left behind instructions: if we find someone as good as her, give them this key, tell them to go through the door, and stand back."That’s you."Do it."(Meet me at the shed near the river.">This gym is a mess! How am I expected to battle properly?"DThis whole situation is a disgrace! I'm going to help clean up."-One day they might agree on something..."&I wish I still worked for Lainie."Yo, champ in the making!"=We have two Gym Leaders here on