rocity, paving over the world."<…Perhaps. Pokémon have made their warrens here, too."WThe old died out that the new might live. Not so much erasure, then, but rather…"oIndeed they do. Life has not been extinguished like a match ground underfoot. It has simply undergone a…"ZI lived a great many years in a single-story nest of wood. It was comfortable enough."KAnd yet everywhere I wander I find more wilderness gone. A creeping…"Agree with what?"lWith me? I am not so sure I agree with myself. After all, life thrives here, albeit in different forms."*Evolution? Devolution? Certainly a…"Transformation."TAnd so I find myself here. The wild and untamed has shapeshifted into humanity."2That is what a city is, yes? The human biome?"�So what can I learn from all this? Is this what I am? An expression of humanity? Or is this a fake, too? With the untamed merely putting on a charade?"'Do you believe I’m the real one?"1Thank you. I merely wish to prove it to her."nIt would be a mercy, really – she is living a lie, quite literally. She deserves to be true to herself."
Hmph."I suppose I can’t blame you. My assumption that my counterpart is a Ditto is founded purely on it being the only explanation."JHardly convincing, but I know I am real, and therefore she cannot be."…Ah."\I suggest you simply make up your mind, one way or another. In indecision lies madness."*In truth… sometimes I doubt myself."II remember being a child. I remember living years under my old home."dAnd yet, I cannot remember when she began following me. No more than I can remember being born."Does that make me…"'But nevermind that. I have a gift."WSomething destroyed by its transformation. And yet, it has found strength in that."WI am unsure of what that may imply about my situation, and so I pass it on to you."~Imogene passes you a Poké Ball. Inside is a Galarian Corsola. It seems happy to see you… as much as it can seem happy."XAnother arrow in your quiver. Or perhaps another companion for the long road ahead."4In either case, may it prosper under your care."gSo long, traveler. I will head south, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive."Oh? Very well."�If you find it unsuitable or untenable to take it, I will find someone else. Perhaps the local Pokécenter will take it in the interim.""In any case, I take my leave."gI will head north, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive. So long, traveler."FEast: Battle Plaza\nSouth: Eleig River Crossing, then County Park";Aquatopia offers ocean fishing trips and competitions."2They're the best fishing experience in Makya!"Hey! \PN!"Over here!"5Candy grabs you and pulls you towards the bench."'\PN! I need some help, like, ASAP.";I’ve – wow, I’m out of breath, give me a second."Damn. OK, I’m good."I mean, I’m not good."5I’ve got, like, a total manhunt going on here."pYou’re, like, super-awesome at dueling, right? So – wait, total lightbulb moment. Genius plan incoming."[OK c’mon you really definitely gotta help me out like I’ll give you half the loot?"8You wouldn’t leave me out here, right? By myself?"HNah, you’re cool. You’re a cool person. You’re gonna help me."'I maybe sorta committed a robbery."And breaking and entering."And arson."But it was an accident!"kOK, just the arson was accidental. But I swear I didn’t rob anyone that didn’t totally deserve it." So shut up and help me, OK?";What I’m gonna need you to do is give me some cover."9Duel me? Like, so they just see a fight and move on?"PY’know, like in a movie when they kiss so the bad guys get all flustered?"pI figured you’d be more into, like, fighting me than kissing me. Especially if I, like, healed your team."Y’know. No offense!".Yeah! I knew you’d come through for me!"DReady to see what a real hero fights like? Lead us off, Jeanne!"Wow. I guess that worked."_And you – you’re, like, yep. Totally A+. S+, if you want to be, y’know, kinda extra." Which I am. Kinda cringe…"
