. Take all the time you need."]But you’re not getting any farther until you show me what dirty tricks you’re using."_Oh good. I’ve been looking forward to curbstomping your team since you picked a starter.""Ready to learn some humility?"...I can't believe it."jI spend MONTHS out here, grinding my ass off to get this far, and you traipse in like it’s nothing."3Why are you better? Why are you always better?"6Fine! I guess I’ll see you in the championship."'Watch your back out there, though."9I will get better, and then I’m going to find you."@Zain ever so graciously spared supplies from his Aid Kit..."That was… real close."Such a good try."JBut since I won, I guess that makes you a pretty good place to train."C’mon. One more bout."You’re joking."$You’re not even going to try?"0I can’t believe you’d even consider it."!You -- I can’t believe it."-You really are an asshole, aren’t you?"NYou just want an opportunity to be smugly superior, like you always have."TFigures. The only reason you’re doing this is to get more attention from mom."5Well, go on. See how far that attitude gets you."I’m leaving."1"Prizca, where the future is made concrete.""Business Sector"Gym Sector"Tourism Sector"Bence's House"OHello! Would you be interested in signing a petition to demolish the road?"oThis road currently has no financial benefit to the city ever since the bridge to the south was destroyed."?It's quite an eyesore, and it disrupts pedestrian traffic."Every signature counts.".Are you sure? Prizca only stands to gain!">Thank you so much! You've contributed to Prizca's future."Ah, you again.".Have you changed your mind about signing?"SEventually, we'll get enough signatures that the city's council has to listen."6The city will be much better off for pedestrians."!The door is securely locked."?A sign reads "Entry only to trainers with 8 or more gyms."" Hey, good to see you again!"+Here's the final invention I promised.":You can use it on your Pokemon to change their forms."MI