 place, so feel free to eat some of her food or something before you go."�Kick a vase over. Carve your name in the table. Er – maybe someone else’s name. Yezera’s name! She’d get a kick out of that. Heh."-You see your name carved onto the table."5You see the name "Yezera" carved onto the table."7You see the name "Tamarind" carved onto the table."=A vase filled with flowers sits delicately on the floor.":You could totally smash this thing, if you wanted to."*You decide against smashing the vase."fYou find a garbage bag, put the flowers in it, and swing it against the wall with all your might."RA garbage bag filled with rubble is all that remains of this once proud vase."Don't take the food."Take the food."Don't carve."Carve your name."Carve Yezera's name."Carve Tamarind's name."Good to see you."Damn it, Tamarind."We gonna fight again?"Give me a minute."OK."Use your real team."No, you're right."What do you mean?"We're very different."I hope I'm not."We've met."We're friends."We're rivals."Unfortunately."It's interesting."Get to the point."You had a gift?"Actually, I kinda did."Don't smash."Smash.""Eleig Valet, at your service."%Care to exchange business cards?"%You also spot a can of lemonade.[�"CLa comida de Helena está perfectamente ordenada en la nevera."<Encuentras una rebanada de cheesecake bien empaquetada."'También ves una lata de limonada."*Decides no tomar la comida de Helena."XUsas los cubiertos de la cocina de Helena para comer el cheesecake. Sabe delicioso."1Decides guardar la limonada para más tarde."*Varios caramelos quedan en la nevera."2Decides no tomar más de la comida de Helena.",Te atragantas con los dulces de Helena."CUna vez te llenaste, decides tomar un poco más para después.".La nevera de Helena se ve un poco vacía."DVes un ensalada pre-hecha, sobras de pasta, y un vaso de leche."4Tomas algunos cubiertos de la cocina de Helena."tComes un tercio de la ensalada antes de cambiar a la pasta. Sabe sorprendentemente bien a 