 estoy seguro."¿Estás mejor?"Candy..."Justo."Estás aprendiendo."Eso es genial."¿En serio? ¿Tú?"Golpéala de nuevo por mi."¿Ya no ser un vigilante?"¿Una triste despedida?"¿Un último duelo?"¿Un beso?"¿Una moral forzada?"Casi lo estuve."Por favor vete."Todo es horrible."?¡Pero no he podido encontrar ninguno, asi que combatamos!"U¡COMBATE SOBRE UN TRONCO! ¡COMBATE SOBRE UN TRONCO! ¡COMBATE SOBRE UN TRONCO!"gHas dominado las artes del tronco en tan poco tiempo… ¿Eres un tipo de prodigio de los troncos?"+Nos vemos luego, vaquero del tronco…"`He manejado la fauna aquí por años, ¡Tanto que me he convertido en un Bibarel honorario!"k¡Wow! ¡Ese último movimiento casi acabó con toda la presa! ¡Me pondré de inmediato a arreglarlo!"jOtro día, otro entrenador combatido con fervor en esta nueva presa. ¡Mis Pokémon aman la emoción!"<Este es un buen lugar, debería traer un sillón aquí."oSolía ser un poco más bonito antes de que los Bibarel cortaran los árboles, pero aprecio la compañía." Oeste: Cruce del Río Eleig"Este: Canal del Desierto" Valet Eleig, a tu servicio.",¡YIJA, TODOS ABORDO EL EXPRESO TRONCO!"K¡¿CREES QUE PUEDES ENFRENTARNOS EN UN COMBATE MORTAL SOBRE TRONCOS?!"9¡WOW! ¡Ese fue un excelente combates obre troncos!"G¡Cualquier combatiene sobre troncos es amigo mío, no lo olvides!"%Chico, escuché, eh, los gritos."USupuse que debía quedarme aquí en caso de que hubiera un intento de homicidio."Eso escuché.",No hay problema. Es mi trabajo... creo."...Es justo. Pero no aún.""Eso parece. Mis condolencias."�Em, en caso de lo que te haya dicho te haya molestado, lo siento. Tomaste la decisión correcta. Ella... tiene algunos problemas."|Si realmente quieres pruebas de que realmente lo estoy dando todo para hacer de esta región un mejor lugar, toma esto."NEs un laboratorio donde algunas cosas aparecieron. Nada de ello mi culpa."zencima de todo lo demás, he estado manteniendo monstruos extradimensionales a raya por la amabilidad de mi corazón."En serio."zRealmente quiero lo mejor para este lugar. Espero que una vez hayas visto todo el trabajo que he hecho eso sea obvio."NPero, em, sé que realmente no soy querida ahora mismo, así que me iré.",Chico... tomaste la decisión correcta."|Nos estamos asegurando de que los troncos que fueron envíados río abajo por los Bibarel locales no obstruyan el paso."AEs trabajo honesto, y nos podemos divertir un poco con ello."SBuen combate, Entrenador. Estoy seguro que todo el Estrecho disfrutó ver eso.;[�"Sewage Maintenance"Eleig Boating and Fishing"KOh, so it’s you again. You’ve arrived at a rather fortuitous time."pI’ve caught this pair of Makyan forms and would like some more data – but excuse me. Again, my manners."May I ask your name?"VAh, \PN. I’ve heard that name about. A pleasure to meet you properly this time."=How droll. I suppose I am a stranger, after all, though."`As I was saying: I would like some combat data. You seem to be quite adept at providing it."Shall we?"<Of course. I wouldn’t want the results to be tainted."JAdaptation via vendetta – I’m expecting viciousness. Let’s see."Shall we get down to it?"Highly educational."GIt would seem that both of them have been honed by their vendetta."dFrom what I’ve gleaned in local sources, the Sevipers became Steel-type to fend off Zangoose."nThey managed to drive the local Zangoose populations to extinction, yet even that didn’t stop the feud."cFighting until they died, and then even beyond. The tenacity of the Zangoose is admirable, no?"tThe Zangoose counter-adaptation – the Fighting-type – seems to be a product of their indestructible spirit."GCurious. Could these be the predators the Furrets adapted to beat?"5No, the Psychic type would hurt as much as help."nA mystery for another time. I would like to thank you for your help, but actions speak louder than words."!Take this, from my homeland."5Goodbye. I can’t say where I’ll end up next."rPerhaps the <imp>sewers beneath Prizca</imp>. If any biome might cause new forms to emerge, it would be that."$You got guts and grit, Trainer?",You're gonna need it to get through me!"/Whoa! Now you're a tough-as-nails Trainer!"8I'm gonna have my team walk on coals to toughen up."GI'll join them of course, it's not torture if I have fun doing it."#You're tough, that's for sure.",But are you the toughest? Not sure yet."/Come back later. My Pokemon will be ready."We've toughed out worse."#Eleig Vallet, at your service."%Care to exchange business cards?"2West: Eleig River Crossing East: Canal Desert"This is it!"(The great outdoors! Untamed nature!"%The great outdoors beckon again!"Off! To lands yonder!":And nature remains untamed! Uncaring to our problems!"The air here is so crisp!"^"Did you know that -" Yes! I know! You're not funny! Let me enjoy my fish-puppy in peace!"FC'mon, fish-puppy. Let's go home. I'm done. Don't care anymore..."VWhoo. Got a li'l bit heated there, sorry! People think they're clever, I swear..."CNow that I think about it, I'll just get my dress wet later..."2I've been stationed here to look for avatars."=This place hasn't seen much action, so I'm pretty bored."HI can probably take a break, with Trainers like you walking around."See ya."<Well, they don't pay me to bring my Max Revives home...")I'm tending to my Pokemon right now.".The Saurenaid is humming a pleasant tune."?It's strapped up with multiple cushioned seats for travel."My name is..."You can ask."Not right now."Let's go.""A portent felt, a divination."Chaos freed, eradication."Wishes are a solemn curse."&Left to rot, and they will burst."%A chain of flowers holding fast."#Will it crumble? Will it last?"+Old times renewed, ones you must face."+In lashing out, they find their grace.")Who lies before me? A former knight?".An aspiring champion! What great delight!",I too seek strength with my companions."5We've travelled far, over mountains and canyons!"/But before I focus too much on scansion...",I'll state the reward, a kit expansion!"	Hey."Gettin'... kinda nervous."/Tamarind’s gonna show. I’m sure of it."�Told her to meet me inside. I’ll go around the back, you go in the front, we’ll cut her off, no problems, clean and easy. Capisce?""Great. Like, yeah, of course."You’re my friend, right?"=Oh, yeah, I’m, like, yeah. I’m, like, totally ready."See? Normal Candy!"GDon’t be silly. We’re, like, totally gonna make things better."At least a little bit.";Um, like, good question, but isn’t it kinda obvious?"hLike, she’s gotta confess and tell us what she did, right? And then we’ll bring her to justice!"Y...OK, to be, like, totally honest with you: I’m worried you’re gonna betray me."SBecause she, like, did you a favor and you’re working with her and all that."vBut you won’t. I mean, like, she caused all of this! This entire place is mega-screwed because of what she did!",Eh! No! No talking! I can’t hear you!"}I am one hundred percent not interested in, like, anything you’re saying. I trust you. I trust you, and that’s that."lSo you go in and I’ll scoot ‘round the back, and we’ll do a pincer maneuver, alright? Let’s go!"Um... hey."9So, Tamarind and I, like, kissed and made up? Kinda?"GUm, not in that way. She’s like twenty-five years older than me."@I... \PN, I still really hate her. She is, like, the worst."�She’s this snooty arrogant brat that literally destroys things that get in her way for no reason. But, like, I can’t just punch her and make it better."...But I did punch her."ENot really! It was kind of a wimpy punch. Still, I had to do it."For baby Candy, at least."#I know, I know! It was stupid."VBut, like, I’ve thought about it so many times, and now I finally got to do it."LIt didn’t make me happy, but I can scratch it off the list, y’know?"DOh, not even. She deserves to be punched, like, at least twice."6What? That punching her doesn’t make it better?"hOr that I, like, decked her in the first place? Because the answer is yeah, I’m a learning Candy."HReally, I let her off easy. But, um, I didn’t really let her off."sI kinda... got hired? Like, I do not trust that hag for a second, so I’m gonna stick to her like a Remoraid."OShe’s gonna fix all the messed-up stuff that she and her cronies caused."OAnd she’s, like, totally overworked, so, um... yeah. I’m her aide now!"#And bodyguard. And conscience."WI get to get justice, and she gets to not have her labs be on fire. Everyone wins."@Heh… thanks. I’m, like, not sure of anything right now."VWho knows! Maybe I’ll think better of it tomorrow and firebomb her lab anyways!")Hey! What’s that supposed to mean?"UDo you think I’m just, like, this belligerent ditzy manic Spritzee dream girl?"]No, but, yeah, I get it. I don’t know that I’m, like, super cut out for this either."=Um. I think, like, you can get fired for that? So... no?""Maybe. I’ll think about it."uWell, now if I want to steal someone’s Pokémon back I can just have Tamarind order it, so, like, I guess not?"kI’m still gonna steal things. Let’s all be, like, honest for a second: I’m not changing my ways."MBut I am gonna be busier with other stuff now! So, yeah. There’s that."+Oh, by the way, Tamarind was all like:"�“If you want proof that I’m doing my damnedest to help this region” and then she blabbered about like a secret lab and horrible monsters."�Y’know. Like, containing an extradimensional evil and all that. Anyways, she gave me this key, but I don’t really, like, care?"�Like, sure, whatever, she did hard work. She wants to prove she’s good, she can put her money where her mouth is and prove it by working with me."SAnyways, um… you can have it? Maybe cool stuff? Maybe extradimensional evil?"$Um, anyways, yeah. I, um, yeah."Thanks."1Thanks, like, a lot. You’re a good friend.""But, um, I think that’s it."{I have to go with Tamarind now and make sure she doesn’t, like, kick a child or something on the way back to Prizca.">So, this is goodbye. And, well, you know what that means."E*sniff* Yeah... aww, \PN, we can’t be justice friends anymore."%We’ll just be regular friends."wI’m gonna see you again, I know, but… we had like an arc together! We had an arc, and now it’s over. *sniff*"{Aww, don’t tempt me. But, um, I kinda had my Pokémon tussle with Tamarind back there and they need to rest for now."2Maybe someday? Jeanne wants to kick your ass."MLike, not your Pokémon. You. Sorry! Watch your back out there, I guess."Oh!"GUm, listen, you’re really cute but I’m not really... into you?"PI’m, like, super into the sweep me off my feet romance story kinda thing?"�Like, theoretically if I needed to disguise myself while bad guys were searching and I had someone I could kiss to hide my face. Y’know. Cliche stuff."NBut, um, I’m not, like, into actual relationships? If that makes sense?"5No! We, like, didn’t learn anything from this."We un-learned things."4Listen, we are, like, the dumbest people alive."IThat’s why we’re obsessed with justice and, um, kinda impulsive!"9Mainly me, but you too. I know it. We’re twinsies."-...I’m gonna miss the hell out of you."mI know, I know! I’m not, like, going-going. But, like, it feels that way. And I miss you already. Hug?"KUm... \PN? I’m, not, like, the healthiest person? Like, in the head."^I’ve done some pretty iffy stuff myself because I was, like, well, this is for justice."Like that makes it OK."�So, um, maybe working with Tamarind is a way for me to get justice for myself, too? And, yeah, I could probably use some therapy too."�And I understand if you don’t wanna be my friend after hearing that, but, um, I hope I see you again anyways. I’m gonna make things better."TYou go stop Yezera. Make sure all my hard work doesn’t get, like, undone, OK?"hThank you, \PN. I… I gotta go. But I hope I see you again. Thanks for showing me what justice is."=...Ugh, that was cheesy. I, um, yeah. Love you. Toodles."7You’re cool. You’re, like, my favorite person."HI know you’ve still got, like, a lot of stuff to do, so go do it."`I’ve got stuff to do, too. If Tamarind wasn’t waiting I’d, like, hug you for an hour."jBut, um, gotta go, I guess. You’re... we’ll see each other again? Right? Yeah. Of course we will.")I, um, yeah. Love you. Bye. Toodles!"Capisce."You OK?"Don't know about this."What's your plan?"Of course."Well..."I'm not so sure."Feel better?"Candy..."
Fair."You're learning."That's great."Really? You?"Punch her again for me."No more vigilantism?"A tearful farewell?"A final duel?"A kiss?"A forced moral?"Almost was."Please leave."Everything is awful.">I haven't been able to find any, though, so let's battle!"7LOG RIDE BATTLE! LOG RIDE BATTLE! LOG RIDE BATTLE!"eYou've mastered the ways of the log in such short time... are you some kinda log riding prodigy?"!See you later, log cowboy..."UI've been managing the wildlife here for years, I've become an honorary Bibarel!"aWhoa! That last move almost smashed the whole dam! I'll get right back to work fixing it up!"aAnother day, another trainer recklessly battled on this new dam. My Pokemon love the thrill!"?This is such a nice spot, I should bring a couch out here."kUsed to look a little more pretty before the Biberal cut down the trees, but I appreciate the company."West: Eleig River Crossing"East: Canal Desert""Eleig Valet, at your service."(YEEHAW, ALL ABOARD THE LOG EXPRESS!"=RECKON TO FACE US ON MORTAL, HEARTPOUNDING, LOG COMBAT?!",WOWIE! That was some fine log battling!":Any log rider is a friend o' mine, don'chu forget it!"%Kid, I, uh, heard the screaming."EFigured I ought to stay in case there was an attempted homicide."So I heard."*No problem. It’s my job... I think."...Fair. Not yet, though."!Sounds like it. Condolences."yUm, in case what she said is getting to you, I’m sorry. You made the right choice. She... she’s got some issues."fIf you want some proof that I really am trying my damnedest to make this place better, take this."BIt’s a lab where some stuff went down. None of it my fault."uOn top of everything else, I’ve been keeping extradimensional monsters at bay out of the kindness of my heart."Really."mI do want the best for this place. Hopefully once you see all the work I’ve done that’ll be obvious."KBut, um, I know I’m not really wanted right now, so I’ll be going.")You... you did the right thing, kid."jWe're just making sure that the logs sent downstream by the local Biberal don't clog up the waterway."?It's honest work, and we get to have a little fun with it."RGood battle, Trainer. I'm sure everyone on the Stretch enjoyed watching that.Iu;␀�[[L"South: Ice Cave"West: Highland Lake"East: Eleig River Crossing"MY CROPS! MINE!"HMaybe having a Gengar on my team's been makin' me a tad paranoid..."+Huh? You ain't here to steal my crops?"@Well, I'll be, must have been up in a fuss about somethin'."cI just keep dreaming that someone's gonna up and take every damn plant that ain't bolted down."FThe Skeevy Eevee Pub buys a lotta our products for their cookin'."VMy Pokemon help me ship all of that stuff down the river, and even up the canals."2Woulda blown my back out years ago otherwise."#The snow is such an aesthetic."!My camera's out of memory...""Wanna take a selfie together?"<i> Click <i>"+Hell yeah, that's going the scrapbook.";T-t-t-t-t-his w-w-w-water i-i-s r-r-r-eally c-c-c-old."5G-g-g-onna t-t-t-ake a w-w-warm sh-sh-sh-shower."qI-v-v-v-e h-h-h-eard th-th-that c-c-old w-w-ater i-is g-g-g-g-ood f-f-for y-y-our i-i-i-mmune s-s-s- system."6R-r-racking u-u-up th-th-those T-T-T Ce-Ce-Cells."4This place is just like my favorite video game!"*I'm gonna go play that game now, bye!"(You ever heard of it? Its so comfy!"3That battle was fun, but not as fun as gaming."&Hey, don't just slide on past me!"0The slippery ice makes for a quick getaway!"NI'm not worried about falling into the water. The ice here is rock solid."+Just one wrong move, and its curtains."XWell, its probably not that extreme. The Rangers here are pretty good at their job."No"Yes"What a gorgeous place."/The flowing water, the lushious flowers..."HThe gleam of the sun reflecting off of the pristine snow and ice..."6Makes me wish Lainie were here to see it with me."Whoa, damnit, its cold!"OI must look like an idiot just standing out here without any extra layers."Back to the lodge I go."nThis river rest is a natural perch for mig