rack at 'em gives you a neat little leg up in a way that’s still me doing my job, ya get it?"!So, ya got time for a match?"yI know, I know, I do it every time, but I got debts to pay. We can chat afterwards, if that’s what you’re after."Whaddya say?".I ain’t goin’ nowhere. Drop by, yeah?"8Well, let’s see what your brother’s got for ya."4Back for a li’l sneak peek? Ya damned rascal."9Well, ya took care of that well enough, didn’t ya?"LMaybe Zain’s better than I am. He’s going through gyms, ain’t he?"(I never did have the time for that."_I was working for Chasm back when Yezera and I were fightin’. Then they set up the gyms."YYezera got through 'em like nothin’, but at that point… I wasn’t feelin’ it."tDon’t feel like talkin’ about her too much, though. She’s got enough on her plate without me gossipin’."1Didn’t I just say I wasn’t gonna gossip?"QBut everybody knows it: she went missin’. Couldn’t handle the spotlight."bHell, could barely handle a conversation with most folks. Been like that since she was a tot."(Ya better respect your elders, kid."EI ain’t talked your ear off half as much as my grandpappy did."LYa know you don’t hafta come find me, yeah? I didn’t hunt you down."What, of Yezera’s?"%Best damn friend there ever was."JSure, I was a bully back then, but ain’t nobody bullied her but me."7We fought like Zangoose and Seviper, ya know that?"-But 'nuff said. I gotta get out of town."7Things are 'bout to get messy – I gotta feeling."=So if you end up in the thick of it, keep your guard up."U'Member: slow is smooth, smooth is fast. Make it out of that, then we’ll talk."^Catch ya at that <imp>volcano in Casaba</imp>, yeah? And take this. Better you than Zain."The door is locked."AMy god, this park is so much better than the one at LuxTech."Kantonian-Kalosian Fusion"3Someone seems to have left a note on the sign."<"Now closed indefinitely, thanks for all the memories!""Maybe later."Sure, let's go."No"Yes"So?"Don't train them."Let me fight them."Not now.