 do this."…Yeah. Me too."/Well, here goes. Artemisia, take the lead."ODon’t dive too deep – we’re getting out of here soon. Fend them off.".But if they put up a fight… crush them."?I can't - you make Alessa look like a rand-and-file grunt."8Well. I've gotten what I came for; slowed you down."*I'm... glad to be your rival. Thanks."tI – uhf. I crippled one of their teams, but they got away. They’re good, dammit. And I’m out of practice."�Here – I can heal your Pokémon. Mine are going to need a little care before I’m ready to move out. But you go on ahead. Here.")You’ll use them better than I can."Now go after them." The door is tightly locked."O…Yezera, why would you – oh, \PN. Yeah, I can help heal your Pokémon."GNow go deeper into the catacombs, one of them is still down there."Nobody followed you? Good."-You know those weird caves around Makya?"YDesert with canals like circuit boards, or a mine where steel floor grows naturally."{Those are where the Regis are entombed. They’re Pokémon of incredible power that Team Chasm used to dominate the region."oMy hands ain’t clean on that, either, and now someone’s trying to break out my old bruiser: Regidrago."ZWe don’t know who, and we don’t know why, but that thing was buried for a reason."aBecause Yezera told us to, and because we – I’ll explain later. Time’s of the essence."TYeah, and I’m sorry for not cluing you in earlier, but what’s done is done."GWe need to move, now, if we’re gonna catch whoever’s in there."II can pull some strings, make sure you can catch up to your brother."LAnd if you don’t help, maybe the opposite. So quit whinging and help."kFollow me. If there’s a fight, you take point and I’ll flank. I’m good, but I’m not that good." They’re in the catacombs."aThe door Regidrago’s locked behind should be impenetrable, but… let’s go check it out."Just to make sure."Let me pass."	Why?"What are you doing?"Don't do this."Very well."!I'm looking forward to this."..."This is a lot."Why should I help?"