always looks like he's a breeze away from being caught in the blasts..."DThe avatar crisis is really starting to threaten our wellbeing."nIf it weren't for the Rangers and their volunteers, avatars would probably be causing irreparable damage."7Hey kid, I'm gonna have to ask you to take a seat."&You can ask your questions later."Ma'am if you would!"FAvatars have already destroyed the bridge across the Eleig River."iCoupled with the incident at Velenz, how can people be confident that Makya is a safe place to live?",Are you scheduled to speak later today?"ONo? Then I'm gonna have to ask you to find a spot to watch the conference."[I've lived a life of luxury, in no small part due to my lucrative career as a Trainer.">I managed to get my hands on a few of these Amulet Coins.".They made me a fortune in no time at all."XBut now I have a nice place for myself here. It pays well and it's easy on my body."@I don't really need these anymore, so I'll give one to you."Do well for yourself."*Making enough for yourself out there?"bIt's hard being a career Trainer. You need to make sure you've got your basics taken care of."*An assembly is currently in progress."1Please enter in a quiet and orderly fashion."This place is boring."My mom is boring."6All she does is go to the front and talk all day."HHow is that cool? I already do that all the time for show and tell!",\wuHe's too busy filming to notice you."1Makya is at a critical point in its history."VEither we become a fully fledged region, or we get relegated as merely secondary."mI don't want this place to end up like Orre, dismissed as a third rate region with a fourth rate League.">Makya's Pokemon League has gathered quite a few skeptics."rThe region doesn't have a traditional Elite Four, and Gym Leaders here aren't exactly career Trainers either."vSome especially harsh critics have claimed that the whole thing is simply a front for a rebranding of Team Chasm."2They're right, but not in the way they think."{Obviously I'm biased since I'm former Chasm myself, but I really do think the League here is a real attempt at going legit."CThe connecting tunnel from Sweetrock was blocked by an avatar!";How am I supposed to get my daily shipment of candies?"BI'm the Ranger Captain assigned to the Barren Crater Station."dWe've been helping with the nightmare in Velenz so I figured I'd come here to learn what I can."TI've been gone for a while. I hope my unit is taking advantage of my absence..."JI work here in the capitol building, recording meetings and the like."6But I really want to be a documentary film-maker!"*I have my subject already picked out."4There's this girl who is friends with everyone."5Wherever I go in Makya, I keep hearing her name."Hearing her name."Lainie."..."6...huh? What are you staring at me like that for?")You're creeping me out, I'm leaving."!The door is securely locked."aThe sign lists off rules you have to follow to schedule meetings with Members of Parliament."Capitol Library"The door is locked."1A piece of laminated paper is stuck onto it.")"Closed for deep cleaning", it says."5The predicted date of completion is also listed."MCoincidentally, it's the exact same date as the Championship Tournament."9Perhaps you should come back after that's completed.[D"VFui traído aquí para hablar sobre la mejor forma de combatir la amenaza avatar."No sé cuándo esta conferencia será televisada, pero espero que le salve el pellejo a por lo menos unos cuantos Entrenadores."Habitación de Prensa."Me preocupo por mi nieto.";Él trabaja en el castillo al lado norte de la ciudad."nSiempre termina envuelto con Pokémon peligrosos, y no sólo estoy hablando de los avatares que enfrenta."HSiempre parece que está a un pelo de ser atrapado por un ataque…"MLa crisis avatar está realmente empezando a amenazar nuestro bienestar."vSi no fuera por los rangers y sus voluntarios, los avatares probablemente estarían causando daños irreparables."3Hey chico, voy a pedirte que tomes un asiento.""