Fine."I'd tell you anyways."No."Seems unenforceable."Give me a minute."I'm ready now."That's true."So it was pointless?"Pride is right."Don't beat yourself up.Iu;␀�I[[�"2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around."The door is locked shut."Samorn's House"gThe railway here used to be pretty nice, but it got destroyed when that girl took Team Chasm down."cNo one's ever really gotten to repairing the whole thing, too much hassle for too little gain."LMost of the dirt and heavy equipment are already where they need to be."'"Attention: All Team Chasm Grunts""N"Team Chasm is no longer in operation, and activities here are to cease.""\"Until further notice, this base is now part owned by the scholars of Németh Academy.""1"Your admins thank you for your dedication.""Team Chasm HQ Gym"Leader: Samorn"History and motion."qHey, kiddo. Knew you’d show up sooner or later. You took to training like a Wooper to water, didn’t you?"eHad to work myself to the bone to get here before you and, guess what? Gym leader’s out again."5You waiting for me to throw a Poké Ball at you?"RI’m not gonna. Not about to bruise my team just before challenging the gym."zYes, \PN. I snuck down here and put a sign on the door saying it’s closed after beating the gym, just to trick you."$It’s a flawless plan, really."$Not if you schedule in advance."]Or that’s what I’d like to say – professionalism isn’t in this region’s blood."HDon’t even get me STARTED on that man in the bayou. Insufferable."!In any case, Samorn’s out."]Sign on the door says she’s dealing with some ruckus over at the dig site. You coming?")That’s what I thought. Let’s go."COh, you want to be contrary, do you? Fine. Stay here and wait." The dig site. West of town."pI swear, sometimes you’re more thick-skulled than a Rampardos. Let’s go perform some heroics, shall we?"lYou'd think that Samorn, the gym leader down there, would have issues getting around in her wheelchair."/Especially in difficult terrain like this."aAt first I thought she'd use her dragons to help per down, but apparently that's too akward."�Instead she just has her Runerigus do the heavy lifting. It isn't part of her team, so it gets to relax at home the rest of the day, too."KClosed while Samorn participates in the Makya Championship Tournament."XHey, trying to get Samorn's badge as well? I've tried, but I've had no luck so far."@She uses a Sandstorm team, she sets it using her Towerpoda."JYou might be temped to use an Ice-types and Steel- types against her."fThey're good, but be warned -- her Volcarona and Flygon can both use Fire-type moves to hurt 'em."EHer team's got a few capable sweepers, too: Garchomp and Reavor."DYou got the 8th badge? Damn, that means I gotta get myself one.">I want to at least make it to the Championship this year."..."You kidding me?"Happens a lot."Of course."	Nah."Where?"-Oh! I knew I’d find you here, my hero."3You’re looking particularly ravishing today."MYour gaze is like a summer night... getting me all hot under the collar."BExcuse my directness. I’m getting carried away. Hello, \PN."KStrange days. Strange days indeed! There’s an excitement in the air."<Oh, don’t flatter me. It’ll go straight to my head."cAww, have I upset you? Please, I don’t mean a word of it, if that’s what you want to hear."P...It’s been a long day. I get... flustered after days like these. Sorry."�A certain trainer you may know grabbed me by the collar. Then she told me in detail what she’d do to me if I ever laid my hands on Yezera."gNow, as much as I might like to do exactly that... I haven’t. And won’t. She’s unattainable.";Sorry, sorry. Let me explain myself. As much as I can."tOh, for sure! She’s so appealing because of her reclusiveness. Oh, to rehabilitate her with endless kindness."fWho isn’t? So tremulous, so frail, yet so powerful. Don’t you want to hug her back to health?"qOh, now, yes, of course. Don’t be jealous. You’ve got all her verve and aren’t as... high-maintenance."DYou see, I used to be obsessed with her. It’s why I’m here."nI could be the one to track her down, lure her out like a timid beast. I just wanted to take care of her."~And she was beautiful, of course. I’m not so high- minded as to discount her graceful splendor as part of my reasoning."UBut then I arrived here... and I found you. My attention was caught immediately."|I’m so sorry. I just can’t really contain my feelings any longer. I like you. A lot. And I’d like you to be mine."VShh. It’s OK. You’re confused and surprised and scared, but that’s alright."[What’s life without a little fear? Adds a little color to proceedings, doesn’t it?"8But I assure you my intentions are pure and loving."=Don’t turn me away so easily, \PN. I know I’m a lot."[I come on strong. Well, the incandescence inside my heart leaches out through my body.";I want you, and I want to be yours. I can’t hide it."4Oh, love, how I’ve longed to hear you say it."lYou’re beautiful when you smile, you know that? More gorgeous than an open sky. Deific in your grace."RBut I don’t want you to rush into this. Take your time. We can move slowly."]\PN, I don’t want to be your friend. I don’t know that I even want to be your lover."~I want to be with you. I want you to be mine, forever. I want you to be my crescent moon to illuminate my starless skies."5Here. Take this as a token of my boundless love."pTo show you I’m honest, and that I only want the best for you. This is the true color of my love for you."uLet this gift saturate your soul. Let it dye you with my affections. Let it be the start of our eternal romance."�You’re amazing. Everything I saw in Yezera, in the avatars, even in the myths and legends, are all in you. You’re radiant. I want to bask in that radiance."Think about it."�I’d love you more than anyone else ever could. Go and take care of your material affairs. Your badges and your tournament