ong enough.":My Druddigon and I handle trips down to Samorn's gym.",That service is for civilians, however."/Trainers like you should know their place."fDon't even think about challenging the Dreadnaught until you've aquired every other Makyan badge."2Oh, hello. I see you have some climbing gear."II suppose that means you could go down to the gym on your own power."CI wouldn't recommend it. You still have a lot of growth to do."LYes! You are the proper level of strength to challenge the Dreadnaught."0I'm sure she will be pleased to battle you."0You've bested the Dreadnaught! Well fought."0My congratulations to you and your Pokemon."bAt first I thought she'd use her dragons to help her down, but apparently that's too awkward."Y"Until further notice, this base is now part owned by the scholars of Novo College.""eThey're good, but be warned - her Volcarona and Flygon can both use Fire-type moves to hurt 'em."UI was prepped for countering a Sandstorm strategy, based on the legends I heard."tBut she apparently hasn't used that strategy in forever, despite how well suited to it some of her Pokemon are."NMaybe it's a "hiding your true power level" thing? I just don't get it...[�"2Un papel suelto mostrando el logo de LuxTech."JTe estás yendo – oh. Tú – estás buscando por algo allí abajo."(Vuelve y, eh, estaré… por aquí."La puerta está bloqueada."Casa de Samorn"pLa vía férrea aquí solía estar bastante bien, pero fue destruida cuando esa chica tumbó al Team Chasm."eNadie realmente se ha puesto a repararla por completo, demasiado esfuerzo por muy poca ganancia."NLa mayoría de la tierra y equipamiento pesado ya están donde deberían."9“Atención: A todos los Reclutas del Team Chasm”"V“El Team Chasm ya no está en operación, y toda actividad aquí debe cesar.”"^“Hasta nuevo aviso, esta base ahora pertenece a los estudiantes de la Academia Novo.”"8“Los administradores agradecen su dedicación.”"!Gimnasio de la Guarida Chasm"Líder: Samorn"Historia y moción."qHey, chico. Sabía que 