ed here?"0OK, sorry, I get it. You’re confused too.">Phione was acting strange – standoffish, kinda hostile."LThen it lashed out at me and bolted. I’ve been hunting it since then."BIt looks OK now… you couldn’t’ve KO’d it any gentler?"kAh, it’s alright. No major scrapes or bruises – it’ll be fine. Just need to do some first aid…"I get that, but c’mon."XIt’s obviously – I don’t know, possessed or something. Messed up in the head.">It’s not too bruised. Just need to do some first aid…"*Well… yeah. Sure. It’s an avatar."XDon’t pull your punches. Well, no harm no foul. Just need to do some first aid…"VInsane. Complete insanity. It attacked me, turned into an avatar, attacked you…"8What would’ve happened if you hadn’t beaten it?"qAh, no use thinking about it. I just… I feel terrible. I feel just awful, because honestly I’m relieved."WBecause if it wasn’t an avatar, then it just left. It just left me. It hated me."MYeah. Because at least it didn’t really hate me. It didn’t leave me."nIt’s hard. I was so afraid that it’d just left me that anything else is, like, a breath of fresh air."ZWell… we’ll see. Hopefully it’ll wake up and this’ll all be a distant memory."(Something we can laugh about, yeah?"0And… damn, I keep bringing you into this?"6You gotta bail me outta everything. Well, thanks."gHere. I’ve had these for a while, but I don’t really need them now. For one reason or another."/Doesn’t really make us even, but thanks."UI need to get Phione somewhere safer, but I’ll see you. Thanks for everything."BHave you seen my new avatar defense technique? Pokésand, go!"0Hmm, back to the drawing board on this one."ZThe technique is for avatars, not Trainers. I can't expect it to work perfectly here."$Huh? Weather wars? What's that?"North: Cave of Hatching"East: Frostflow Farms" The berry plant is growing."	Huh."CA Pokemon world, and within every battle, a world of struggle."CHow much can I fit, into a haiku format? I'm running out of..."JA loud crashing lake, Chatot chirp in the distance, they sing united."FI write, erase, rewrite. Erase again, and then, my Ditto changes."QYou can barely make out the outline of a cave entrance behind the waterfall."Heya, Trainer!"LI heard that a Champion was going to be here, but I coulnd't find them."nI even brought a Krabby to throw at them and everything! I stole it from a Ranger when he wasn't looking."RIf I can't throw it at someone important, I'll sell it to get some ice cream!"0$5000! That'll get me ice cream for a week!"AYou're lucky you're a nobody, otherwise I'd throw it at you."Done deal Trainer!"&\PN hands over $5000 in exchange."&Maybe I'll get chocolate today...",Haha, you're poor! That's really funny!"/Minior seems to have taken quite the fall."=Was it running from something scary in the stratosphere?"JIt probably isn't going anywhere for now. Perhaps you could catch it?"'Would you like to use a Poke Ball?"[After a fall like that, if you tried to catch it, it probably wouldn't put up a fight."+You'll leave the Pokemon here for now."CWhen you hold the Pokéball up, the Minior makes no movements."8After a few seconds, you catch it without any fuss."+You don't have a Poke Ball to give it."It was an avatar."You're here?"You're asking me?"Sorry."It was attacking me."Could've. Didn't."	Why?"That it was possessed?"Don't beat yourself up."No thanks."I'll take it."No"Yes"?I heard the Cave of Hatching has a lot of strong trainers."I wonder how you stack up?"yThey say recently Wild Pokemon in the Cave of Hatching have been carving the stones into these beautiful egg shapes!"!I have to see it for myself!"*Look at this pretty egg-shaped stone!"BMy friend got it from the Cave of Hatching and gave it to me!"FSheeeeeeesh, let's get a looksie at this this little Trainer now!"YWell butter my butt and call me a biscuit, this here Trainer's got us slapped silly!"eWhat a howdown from our Trainer friend here. Bet they got one o' those fancy candy thingamajigs."mWell I ain't never seen a scrap like that since before my pa started herding Tauros with his bare hands."3Real shame what happened to his favorite knee."..."You're cheating, right?"EI'm just here to play my guitar. No idea who the other guy is..."BMy Pokemon love the trees and grass. They also love battling!"8What's that, my Pokemon? You want to go to the pub?"6I have no choice, I must listen to them. Bye bye!"_Good battling! You should fight my brother, too. He's all the way at the end of the river."<Welp, I'll have to abandon my Cave of Hatching visit..."LThe entrance is blocked, and I stupidly didn't bring any climbing gear."5If I did, I could have climbed around, but alas."1All I wanted was to experience the legend..."4Take this item, I'm clearly not worthy of it..."=Hey! It's uh... the guy you saw near the Regice Chamber."CI think I got a decent understanding of what's happened to me."XWhatever I was, it kept me separated from the world for a while. A lot has changed."BTeam Chasm is done. People have moved on, though not totally."�Rangers got me set up good. I have a lot of old friends that thought I was dead. They were more than happy to help me when I showed up."�In a way, Hoopa really did help me. Got to skip out on some of the rough parts of Team Chasm breaking up, and I'm taken care of."nI'm... ok. In a weird way. But that's life for ya, huh? It's all weird, and then it isn't. And you're ok."'That's life. Weird, but you're ok."%That's a nice feeling, you know?"�How are you... here? This isn't even the right map... I don't actually exist. Sort of, at least... Please... don't cheat when we fight..."Stop that"TWell golly me we got a cheater! Looks like they did a little bit of hackerooni.[r""¿Intentas forzar tu entrada?",¡Phione! ¡\PN! ¿Qué acaba de pasar?"\¿Qué? ¿Pueden hacer eso? Osea, ¿Phione se CONVIRTIÓ en un avatar? ¡Eso es insano!"-¡He estado buscando a Phione por horas!"V¿Y cuando finalmente lo hago está combatiendo contra ti como un maldito avatar?"X¡Sí! ¿Que harías tu? Osea – no te estoy culpando, ¿Pero qué ocurrió aquí?"4Ok, perdón, entiendo. También estás confuso."?Phione estaba actuando extraño – distante, algo hostil."DLuego me atacó y salió huyendo. Lo he buscado desde entonces."SAhora parece estar bien… ¿No podrías haberlo tumbado de forma más gentil?"sAh, está bien. Ninguna herida mayor – estará bien. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"Lo entiendo, pero vamos."MEstá obviamente – no sé, poseído o algo. Algo le pasa en su cabeza."ZNo está demasiado lastimado. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"(Bueno… sí. Seguro. Es un avatar."}No te andes con chiquitas. Bueno, si no hay daño no hay maldad. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"TInsano. Insanidad absoluta. Me atacó, se convirtió en un avatar, te atacó…"5¿Qué habría pasado si no lo hubieras vencido?"~Ah, no vale la pena pensar sobre ello. Yo sólo… me siento terrible. Me siento terrible, porque honestamente estoy aliviado."TPorque si no era un avatar, entonces sólo me dejó. Sólo me dejó. Me odiaba."=Seh. Porque entonces al menos no me odiaba. No me dejó."vEs díficil. Tenía tanto miedo de que me dejaría que cualquier otra cosa es, como, una bocanada de aire fresco."[Bueno… ya veremos. Con suerte se despertará y todo esto será una memoria distante.",¿Algo de lo que nos podemos reír, eh?"8Y… maldita sea, ¿Continúo arrastrandote a esto?"/Vas a rescatarme de todas. Bueno, gracias."_Ten. He tenido estas por un tiempo, pero realmente no las necesito. Por una razón u otra."/No nos llega a poner a mano, pero gracias."ZNecesito llevar a Phione a algún lugar más seguro, pero te veré. Gracias por todo."Q¿Has visto mi nueva técnica de defensa para avatares? ¡Vamos, pokéarena!".Hmm, vuelvo al punto de partida con esto."lLa técnica es para los avatares, no Entrenadores. No puedo esperar a que funcione perfectamente aquí."-¿Eh? ¿Guerra de climas? ¿Qué es eso?"Norte: Cueva del Albor"Este: Granjas Escarcha"(El árbol de bayas está creciendo."	Huh."8Mundo Pokémon, y en cada combate, mundo de luchas."7¿Puedo colocar, todo en un haiku? Me quedo sin…"SUn fuerte lago estruendoso, Chatot pían en la distancia, cantan al mismo son."JEscribo, borro, reescribo. Vuelvo a borrar, y luego, mi Ditto cambia."TPuedes apenas ver el contorno de la entrada de una cueva detrás de la cascada."¡Hey, Entrenador!"KEscuché que un Campeón iba a estar aquí, pero no lo pude encontrar."d¡Incluso trajé un Krabby para tirarle y todo! Lo robé de un Ranger cuando no estaba mirando."[Si no puedo tirarlo a alguien importante, ¡Lo venderé para conseguir algo de helado!"9¡$5000! ¡Eso me conseguirá helado por una semana!"FTienes suerte de que eres un don nadie, si no te lo tiraría a ti"¡Trato hecho Entrenador!"\PN paga los $5000.")Quizás conseguiré chocolate hoy…"1¡Jaja, eres pobre! ¡Eso es tan divertido!!"2Minior parece haber tomado una fuerte caída.";¿Estaba huyendo de algo aterrador en la estratosfera?"PProbablemente no se va a ir ningdn lado hora. ¿Quizás podrías atraparlo?"(¿Te gustaría usar una Poké Ball?"XLuego de una caída así, si intentaras atraparlo, probablemente no se resistiría."'Dejas al Pokémon aquí por ahora."HCuando agarras la Poké Ball, el Minior no hace ningún movimiento."BLuego de un par de segundos, lo atrapas sin ningún problema.")No tienes una Poké Ball para darle."Era un avatar."¿Tú estás aquí?"¿Me estás preguntando?"Lo siento."Me estaba atacando."Podría. No lo hice."¿Por qué?"¿Estaba siendo poseído?"No te mortifiques."No gracias."Lo tomaré."No"Sí"NEscuché que la Cueva del Albor tiene un montón de entrenadores fuertes."¿Estás tú a la altura?"�¡Dicen que recientente los Pokémon salvajes de la Cueva del Albor empezaron a tallar las rocas para que tengan unas maravillosas formas de huevo!"%¡Tengo que ir a verlo yo misma!"6¡Mira a esta preciosa piedra con forma de huevo!"D¡Mi amigo la consiguió en la Cueva del Albor y me la regaló!"?Ojoooooo, ¡Veamos a este pequeño entrenador ahora mismo!"SBueno, llámenme lo que 