ive them to me, and I will hatch them."5Don't worry--I shall then hand them over to you."=It's an honor just to bring more Dragons into the world."=Would you be willing to entrust me with any Dragon eggs?"6Once born, I will hand the hatchling over to you."I shall be patient, then.">To find more Dragon eggs, look for abandoned dragon dens."BA small hole at the base of a rock wall signals the entrance."HA page is open about a particular subspecies of Exeggutor in Alola.")Oh, \PN! How nice of you to drop by."OI have some water just about to boil – how about something hot to drink?";…Well, I suppose I ought to do some work eventually."xPlease, come back whenever you’d like. My door is always open, if you need a hot drink or to share your troubles."�I can only promise results on problems that can be solved by early Makyan archaeology or a Garchomp… but that’s most problems."Hah! I’ll see you, \PN."No"Yes"8I have contemplated whether to share this with you.")My decision is that indeed I should."]I come from a line of monks who cultivate a harmonious existence on the Isle of Dragons."pThe island is a haven for 7 different lines of Dragons, serving to protect them from the greed of trainers."XYou have shown a love for all of these Dragons, and thus have earned my confidence."]You have endured many hardships in service of Makya, and thus have earned my confidence."LSo I will share with you a secret: the location of the Isle of Dragons."PThere is one in our group who can ferry you there immediately, if you wish."=Would you like to be brought to the Isle of Dragons now?"Follow me."JI'm sure you will be capable of reaching the Isle with your own boat."+May the winds be good on your journey.")Greetings, fellow Master of Dragons."6Do you have more eggs which you wish me to hatch?"?I won't say there exists such a thing as too many dragons."\But it is indeed possible to reach a state where one no longer feels the need for more."2You find nothing within the wooden trash can.">The bed, despite its large size, has been made with care."A stack of documents."\The topmost details the time and heating requirements for multiple Dragon-type species."1Hello, \PN! It’s so good to see you again."SI can’t talk for long, I’m afraid. I’m getting a paper ready to publish."pIt’s my first non-archaeological work – I’m tackling the age-old question of “what’s a Dragon?”"PIs Charizard a Dragon? What about Milotic? Or certain Exeggutor subspecies?"pTo put my findings succinctly, the only way to tell if something’s a Dragon is to hit it with an Outrage."8That, um, tends to solve the debate rather quickly."Yes, please."No, I'll go myself.".A huge variety of books line the shelves."RA colorful tome stands out: "Fairy Tales of the East." It looks heavily worn."MSamorne is in the other room, if you'd like to discuss matters with her."...hm? Who am I?"'Simply call me the Dragon Hatcher.[;"9Si buscas a Samorn, lamento decir que está ausente.">¿Pero quizás me buscabas a mí, al Criador de Dragones?"�He criado cada una de las especies de Dragones que pueden ser encontrados en este mundo–algunos para el equipo de mi querida esposa."_Si te encuentras con algún Huevo de Dragón en tu aventura, asegúrate de hablar conmigo."#Dámelo a mí, y lo incubaré.")No te preocupes–te los daré a ti.">Es un honor simplemente traer más Dragones a este mundo."<¿Estás dispuesto a confiarme con un Huevo de Dragón?"%Una vez nato, te daré la cría."Seré paciente, entonces."SPara encontrar más huevos de Dragón, busca por nidos de dragón abandonados."JUn pequeño hueco en la base de una pared de roca señala la entrada."XUna página ya abierta habla sobre una supespecie particular de Exeggutor en Alola."*Oh, ¡\PN! Que gusto verte por aquí."RTengo un poco de agua a punto de hervir – ¿Te apetece una bebida caliente?"D…Bueno, supongo que debo hacer algo de trabajo eventualmente."�Por favor, regresa cuando quieras. Mi puerta siempre está abierta, ya sea que necesites una bebida caliente o compartir tus problemas."�Sólo puedo prometer resultados en problemas que puedan ser resueltos por arqueología de Makya antigua o un Garchomp… pero esos son la mayoría de problemas."¡Ja! Te veré luego, \PN."No"Sí"5He contemplado en sí compartir esto contigo no.",Mi decisión es que en efecto debería."cVengo de un linaje de monjes que cultivan una armoniosa existencia en la Isla de los Dragones."}La isla es un refugio para 7 diferentes familias de Dragones, sirviendo para protegerlos de la avaricia de entrenadores."`Has demostrado un amor por todos estos Dragones, y por lo tanto te has ganado mi confianza."gHas soportado varias adversidades en servicio de Makya, y por lo tanto te has ganado mi confianza."RPor lo tanto te compartiré un secreto: la ubicación de la Isla de Dragones."XHay alguien en nuestro grupo que puede llevarte allí inmediatamentem si lo deseas."H¿Te gustaría que te lleven a la Isla de los Dragones ahora mismo?"Sígueme."JEstoy seguro que serás capaz de llegar a la Isla con tu propio bote.")Te deseo toda la suerte en tu viaje."&Saludos, maestro de los Dragones."-¿Tienes más huevos que deseas incubar?"ANo voy a decir que existe tal cosa como demasiados dragones."XPero sí es posible llegar a un estado donde uno ya no sienta la necesidad de más."<No encuentras nada dentro del cubo de basuro de madera."<La cama, a pesar de su gran tamaño, está bien armada."Una pila de documentos."�Los detalles de los que se encuentran en la parte superior detallan el tiempo y requisitos de calor para múltiples especies de tipo Dragón."*¡Hola, \PN! Es bueno verte de nuevo."aMe temo que no puedo hablar por mucho tiempo. Estoy preparando un artículo para publicarlo."mEs mi primer trabajo no-arqueológico –  es sobre la milenaria pregunta de “¿Qué es un Dragón?”"P¿Es Charizard un Dragón? ¿Y Milotic? ¿O cierta subespecie de Exeggutor?"|Para explicar brevemente mis hallazgos, la única manera de decir si algo es un Dragón o no es atacarlo con un Enfado.":Eso, em, suele acabar con el debate bastante rápido."Sí, por favor."No, iré por mi cuenta."<Puedes ver una gran variedad de libros en los estantes."`Un tomo colorido te llama la atención: "Cuentos de Hadas del Este." Parece muy desgastado."TSamorn está en la otra habitación, si hay algo que quieres discutir con ella."¿...hm? ¿Quién soy?"2Simplemente llámame el Incubador de Dragones;[;"HIf you were looking for Samorn, I regret to say that she is absent."=But perhaps you were looking for me, the Dragon Hatcher?"gI have raised every species of Dragon which can be found in this world--some for dear wife's team."RIf you stumble across any Dragon Eggs on your journey, be sure to talk to me.",Give them to me, and I will hatch them."5Don't worry--I shall then hand them over to you."=It's an honor just to bring more Dragons into the world."=Would you be willing to entrust me with any Dragon eggs?"6Once born, I will hand the hatchling over to you."I shall be patient, then.">To find more Dragon eggs, look for abandoned dragon dens."BA small hole at the base of a rock wall signals the entrance."HA page is open about a particular subspecies of Exeggutor in Alola.")Oh, \PN! How nice of you to drop by."OI have some water just about to boil – how about something hot to drink?";…Well, I suppose I ought to do some work eventually."xPlease, come back whenever you’d like. My door is always open, if you need a hot drink or to share your troubles."�I can only promise results on problems that can be solved by early Makyan archaeology or a Garchomp… but that’s most problems."Hah! I’ll see you, \PN."No"Yes"8I have contemplated whether to share this with you.")My decision is that indeed I should."]I come from a line of monks who cultivate a harmonious existence on the Isle of Dragons."pThe island is a haven for 7 different lines of Dragons, serving to protect them from the greed of trainers."XYou have shown a love for all of these Dragons, and thus have earned my confidence."]You have endured many hardships in service of Makya, and thus have earned my confidence."LSo I will share with you a secret: the location of the Isle of Dragons."PThere is one in our group who can ferry you there immediately, if you wish."=Would you like to be brought to the Isle of Dragons now?"Follow me."JI'm sure you will be capable of reaching the Isle with your own boat."+May the winds be good on your journey.")Greetings, fellow Master of Dragons."6Do you have more eggs which you wish me to hatch?"?I won't say there exists such a thing as too many dragons."\But it is indeed possible to reach a state where one no longer feels the need for more."2You find nothing within the wooden trash can.">The bed, despite its large size, has been made with care."A stack of documents."\The topmost details the time and heating requirements for multiple Dragon-type species."1Hello, \PN! It’s so good to see you again."SI can’t talk for long, I’m afraid. I’m getting a paper ready to publish."pIt’s my first non-archaeological work – I’m tackling the age-old question of “what’s a Dragon?”"PIs Charizard a Dragon? What about Milotic? Or certain Exeggutor subspecies?"pTo put my findings succinctly, the only way to tell if something’s a Dragon is to hit it with an Outrage."8That, um, tends to solve the debate rather quickly."Yes, please."No, I'll go myself.".A huge variety of books line the shelves."RA colorful tome stands out: "Fairy Tales of the East." It looks heavily worn."MSamorne is in the other room, if you'd like to discuss matters with her."...hm? Who am I?"'Simply call me the Dragon Hatcher.00Iu;␀H[[$"HOh. Hello. You’ve caught me at the absolute worst time, you know?";I’m technically breaking and entering at the moment.">This used to be a cozy little restaurant run by a friend."yShe bought the place, remodeled it so she could cook on the first floor and live on the second, and now it’s this."Empty."sOh, it’s not so bad. Everything has its season, and in Makya it’s barely summer a day before winter comes.""Constant tumult, this region."DI didn’t believe it at first. That she’d just up and leave."RI figured I was always welcome here anyways, and I know my way around a lock."Eternally, my savior."`And if that flattery isn’t enough for you, I WAS trying to find another way to repay you."HUnfortunately, dinner seems to be off the table… no pun intended."QCan you feel that, though? The stillness? I think we’re here for a reason."dLet’s look upstairs. You first, though – something’s off, and you’re the brave warrior."iNot that I want you putting yourself in harm’s way on my behalf… but it would be rather gallant."8Oh? I’ll refrain from reading too much into that.":What I’m worried about is something a bit less fun."TLet’s check upstairs, and be ready. You might end up having to save me again."Am I really that one-note?"]I’ll have to try and be more creative in the future – I can’t stand being cliché."QTo answer your question: I hope not, but there’s only one way to find out."8Shall we look upstairs? At your leisure, of course."fOh, no. I’m not going up there first. You’re the bold and brash one between us, aren’t you?"I'm sorry."Why are you here?"You owe me."	Huh?"So do I."Avatar?"=A tattered page of customer reviews hangs from the wall."JOne attributed to someone named "Oriel" is particularly enthusiastic.[$"=Oh. Hola. Me hablas en el peor momento posible, ¿Sabes?"GTécnicamente estoy cometiendo allanamiento de morada ahora mismo."KEste solía ser un cómodo restaurante pequeño operado por una amiga."xElla compró el lugar, lo remodeló para poder cocinar en el primer piso y vivir en el segundo, y ahora está así."Vacío."zOh, no es tan malo. Todo tiene su temporada, y en Makya es meramente verano un día antes de la llegada del invierno."(Un tumulto constante, esta región."DNo lo podía creer al inicio. De que ella simplemente se fuera."cSupuse que siempre sería bienvenido aquí de todos modos, y sé cómo atravesar la cerradura."Eternamente, mi salvador."kY si es