ed around these parts was a tragedy."SPerhaps a harsh reminder that adventures are not always sunshine and rainbows."<Watch where yer steppin' kid. This is holy ground here."CThis is the first route ever graced by Mayka's first champion."BFirst-rate Trainers gather here as a proving ground of sorts."NIf you're trying to head to Whitebloom, good luck getting through it all."	Hey!"Hey hey hey hey!"NOK, so, like, I know what you’re thinking: "Wow, Candy, you’re, like,"�super-cool for hanging out in such a super-cool place full of dangerous trainers." And, uh, yeah, thank you for noticing, I totally am.":But I’ve got a reason, and it’s not even illegal!"�So, apparently Tamarind shows up in Whitebloom Town every few months to like check in or whatever, and I just did a li'l recon and..."0OK, maybe it was actually a little illegal."wNo, shh, I can feel you, like, being judgy right now, and I totally don’t need that energy in my life right now."HBecause she’s the second-in-command of all Team Chasm! Like, duh!"�She’s probably at the top of my hit list – I kinda forgot where I put it and now I can’t find it anymore but it’s almost 100 percent got her name in"big letters at the top!"bUgh, I can’t believe how on the same wavelength we are. You are like my buddy cop soulmate."1Oh, uh, yeah, sorry, hi, love you too. Cool?"4Cool. Let’s talk about the interesting stuff!"�So, I broke into the abandoned lab and rooted around in there – which, it’s like mega-abandoned and super unsafe but, um, who cares – and found these."�Um, which is the part where I’d show you the stuff I’d found but I kinda shoved it in my backpack and that place is a total mess."@So, uh, instead of digging it out, just take my word on it!"~It’s this like dossier on a whole bunch of old Team Chasm operations that Tamarind must’ve left in there and forgot about!";Oh, all kinds of stuff with these, like, killer names."�Like “Operation Vagabond Plumage” or “Operation Cardinal Sin” or “Project Theodicy.” It gives me happy chills just thinking about it!"{Yeah, but she’s like totally on that grindset 24/7 with running ex-Chasm stuff plus Professor work plus bureaucracy."LI knew she had to slip up eventually! Can’t just chug coffee forever!"What? No! No way!"0OK, wait, like, maybe that’s a good idea?"wLike, if I’ve already got everything I need to know, I can totally get her to lower her guard by giving it back.".Anyways, the main thing I actually, like,"�care about is \nthis after-action report for something called “Project Testament.” Y’know how Velenz is, like, this total ghost town?"wWell if I’m reading this right – and I had to look up a few words but I think I am – Team Chasm caused that!"�They found some way to make avatars show up and secretly made them swarm the town, ‘cause apparently Velenz was super-resistant to helping."�Then they, like, intentionally lured avatars into the caves around there to mess up the foundations, and the whole thing started to sink into the mud!""Seriously, it’s screwed-up!"sYeah! Like, this is the stuff Team Chasm did, and people are still, like, totally OK with them running around!"`Um... not completely sure, but I’m absolutely certain they did some evil stuff there, OK?"iI don’t know how they did it, or if the whole, uh, what was it called... “soil liquefication?”"`Yeah, I dunno if that was intentional or not, but the report is pretty damn happy about it!"nI mean, like, kinda? The report doesn’t really get into the hows or whys that much, but, like, c’mon!"QIf you don’t like these people, just, like, fight them? This is messed up."No!"No, no, no. No talking."�I know you’re friends with Tamarind, and, like, yeah, she did you a favor, and she’s cool. But this lady has done some evil stuff."FI’ve got a plan to confront her, and I want your help, alright?"�Once the tournament is about to start, pretty much everybody is gonna be there, so there’s gonna be way less goons just out and about."�I’ll send her an anonymous li’l letter – ooh, I can cut up the dossiers for letters and glue them together! That’s awesome!"�Anyways, yeah, send her a letter, tell her to come to the <imp>sewer maintenance building on the river banks</imp>. She’ll be there."-Then you and me – we get some justice."rAlright? Alright! Great, cool, not gonna let you respond to that because honestly you can’t change my mind!"jYou’re my friend and partner in crime and definitely not the minion of an evil mastermind! Toodles!"Candy..."Why Tamarind?"Cool. What'd you find?"Good to see you too."Like what?"Sloppy."Give it back."That's... horrible."Are you sure?"Impressive."I gotta talk to Tamarind."HELP ME, LAINIE! HELP ME!"aBestie, it's time to invest in our stocks while they're low. We're accepting bestie buyouts!"JTime to cash in on the best bonds... get my bestie estate in order..."7Maybe it's time to invest in you stocks instead..."$Bestie, are you cheating? No..."gGood work bestie, we'll be rolling in bestie bucks if we invest in your bestie business right now."GBestie stocks are crashing now that they're a confirmed cheater..."<I wonder if we're eligable for a bestie rebate, bestie."6You're our bestie now, of course. Battle besties.".You... you're that Mavis kid, aren't you."ZPfft, some wannabe aristocrat you are. Old money? You don't even know the half of it."dI offer you a deal, the location of my personal private island. Not my family's mind you, mine."fI've never been to it, don't even know what's there. My great-grandmother's estate left it to me."XIf you'd like to go to it, simply beat me. It's not like I care what happens to it."KHmph, a petty child comes to swing at their superiors. What arrogance."zThis... proves nothing. A mere Pokemon battle cannot and will not close the continents of distance between our lines."�Well, if there is one thing the Mavis line is good for, it's savagery. Go on, get your little prize, I'm sure it costs more than mom makes in a decade."dWhat are you trying to talk to me for? Hoping that a shred of my nobility might rub off on you?"bLook at yourself and tell me you'll be anything close to me. You'd be delusional to think so."/A page labeled "Guardian Secret Location"."*It contains a set of GPS coordinates."cA small map details what seems to be the location of an island off the eastern coast of Makya.">With this information, you can now go there in your boat.[f"$¡LOS ESPÍRITUS AQUÍ  GRITAN!"+¡POR FAVOR! ¡ES DEMASIADO BRILLANTE!"8Pueden ser vencidos, pueden ser vencidos, pueden…"QAl igual que el hierro afila el hierro, las personas pueden mejorar a otras."MToca las montañas y hazlas arder. Enviales rayos y dispersa al enemigo.">No les muestres piedad. No los perdones ni los defiendas."2Deja que tu ira consuma a todos tus enemigos."qLas leyendas dicen que hubo una Entrenadora aquí que perdió su brazo al dárselo a un Larvitar hambriento."VPero las leyendas son leyendas. Por ahora, estoy contenta con mi propia historia."Ten cuidado aquí abajo."FEl derrumbamiento que ocurrió por estas partes fue una tragedia."[Quizás un duro recordatorio de que las aventuras no siempre son felicidad y arcoiris."5Cuida donde pisas niño. Esta es tierra sagrada."HEsta es la primera ruta bendecida por la primera campeona de Makya."LEntrenadores del más alto nivel se juntan aquí para ponerse a prueba."RSi estás intentando llegar a Whitebloom, buena suerte en atravesar todo eso."¡Hey!"¡Hey hey hey hey!"LOk, entonces, sí, sé lo que estás pensando: "Wow, Candy, eres, como,"�super-genial por estar en un lugar super-genial lleno de entrenadores peligrosos." Y, eh, seh, gracias por notarlo, realmente lo soy."5Pero tengo un motivo, ¡Y ni siquiera es ilegal!"�Así que, aparentemente Tamarind aparece en Pueblo Whitebloom cada varios meses para ver qué tal o lo que sea, así que hice un pequeño reconocimiento y..."(Ok, quizás sí fue un poco ilegal."}No, shh, puedo sentir que estás siendo, como, muy juzgón, y realmente no necesito esa energía en mi vida ahora mismo."J¡