staría ir a ella, simplemente derrótame. No es como si me importara lo que ocurre con ella."JHmph, un infante mezquino enfrenta a sus superiores. Vaya arrogancia."|Esto... no demuestra nada. Un simple combate Pokémon no puede ni podrá cerrar los continentes de distancia entre nosotros."�Bueno, si hay una cosa en la que la familia de Mavis es buena, es en su ferocidad. Vamos, consigue tu pequeño premio, estoy seguro que cuesta más de lo que mamá hace en una década."[¿Por qué intentas hablarme? ¿Esperas que una pizca de mi nobleza pueda llegar a ti?"dMírate a ti mismo y dime si serás algo apenas cerca de mi. Estarías delirando si lo piensas."?Una página etiquetada como "Ubicación Secreta Guardian"."+Contiene unas coordenadas para un GPS."_Un pequeño mapa detalla lo que parece la ubicación de una isla en la cosa este de Makya."=Con esta información, ahora puedes ir allí en tu bote.;[f"THE SPIRITS HERE SCREAM!"PLEASE! IT IS TOO BRIGHT!"8They can be bested, they can be bested, they can..."=As iron sharpens iron, so can people improve each other."YTouch the mountains and make them smoke. Send forth lightning and scatter the enemy."9Show them no pity. Do not spare them or shield them."0Let thy wrath consume all of thine enemies."aLegends say there was a Trainer here that lost their arm by feeding it to starving Larvitar."FBut legends are legends. For now, I am content with my own story."Be careful down here."@The cave-in that happened around these parts was a tragedy."SPerhaps a harsh reminder that adventures are not always sunshine and rainbows."<Watch where yer steppin' kid. This is holy ground here."CThis is the first route ever graced by Mayka's first champion."BFirst-rate Trainers gather here as a proving ground of sorts."NIf you're trying to head to Whitebloom, good luck getting through it all."	Hey!"Hey hey hey hey!"NOK, so, like, I know what you’re thinking: "Wow, Candy, you’re, like,"�super-cool for hanging out in such a super-cool place full of dangerous trainers." And, uh, yeah, thank you for noticing, I totally am.":But I’ve got a reason, and it’s not even illegal!"�So, apparently Tamarind shows up in Whitebloom Town every few months to like check in or whatever, and I just did a li'l recon and..."0OK, maybe it was actually a little illegal."wNo, shh, I can feel you, like, being judgy right now, and I totally don’t need that energy in my life right now."HBecause she’s the second-in-command of all Team Chasm! Like, duh!"�She’s probably at the top of my hit list – I kinda forgot where I put it and now I can’t find it anymore but it’s almost 100 percent got her name in"big letters at the top!"bUgh, I can’t believe how on the same wavelength we are. You are like my buddy cop soulmate."1Oh, uh, yeah, sorry, hi, love you too. Cool?"4Cool. Let’s talk about the interesting stuff!"�So, I broke into the abandoned lab and rooted around in there – which, it’s like mega-abandoned and super unsafe but, um, who cares – and found these."�Um, which is the part where I’d show you the stuff I’d found but I kinda shoved it in my backpack and that place is a total mess."@So, uh, instead of digging it out, just take my word on it!"~It’s this like dossier on a whole bunch of old Team Chasm operations that Tamarind must’ve left in there and forgot about!";Oh, all kinds of stuff with these, like, killer names."�Like “Operation Vagabond Plumage” or “Operation Cardinal Sin” or “Project Theodicy.” It gives me happy chills just thinking about it!"{Yeah, but she’s like totally on that grindset 24/7 with running ex-Chasm stuff plus Professor work plus bureaucracy."LI knew she had to slip up eventually! Can’t just chug coffee forever!"What? No! No way!"0OK, wait, like, maybe that’s a good idea?"wLike, if I’ve already got everything I need to know, I can totally get her to lower her guard by giving it back.".Anyways, the main thing I actually, like,"�care about is \nthis after-action report for something called “Project Testament.” Y’know how Velenz is, like, this total ghost town?"wWell if I’m reading this right – and I had to look up a few words but I think I am – Team Chasm caused that!"�They found some way to make avatars show up and secretly made them swarm the town, ‘cause apparently Velenz was super-resistant to helping."�Then they, like, intentionally lured avatars into the caves around there to mess up the foundations, and the whole thing started to sink into the mud!""Seriously, it’s screwed-up!"sYeah! Like, this is the stuff Team Chasm did, and people are still, like, totally OK with them running around!"`Um... not completely sure, but I’m absolutely certain they did some evil stuff there, OK?"iI don’t know how they did it, or if the whole, uh, what was it called... “soil liquefication?”"`Yeah, I dunno if that was intentional or not, but the report is pretty damn happy about it!"nI mean, like, kinda? The report doesn’t really get into the hows or whys that much, but, like, c’mon!"QIf you don’t like these people, just, like, fight them? This is messed up."No!"No, no, no. No talking."�I know you’re friends with Tamarind, and, like, yeah, she did you a favor, and she’s cool. But this lady has done some evil stuff."FI’ve got a plan to confront her, and I want your help, alright?"�Once the tournament is about to start, pretty much everybody is gonna be there, so there’s gonna be way less goons just out and about."�I’ll send her an anonymous li’l letter – ooh, I can cut up the dossiers for letters and glue them together! That’s awesome!"�Anyways, yeah, send her a letter, tell her to come to the <imp>sewer maintenance building on the river banks</imp>. She’ll be there."-Then you and me – we get some justice."rAlright? Alright! Great, cool, not gonna let you respond to that because honestly you can’t change my mind!"jYou’re my friend and partner in crime and definitely not the minion of an evil mastermind! Toodles!"Candy..."Why Tamarind?"Cool. What'd you find?"Good to see you too."Like what?"Sloppy."Give it back."That's... horrible."Are you sure?"Impressive."I gotta talk to Tamarind."HELP ME, LAINIE! HELP ME!"aBestie, it's time to invest in our stocks while they're low. We're accepting bestie buyouts!"JTime to cash in on the best bonds... get my bestie estate in order..."7Maybe it's time to invest in you stocks instead..."$Bestie, are you cheating? No..."gGood work bestie, we'll be rolling in bestie bucks if we invest in your bestie business right now."GBestie stocks are crashing now that they're a confirmed cheater..."<I wonder if we're eligable for a bestie rebate, bestie."6You're our bestie now, of course. Battle besties.".You... you're that Mavis kid, aren't you."ZPfft, some wannabe aristocrat you are. Old money? You don't even know the half of it."dI offer you a deal, the location of my personal private island. Not my family's mind you, mine."fI've never been to it, don't even know what's there. My great-grandmother's estate left it to me."XIf you'd like to go to it, simply beat me. It's not like I care what happens to it."KHmph, a petty child comes to swing at their superiors. What arrogance."zThis... proves nothing. A mere Pokemon battle cannot and will not close the continents of distance between our lines."�Well, if there is one thing the Mavis line is good for, it's savagery. Go on, get your little prize, I'm sure it costs more than mom makes in a decade."dWhat are you trying to talk to me for? Hoping that a shred of my nobility might rub off on you?"bLook at yourself and tell me you'll be anything close to me. You'd be delusional to think so."/A page labeled "Guardian Secret Location"."*It contains a set of GPS coordinates."cA small map details what seems to be the location of an island off the eastern coast of Makya.">With this information, you can now go there in your boat.Iu;␀8?[[�"Alessa's House" The berry plant is growing."Pokemon Lab"…Are you bored yet?"Of battling, I mean."kOnly so many Pokémon, so many types, so many moves. Opponents become predictable. Easily manipulated."I’m so… bored."+You know how much I tried to fight it?"jI set aside my entire team, trained a new one, and I was still bored. No one could even slow me down."`So then I only used Bug-types. Only Fire-types. Only unevolved Pokémon. It just got worse."dEveryone’s so predictable. They don’t understand Pokémon the way I do, fight the way I do."�I wandered all of Makya, catching only one Pokémon from each place I visited. Any time they failed me, I released them into the wild."fEven that grew old after a few months. The only person that’s broken up that boredom is… you."+So, \PN, I ask you: are you bored yet?"…Hmph."You will be. Eventually."…So you are like me."I’m sorry. I truly am."<You don’t have to tell me. It won’t change my mind.""Because we can change things."I can, at least. I will."@…This probably isn’t what you were expecting me to say."fDid you want me to quiver and quaver like a child? Stumble over my words and beg for forgiveness?"Sorry. This is me."gThis is the real me – the one I show to my Pokémon. The only ones I can truly talk to. And you."xAll of this is going to be clean white stone in a little while. I wanted to come back just to see it one last time."aCouldn’t stand the idea of talking to anyone. Not Mom, not anyone. It won’t matter soon."Remaking the world."vThe era of human dominance is at an end. With Regigigas’s power, I’ll reset everything back to the beginning."3When the world was new… full of potential…"4I want a world free from this constant boredom."GI want a world in which the ancient power of Pokémon is set free."$I want a brand new blank slate."Yes. I am."?Incapable of relating to humans, or even speaking to them."lMy heart races when they look at me. I am insane, or at least ill. But that doesn’t mean I’m wrong."GI’d expect nothing less. You’re just like me when I was young."/Wanting to be good. So they’d love me…"$…You understand, don’t you?"$Team Chasm uncovered the Regis."hTamarind understood them because she was a scientist. I understood them because they were Pokémon."8Regidrago, when humans cowered in fear of monsters."(Regice, when they huddled in caves."7Regirock, when they built fortifications of stone."(Registeel, when they mastered iron."=Regieleki, when the world was finally theirs to control."XEach one a testament to an era, a chapter in humankind’s domination of the world."pAnd then Regigigas, a remnant of the first era, the primordial era, just after Arceus created the universe."*Arceus created, and Regigigas shaped."<Pokémon were greater, before they became domesticated."iYou’ve seen the echoes of those primordial Pokémon. Soon, that’s what all Pokémon will become."No, not hostile."oYou’re so used to Pokémon being loving and subservient that it’s shocking to see them demand respect.".They’re wild animals. Leave them alone."AWhat about Rattata? What about Boltund? What about Venipede?"WJust another species. Not privileged. Not the center of the universe. Not anymore.")Returned to nothing but white stone."eWho knows what humans will do from there? I’m sure they’ll find a way. They’re persistent.")I’m good with Pokémon. Very good."=I’ll be better off there than here, that’s for sure."KBut I’m wasting your time. I’m only good at one thing, in the end."You ready?"…Alright."6Care to enjoy the view with me? It’s beautiful."&Good. I know you won’t bore me."`Maybe now you’ll understand – this is the only language that we both speak, in the end."+If we’re friends, you’ll fight me."+If we’re enemies, you’ll fight me."Rivals, you’ll fight me."So why, then?"…Don’t say that."%I – I… I care about you too."8I’m sorry. I’m sorry – just… just fight me."+Show me. It’s the only thing I know."3…Then watch as the world you know is erased."It’s that simple."9Answer? No, of course not. You won’t stop me here."NBut it’s how we understand each other better. Show me who you are, \PN.">Oh? You – you really think so? You’ve done so before."EI’m sure you can. Just try. You’ve never let me down before."So, shall we dance?"@Regieleki, Regidrago, you can go now. Return to your tombs."XYou’ll be unmade, too, once this is all done. Just like the eras you commemorate."Do you understand now?"3The real reason? Haven’t I given you enough?"oA world of untapped potential! An end to the boredom! Freeing Pokémon from their saccharine subservience!"$Fine. You want the real reason?"8…Not lying. I just haven’t told you everything."JTo free their potential, to free them from humans, and to free… me."W…Always. Terrified. Not of any Pokémon, never in my life. But always of people."$That’s why I have to do this."pYou don’t understand, \PN. If I was good with people like you, I wouldn’t be doing this. But I’m not."�And you know what drives me mad? They should understand that! They should respect it! I saved this entire damn region! I’m a hero!"9And how am I repaid? With prying eyes and paparazzi."TI thought if I was good enough, they’d be kind to me. They’d understand me."vWell, I became Champion, and they still made me sick. The thought of having to talk to anyone still terrified me."/So I disappeared, and then the ennui came."EEnough. Enough! I deserve to be happy! I deserve to be at peace!"rIf I can’t talk to people, then I’ll create a world where people don’t rule. Where they don’t matter."QPokémon will rule, and I will understand them, and they will understand me."TI’ll be the shadow behind the throne, and I’ll – I’ll finally be happy!".I’m so tired, \PN. I’m so very tired."|You can never understand it – living in a world ruled by people you’re terrified of. People you can’t comprehend."_I deserve some rest. I deserve some peace. And this is the only way I’m going to get it."LThat’s the real reason. For me. So I can have a world where I belong."Do you? Could you ever?"6I deserve a chance at happiness. I never got one.")Everyone else did. It’s only fair."Oh."8Oh… well, thank you. If only it changed anything."
I do."SOr I can remain in this world forever a stranger, wandering without a purpose.""Would you condemn me to that?"1The Championship is getting close, you know."RI’ll wait for you. Once the Championship ends, I’ll make my preparations."lYou’ll find me in Regigigas’s chamber. If you decide you want to stop me or join me, meet me there."kAnd then we’ll settle things the only way we know how. It’s only right to give you one last fight."Goodbye, \PN."7"Whitebloom Town, where adventure is always near!""&The door seems to be locked shut."Wren's House"Yezera's House"No."	Yes."Maybe."What does it matter?"What are you doing?"What do you want?"You're insane."I'm going to stop you."!Avatars are hostile, though."What about humans?"What about civilization?"What about you?"Not yet."Always."I don't want to fight."I care about you."I don't care enough."It isn't the answer."I can't beat you."What's the real reason?"You're lying."You're scared."I understand."That's evil."I agree with you."You don't have to do this."Feeling nostalgic?"5That's just the effect Whitebloom has on people."MYou seem like you'd enjoy a souvenir. You know, to remember the town by."9When I saw Yezera again, I couldn't believe my eyes."9I don't remember the last time she was here in town."cWell, I say back in town, but really she's at her habitual moping spot south of the old tower."&I guess nothing's really changed."Herbert's Herbs[�"Casa de Alessa"(El árbol de bayas está creciendo."Laboratorio Pokémon"¿…Ya te aburriste?"De combatir, me refiero."�Sólo hay unos Pokémon limitados, tipos limitados, movimientos limitados. Los oponentes terminan siendo predecibles. Fácilmente manipulables."Estoy tan… aburrida."6¿Tienes idea de cuánto he intentado combatirlo?"iPuse a un lado todo mi equipo, entrené uno nuevo, y todavía estaba aburrida. Nadie podía pararme."lAsí que sólo usé tipos Bicho. Sólo tipos Fuego. Sólo Pokémon en su primera etapa. Sólo empeoró."Todos son tan predecibles. No entienden a los Pokémon de la forma en que yo lo hago, combaten de la forma en que lo hago."�Viajé por todo Makya, capturando sólo un Pokémon en cada lugar que visitaba. Cada vez que me fallaban, los liberaba a la naturaleza."sIncluso eso me aburrió luego de un par de meses. La única persona que terminó ese aburrimiento… eres tú."3Así que, \PN, te pregunto: ¿Ya te aburriste?"…Hmph."Lo harás. Eventualmente."…Así que eres como yo.""Lo siento. De verdad lo hago."7No tienes que decirmelo. No cambiará mi opinión."&Porque podemos cambiar las cosas."'Por lo menos yo puedo. Y lo haré."=…Esto probablemente no es lo que esperabas que dijera."_¿Querías que temblara y balbuceara como una niña? ¿Que tardamudeara y pidiera perdón?"Lo siento. Esta soy yo."~Esta es la verdadera yo – la que le muestro a mis Pokémon. A los únicos a los que realmente les puedo hablar. Y a ti."hTodo esto no será más que piedra blanca dentro de poco. Quería regresar y verlo una última vez."jNo podía soportar la idea de hablarle a nadie. Ni a Mamá, ni a nadie. Dentro de poco no importará."Rehacer el mundo."pLa era de la dominación humana llegó a su fin. Con el poder de Regigigas, reiniciaré todo a sus albores."6Cuando el mundo fue nuevo... lleno de potencial..":Quiero un mundo libre de este aburrimiento constante."KQuiero un mundo en cuyo el antiguo poder de los Pokémon sea liberado."Quiero un nuevo mundo."Sí. Lo estoy."EIncapaz de relacionarme con humanos, o incluso hablar con ellos."{Mi corazón no deja de latir cuando me ven. Estoy loca, o por lo menos enferma. Pero eso no significa que estoy equivocada."ANo esperaría menos. Tu eres justo como yo cuando era joven."-Queriendo ser buena. Así me amarían…"$…Lo entiendes, ¿Me equivoco?"*El Team Chasm descubrió a los Regis."ZTamarind los entendió porque es una cientifica. Yo los entendí porque son Pokémon."KRegidrago, cuando los humanos estaban aterrorizados por los monstruos."1Regice, cuando se amontonaron en las cuevas."=Regirock, cuando construyeron fortificaciones de piedra."-Registeel, cuando controlaron el hierro."BRegieleki, cuando el mundo finalmente estuvo bajo su control."_Cada uno un testamento de una era, un capítulo en la dominación mundial de la humanidad."zY luego Regigigas, un remanente de la primer era, la era primordial, justo después de que Arceus creara el universo."'Arceus creó, y Regigigas moldeó.";Los Pokémon eran inmensos, antes de ser domesticados."uHas visto los ecos de estos Pokémon primordiales. Pronto, eso será en lo que todos los Pokémon se conviertan."No, no hostiles."rEstás tan acostumbrado a que los Pokémon sean amorosos y serviles que te sorprende verlos demandar respeto."+Son animales salvajes. Déjalos solos."J¿Qué hay de Rattata? ¿Qué hay de Boltund? ¿Qué hay de Venipede?"PSólo otra especie. No privilegiada. No el centro del universo. Ya no más."4Regresado a nada a excepción de piedra blanca."y¿Quién sabe lo que los humanos harán a partir de ahí? Estoy segura que encontraran una manera. Son persistentes."+Soy buena con los Pokémon. Muy buena."2Estaré mejor allí que aquí, eso es seguro."SPero estoy perdiendo tu tiempo. Sólo soy buena en una cosa, después de todo."¿Listo?"…Muy bien."@¿Te importa disfutar las vistas conmigo? Son maravillosas."$Bien. Sé que no me aburrirás."^Quizás ahora entenderás – este el único idioma que ambos hablamos, al fin y al cabo.".Si somos amigos, te enfrentarás conmigo."0Si somos enemigos, te enfrentarás conmigo."&Rivales, te enfrentarás conmigo."¿Por qué, entonces?"…No digas eso."'Yo – Yo… también me importas."=Lo siento. Lo siento – sólo… sólo combate conmigo."1Muéstrame. Es la única manera que conozco.";…Entonces mira como el mundo que conoces es borrado."Es así de simple."B¿La respuesta? No, por supuesto que no. No me pararas aquí."IPero así es como nos entendemos mejor. Muéstrame quién eres, \PN."@¿Oh? ¿Real – realmente piensas eso? Lo has hecho antes."GEstoy segura que puedes. Sólo intenta. Nunca me has decepcionado."Entonces, ¿Bailamos?"DRegieleki, Regidrago, pueden irse ahora. Regresen a sus tumbas."hUstedes también desaparecerán, una vez todo esto esté hecho. Justo como las eras que conmemoran."¿Lo entiendes ahora?"=¿La verdadera razón? ¿Acaso no te he dado suficiente?"q¡Un mundo lleno de potencia! ¡El fin del aburrimiento! ¡Liberar a los Pokémon de su empalagosa servitud!")Bien. ¿Quieres la verdadera razón?"0…No te miento. Sólo no te he dicho todo."TPara liberar su potencial, para liberarlos de los humanos, y para… liberarme."b…Siempre. Aterrorizada. No de ningún Pokémon, nunca en mi vida. Pero siempre de la gente.")Por eso es que tengo que hacer esto."kNo lo entiendes, \PN. Si fuera buena como la gente como tu, no estaría haciendo esto. Pero no lo soy."�¿Y sabes qué me enfurece? ¡Deberían poder entenderlo! ¡Deberían respetarlo! ¡Salvé a toda esta maldita región! ¡Soy una heroína!">¿Y cómo me lo agradecen? Con ojos fisgones y paparazzi."^Pensé que si era lo suficientemente buena, serían amables conmigo. Que me entenderían."�Bueno, me convertí en la Campeona, y todavía me enfermaban. El pensamiento de tener que hablar con cualquier todavía me aterrotizaba."2Así que desaparecí, y el hastío apareció."KSuficiente. ¡Suficiente! ¡Merezco ser feliz! ¡Merezco estar en paz!"nSi no puedo hablar con la gente, entonces crearé un mundo donde la gente no gobierne. Donde no importen."HLos Pokémon gobernarán, y los entenderé, y ellos me entenderán."MSeré la sombra detrás del trono, y – y – ¡Finalmente seré feliz!")Estoy tan cansada, \PN. Tan cansada."xNunca podrás entenderlo – vivir en un mundo gobernado por gente que te aterroriza. Gente que no puedes entender."kMerezco un poco de descanso. Merezco un poco de paz. Y esta es la única manera en la que lo lograré."YEsa es la verdadera razón. Para mi. Así podré tener un mundo en donde pertenezca." ¿Lo haces? ¿Acaso puedes?":Merezco una oportunidad de ser feliz. Nunca tuve una."+Todos los demas la tuvieron. Es justo."Oh."4Oh… bueno, gracias. Si tan solo cambió algo."Yo lo hago."_O puedo permanecer en este mundo para siempre siendo una extraña, vagando sin propósito."!¿Acaso me condenas por eso?"$El Campeonato se acerca, sabes."NEsperaré por ti. Una vez el Campeonato termine, haré mis preparaciones."nMe encontrarás en la cámara de Regigigas. Ya sea que decidas pararme o unirte a mi, encuéntrame allí."sY entonces terminaremos esto de la única manera en que conocemos. Es sólo correcto darte un última combate."Adiós, \PN."B"¡Pueblo Whitebloom, donde la aventura siempre está cerca!""$La puerta parece estar cerrada."Casa de Wren."Casa de Yezera."No."	Sí."Quizás."¿Qué importa?"¿Qué estás haciendo?"¿Qué quieres?"Estás loca."Te voy a parar."$Pero los avatares son hostiles."¿Qué hay de los humanos?"$¿Qué hay de la civilización?"¿Qué hay de ti?"Aún no."Siempre."No quiero combatir."Tu me importas."!No me importa lo suficiente."No es la respuesta."No puedo vencerte."$¿Cuál es la verdadera razón?"Estás mintiendo."Tienes miedo."Lo entiendo."Eso es malvado."Estoy de acuerdo contigo."No tienes que hacer esto."¿Sientes la nostalgia?"7Ese es el efecto que Whitebloom tiene en la gente."LParece que te gustaría un souvenir. Ya sabes, para recordar el pueblo."WCuando ví a Yezera de nuevo, no podía creer lo que tenía en frente de mis ojos."=No recuerdo la última vez que ella estuvo en el pueblo."iBueno, digo en el pueblo, pero realmente ella está en su lugar habitual al sur de la antigua torre."(Supongo que nada realmente cambió."Hierbas de Herbert;[�"Alessa's House" The berry plant is growing."Pokemon Lab"…Are you bored yet?"Of battling, I mean."kOnly so many Pokémon, so many types, so many moves. Opponents become predictable. Easily manipulated."I’m so… bored."+You know how much I tried to fight it?"jI set aside my entire team, trained a new one, and I was still bored. No one could even slow me down."`So then I only used Bug-types. Only Fire-types. Only unevolved Pokémon. It just got worse."dEveryone’s so predictable. They don’t understand Pokémon the way I do, fight the way I do."�I wandered all of Makya, catching only one Pokémon from each place I visited. Any time they failed me, I released them into the wild."fEven that grew old after a few months. The only person that’s broken up that boredom is… you."+So, \PN, I ask you: are you bored yet?"…Hmph."You will be. Eventually."…So you are like me."I’m sorry. I truly am."<You don’t have to tell me. It won’t change my mind.""Because we can change things."I can, at least. I will."@…This probably isn’t what you were expecting me to say."fDid you want me to quiver and quaver like a child? Stumble over my words and beg for forgiveness?"Sorry. This is me."gThis is the real me – the one I show to my Pokémon. The only ones I can truly talk to. And you."xAll of this is going to be clean white stone in a little while. I wanted to come back just to see it one last time."aCouldn’t stand the idea of talking to anyone. Not Mom, not anyone. It won’t matter soon."Remaking the world."vThe era of human dominance is at an end. With Regigigas’s power, I’ll reset everything back to the beginning."3When the world was new… full of potential…"4I want a world free from this constant boredom."GI want a world in which the ancient power of Pokémon is set free."$I want a brand new blank slate."Yes. I am."?Incapable of relating to humans, or even speaking to them."lMy heart races when they look at me. I am insane, or at least ill. But that doesn’t mean I’m wrong."GI’d expect nothing less. You’re just like me when I was young."/Wanting to be good. So they’d love me…"$…You understand, don’t you?"$Team Chasm uncovered the Regis."hTamarind understood them because she was a scientist. I understood them because they were Pokémon."8Regidrago, when humans cowered in fear of monsters."(Regice, when they huddled in caves."7Regirock, when they built fortifications of stone."(Registeel, when they mastered iron."=Regieleki, when the world was finally theirs to control."XEach one a testament to an era, a chapter in humankind’s domination of the world."pAnd then Regigigas, a remnant of the first era, the primordial era, just after Arceus created the universe."*Arceus created, and Regigigas shaped."<Pokémon were greater, before they became domesticated."iYou’ve seen the echoes of those primordial Pokémon. Soon, that’s what all Pokémon will become."No, not hostile."oYou’re so used to Pokémon being loving and subservient that it’s shocking to see them demand respect.".They’re wild animals. Leave them alone."AWhat about Rattata? What about Boltund? What about Venipede?"WJust another species. Not privileged. Not the center of the universe. Not anymore.")Returned to nothing but white stone."eWho knows what humans will do from there? I’m sure they’ll find a way. They’re persistent.")I’m good with Pokémon. Very good."=I’ll be better off there than here, that’s for sure."KBut I’m wasting your time. I’m only good at one thing, in the end."You ready?"…Alright."6Care to enjoy the view with me? It’s beautiful."&Good. I know you won’t bore me."`Maybe now you’ll understand – this is the only language that we both speak, in the end."+If we’re friends, you’ll fight me."+If we’re enemies, you’ll fight me."Rivals, you’ll fight me."So why, then?"…Don’t say that."%I – I… I care about you too."8I’m sorry. I’m sorry – just… just fight me."+Show me. It’s the only thing I know."3…Then watch as the world you know is erased."It’s that simple."9Answer? No, of course not. You won’t stop me here."NBut it’s how we understand each other better. Show me who you are, \PN.">Oh? You – you really think so? You’ve done so before."EI’m sure you can. Just try. You’ve never let me down before."So, shall we dance?"@Regieleki, Regidrago, you can go now. Return to your tombs."XYou’ll be unmade, too, once this is all done. Just like the eras you commemorate."Do you understand now?"3The real reason? Haven’t I given you enough?"oA world of untapped potential! An end to the boredom! Freeing Pokémon from their saccharine subservience!"$Fine. You want the real reason?"8…Not lying. I just haven’t told you everything."JTo free their potential, to free them from humans, and to free… me."W…Always. Terrified. Not of any Pokémon, never in my life. But always of people."$That’s why I have to do this."pYou don’t understand, \PN. If I was good with people like you, I wouldn’t be doing this. But I’m not."�And you know what drives me mad? They should understand that! They should respect it! I saved this entire damn region! I’m a hero!"9And how am I repaid? With prying eyes and paparazzi."TI thought if I was good enough, they’d be kind to me. They’d understand me."vWell, I became Champion, and they still made me sick. The thought of having to talk to anyone still terrified me."/So I disappeared, and then the ennui came."EEnough. Enough! I deserve to be happy! I deserve to be at peace!"rIf I can’t talk to people, then I’ll create a world where people don’t rule. Where they don’t matter."QPokémon will rule, and I will understand them, and they will understand me."TI’ll be the shadow behind the throne, and I’ll – I’ll finally be happy!".I’m so tired, \PN. I’m so very tired."|You can never understand it – living in a world ruled by people you’re terrified of. People you can’t comprehend."_I deserve some rest. I deserve some peace. And this is the only way I’m going to get it."LThat’s the real reason. For me. So I can have a world where I belong."Do you? Could you ever?"6I deserve a chance at happiness. I never got one.")Everyone else did. It’s only fair."Oh."8Oh… well, thank you. If only it changed anything."
I do."SOr I can remain in this world forever a stranger, wandering without a purpose.""Would you condemn me to that?"1The Championship is getting close, you know."RI’ll wait for you. Once the Championship ends, I’ll make my preparations."lYou’ll find me in Regigigas’s chamber. If you decide you want to stop me or join me, meet me there."kAnd then we’ll settle things the only way we know how. It’s only right to give you one last fight."Goodbye, \PN."7"Whitebloom Town, where adventure is always near!""&The door seems to be locked shut."Wren's House"Yezera's House"No."	Yes."Maybe."What does it matter?"What are you doing?"What do you want?"You're insane."I'm going to stop you."!Avatars are hostile, though."What about humans?"What about civilization?"What about you?"Not yet."Always."I don't want to fight."I care about you."I don't care enough."It isn't the answer."I can't beat you."What's the real reason?"You're lying."You're scared."I understand."That's evil."I agree with you."You don't have to do this."Feeling nostalgic?"5That's just the effect Whitebloom has on people."MYou seem like you'd enjoy a souvenir. You know, to remember the town by."9When I saw Yezera again, I couldn't believe my eyes."9I don't remember the last time she was here in town."cWell, I say back in town, but really she's at her habitual moping spot south of the old tower."&I guess nothing's really changed."Herbert's Herbs0Iu;␀�[[	"tTo be quite honest, I have no idea how I have gotten here. But, as an artist, I am still beholden to the craft.""I certainly am painted out..."SI fear what might happen if I stay here any longer. But fear will not beat me."wI might get a better view of those crystals if I get closer, but I'm afraid of being caught by the avatars here...[	"tPara serte honesto, no tengo idea cómo llegué aquí. Pero, como un artista, estoy comprometido en la materia."*Ciertamente fui pintado por encima..."bTemo lo que podría pasar si me quedo aquí por más ti