"=Me and sister are much better battlers than our parents."&Our Pokemon couldn't beat yours?!"/That was fun, we should battle again soon."Our Pokemon couldn't win?!"'Our Pokemon couldn't beat your's?!Iu;␀I[[�"FYezera is whistling something mournful while the world is reborn."*Are you prepared for the fight ahead?"...I will."I’m sorry."For everything. All of it."I’m not stopping."I can’t – I can’t!"=I couldn’t make myself live another day in this world.""Not one more day as a pariah.""Is that all you have? Please?"JWhere was that appreciation a year ago? Two years ago? Five? Why now?"I deserve to be happy!"@I’m going to be happy! Finally! How can you deny me that?"No. No one ever did."ZGossiping about me, prying, questioning – I hated it. No one ever cared how I felt."SHah... deep breaths, Yez. Deep breaths... you met those wraiths, didn’t you?"?Vestiges of a future that could’ve been. People we know."]I guess they were drawn to us, somehow. It’s – I can’t think about that right now."1Alessa will be fine. I’ll make sure of it."<Yes! I’m only good at one thing, but I AM good at it."GVery, very good. A world ruled by Pokémon is a world ruled by me."#That – that wasn’t Alessa."AYou don’t know her. What would you know? You’re a child."=How long have you been in Makya? ...What would you know?"For you? Maybe."$For all of them? People? Maybe."WBut I’m making things better for me, and for Pokémon, and that’s fair! Right?"Isn’t it fair? Finally?"(...You can try. You can always try."%To be honest, \PN, I’m scared."OI’m scared it’s going to be ripped away from me when I’m this close."eI should never have let you come here. I should’ve lied to you – hurt you – done anything."4But now that you’re here, I have to stop you."KThe world’s blossoming. It’s almost ready. And I’m ready for it."fSo... just a little longer, \PN. I’m sorry for doing this to you, but they couldn’t stop you."rZain, Tamarind, Alessa. Sang. The gym leaders. Every single trainer, every avatar – they don’t scare you."wWhat scares you? All of history flows freely here! Every eon at once, mixing and merging, returning to the source!"/What are you most afraid of, in all of it?"...Oh."JMavis. Come. Ring in the end of this world with me. Fight by my side."0Once more, \PN. Once more, and never again."8Your mother... a version of her, stands before you."1Not... exactly. I have my own \PN back home."BI wish you were mine, though. You’re obviously much better."0\PN. It’s surreal seeing your face again."EMy own \PN... well, they’re gone now. Soon to be gone forever."*Mavis. Not your Mavis, unfortunately."yIf I had all the power in this place, and you as my child – why, I’d be the best of all Mavises. C’est la vie."ANo. No one commands me to do anything, and you least of all."nYou should know you can’t escape me. I created you: mind, body, and soul. You owe your existence to me."V...You really are \PN, aren’t you? Fiercer. More resilient. Even less obedient."ZOh, I wish I could take you back with me! You’re the child every mother could want."NAfter you’ve been broken in a little, that is. I’d make you… third."Third-to-last."<Where and when I’m from, things are looking... bleak."YEverything ends. I want to ensure the most valuable things are kept for the longest."You’d be third-to-last."^Oh, if I could only wrap my arms around you and take you with me. All the way to the end."�That’s where I’m from, of course – end of the line. You deserve better than that... but so do I, and I’d like to have one good child to keep me company."YOh, don’t take it personally. Kids need to learn to grow up fast where I’m from."?I’ve made sure society is very... regimented. Practical."eWhen everything’s coming to a halt, you can’t really afford the luxury of teenage rebellion."dI’m a specter, \PN. My timeline is crumbling to ash. I don’t know if it even really exists."�I’ll either return there shortly, or cease to be. Give me this small mercy of being able to see my child again – the child I wish I’d had."D...Our time is just about up. A word of advice: ditch the girl."5She’s a liability, and she’ll drag you down."�She doesn’t deserve half the kindness she’s gotten, and the other half should’ve been revoked to shape her into something better."}...What? Do you think I don’t have my own Yezera? I said you’d be third for a reason. I’m very proud of my second."�This one’s beyond repair, though. You deserve better than a girl that’d destroy the world over her social anxiety. She’s quite literally insane."}Get rid of her and go back home to your Mavis. She’ll love you even more now that you’ve proven yourself so cleanly."She’ll give you a role in life to fulfill, and protect you forever. Even to the end of the world, you’ll have a place."A place... second-to-last."9Say hi to her for me. Love you, \PN. You deserve it."I’m sorry!"�I’m so sorry. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to. I shouldn’t have. I shouldn’t have done that to you!"AI’m sorry. Please forgive me. I’m so sorry. I’m sorry."DNo! I – I – I can’t believe I would do that. I’m sorry.":I’m sorry... I just. I had to stop you. I had to..."!I’m sorry – I’m sorry!"mPlease, please. I can’t – don’t look at me like that! I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."2I’m sorry. You hate me. You should hate me."XI never should’ve done that. I did the worst thing I could think of. I’m sorry."1I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."I had to. Right?"4I’m sorry. I couldn’t. I need... I need it."7Give me my world! Give me my happiness! I need it!"UI just – I want to be loved. I want them to love me. After everything I did...";...\PN. I know. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry.">But I know. I want everyone to love me. I want to belong."2I want to be with everyone else! I need more!".They – I don’t know! They’re happy!"eThey’ve gotten enough. Haven’t they? Isn’t it... I’m sorry. I’m so sorry. I can’t..."=I don’t care! I want to be feared, then! Or respected!"eJust to have a place to belong, and power, and be at the center of everything. I want to matter!"0Please, don’t do that to me. I’m sorry!"OI’m sorry, and I know I deserve it. You should be doing way worse to me."`I’m sorry. I just... I had to. I need to matter. I need to be treated like a human being."DI need people to appreciate me, because I’m – I deserve it!"�I want – I need – I wanna be like... like Mavis. At the center of everything... with power... feared and loved... and I’d deserve it."hI – I think I’m gonna be sick. Is that what I want? \PN? Is that what I’ve been trying to be?"<I don’t wanna be that. I don’t want... what I want."...OK. Shhh. Deep breaths."J...Yeah. It is. I don’t have to... be like that. Don’t have to..."=...It hurts. Everything hurts. I feel sick. But... yeah."..."3I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have gone that far."PI... it's different, hurting someone you know like that. I don’t like it."jSo much easier to just sweep away what you’re doing when it’s all clean white stone. I’m sorry."p...I guess nothing’s really changed. I’m not fixed. I’m not happy. I feel the worst I’ve ever felt."qBut... I can’t go through with it. Th-thank you for that. I wouldn’t have been able to live with myself."&Hah. You’re a good friend, \PN."-Or, I guess we’re not friends. Rivals?"=I know. Are you a selfless hero, or do you just hate me?"It’s OK if you hate me."7I – I’m not going to examine that too closely."_Thank you, \PN. I love you too. D-don’t examine that too closely, either. I just do, OK?"aSilence? I guess that’s all I deserve. ...Although, with you sometimes, it’s all I need."I’m not staying."\I need to figure some things out... and I don’t know that I’m welcome here anymore."KHistory’s still enmeshed here. I think I’ll just... take a stroll."cI do. I’ve been alone for a long time, but now I really need to be... alone. Properly alone."KHah. Thanks, I think. I understand if you want me gone. Everyone does."_That’s why I left. And after all of this... yeah. I should go, for their sakes and mine."NI’m sorry. I have to. Sometimes you just need to do things by yourself.">Have your... little revelations, I guess. I do, at least."...Mmhmm."I’ll be back."I promise I’ll be back."~Even if no one wanted me to come back, I still would – this is my home. I don’t know when, or where, but I promise I will."VYou should get out of here. This isn’t really a healthy place, I don’t think."NI’ll just wait here for a little bit, and then I’ll... I’ll be off."WGive me a little while to catch my breath, wipe these tears away... all the usual."<Thank you, \PN. For everything. Even if you do hate me."TI’ll see you again, OK? For a rematch. This time, though, it’ll just be us."Until then... thank you."No."	Yes."You can."Please, Yezera."This is wrong."Don't care."Are you so sure?"Alessa doesn't want this."You're making it worse."I'm stopping this."	Mom."Mavis."What are you?"Disappear."Third?"Take me back?"Broken in?"Leave me be."It's OK."My mom? Really?"You are loved."And everyone else?"That isn't love."Shhh. It's OK."It's your choice."You see now?"You're welcome."Didn't do it for you."I love you."You don't have to."
Good."Please, don't.[�"DYezera silba algo lúgubre mientras el mundo empieza a renacer."-¿Estás listo para el combate venidero?"…Lo haré."Lo siento.""Por todo. Absolutamente todo."No voy a parar."¡No puedo – no puedo!"8No puedo obligarme a vivir otro día en este mundo."#Otro día más como una paria.".¿Eso es todo lo que tienes? ¿Por favor?"Z¿Dónde estaba esa apreciación hace un año? ¿Hace dos? ¿Cinco? ¿Por qué ahora?"¡Merezco ser feliz!"K¡Voy a ser feliz! ¡De una vez por todas! ¿Cómo puedes negarme eso?"No. Nadie nunca lo hizo."lChismeando sobre mi, entrometiendose, preguntando – lo odio. Nadie nunca le importó como me sentía."TJa… respira hondo, Yez. Respira hondo… te encontraste esos espectros, ¿No?"HVestigios de un futuro que podría haber sido. Gente que conocemos."hSupongo que fueron atraídos a nosotros, de algún modo. Es – no puedo pensar en eso ahora mismo."3Alessa va a estar bien. Me aseguraré de ello."?¡Sí! Solo soy buena en una cosa, pero SOY buena en ello."RBien, muy bien. Un mundo gobernado por Pokémon es un mundo gobernado por mi."Esa – esa no era Alessa."9No la conoces. ¿Qué podrías saber? Eres un niño."H¿Por cuánto tiempo has estado en Makya? ¿...Qué podrías saber?"¿Para ti? Quizás."-¿Para todos ellos? ¿La gente? Quizás."dPero estoy haciendo las cosas mejores para mi, y para los Pokémon, ¡Y eso es justo! ¿Cierto?"%¿No es eso justo? ¿Finalmente?"5…Puedes intentarlo. Siempre puedes intentarlo."*Para serte honesta, \PN, tengo miedo."?Miedo de que me arrebaten esto cuando estoy así de cerca."hNo debería haberte dejado venir aquí. Debería haberte mentido – lastimarte – cualquier cosa."6Pero ahora que estás aquí, tengo que detenerte."MEl mundo está floreciendo. Está casi listo. Y yo estoy lista para él."\Sólo… sólo un poco más, \PN. Lamento hacerte esto, pero ellos no pudieron pararte."lZain, Tamarind, Alessa. Sang. Los líderes de gimnasio. Cada entrenador, cada avatar – no te asustan."}¿Qué te asusta?  ¡Toda la historia fluye libremente aquí! Cada eon, mezclandose y fusionandose, ¡Regresando a su origen!"2¿Qué es lo que más te asusta, en todo eso?"...Oh."JMavis. Ven. Disputa en el fin de este mundo conmigo. Lucha a mi lado."2Una vez más, \PN. Una vez más, y se acabó.">Tu madre… una versión de ella, se para en frente a ti."4No… exactamente. Tengo mi propio \PN en casa."AOjalá fueras el mío, eso sí. Obviamente eres mucho mejor.".\PN. Es tan surreal ver tu cara de nuevo."<Mi propio \PN... bueno, se ha ido. Pronto para siempre.",Mavis. No tu Mavis, desafortunadamente."|Si tuviera todo el poder en este lugar, y tu como mi sucesor – Pues, sería la mejor de todas las Mavises. C’est la vie."2No. Nadie me comanda hacer nada, y menos tú."mDeberías saber que no puedes escapar de mí. Yo te cree: Mente, cuerpo, y alma. Me debes tu existencia."W...Realmente eres \PN, ¿No? Más feroz. Más resiliente. Incluso menos obediente."cOh, ¡Ojalá pudiera llevarte conmigo a casa! Eres el hijo que cualquier madre podría querer."?Luego de amoldarte un poco, eso sí. Te haría… tercero."Antepenúltimo."FEn el lugar y momento de donde vengo, las cosas son… lúgubres."fTodo termina. Y quiero asegurarme de que las cosas más valiosas sean mantenidas lo más posible." Tú serías antepenúltimo."VOh, si tan solo pudiera tomarte en mis brazos y llevarte conmigo. Hasta el final."�De ahí vengo, por supuesto – el final de todo. Tu mereces algo mejor que eso… pero también yo, y me gustaría tener un buen hijo para tener compañía"VOh, no te lo tomes personal. Los niños tienen que crecer rápido de donde vengo."FMe aseguré de que la sociedad sea muy… regimentada. Práctica."mCuando todo está llegando a su final, no es que te puedas permitir el lujo de la rebelión adolescente."uSoy un espectro, \PN. Mi línea temporal se está destruyendo hasta los cimientos. Ya no sé si siquiera existe."�Ahora regresaré allí en un momento, o dejaré de existir. Déjame esta pequeña misericordia de poder ver a mi hijo de nuevo – el hijo que desearía haber tenido."M...Nuestro tiempo se está terminando. Un consejo: Deshazte de la chica."0Ella es una carga, y te tirará para abajo."|No merece ni la mitad de la amabilidad que le dieron, y la otra mitad debería haber sido centrada en llevarla a algo mejor."�¿...Qué? ¿Acaso piensas que no tengo mi propia Yezera? Dije que serías tercero por una razón. Estoy orgullosa de mi segunda."�Pero esta ya no se puede arreglar. Te mereces algo mejor que una chica que destruiría el mundo debido a su ansiedad social. Está literalmente insana."�Deshazte de ella y regresa a casa con tu Mavis. Ella te amaría aún más ahora que has demonstrado lo que vales tan limpiamente."tElla te dará un rol que cumplir, y te protegerá para siempre. Incluso en el fin del mundo, tendrás un lugar."Un lugar… penúltimo."7Salúdala de mi parte. Te amo, \PN. Te lo mereces."¡Lo siento!"pLo siento tanto. Lo siento, lo siento, lo siento. No quería. No debería. ¡No debería haberte hecho eso!"ALo siento. Por favor perdóname. Lo siento tanto. Lo siento."B¡No! No – No – No puedo creer que haría eso. Lo siento."=Lo siento… Yo sólo. Tenía que pararte. Tenía que…"¡Lo siento – lo siento!"]Por favor, por favor. Yo no – ¡No me mires así! Lo siento. No quería. Tenía que…",Lo siento. Me odias. Deberías odiarme."YNunca tendría que haber hecho eso. Hice la peor cosa que se me ocurrió. Lo siento.")Lo siento. No quería. Tenía que…"Tenía que. ¿Cierto?"4Lo siento. No pude. Lo necesito… lo necesito.";¡Denme mi mundo! ¡Denme mi felicidad! ¡La necesito!"VYo solo – quiero ser amada. Quiero que me amen. Después de todo lo que hice…"5...\PN. Lo sé. Lo siento, lo siento, lo siento.">Pero lo sé. Quiero que todos me amen. Quiero pertenecer.":¡Quiero estar con todos los demás! ¡Necesito más!"'Ellos – ¡No sé! ¡Son felices!"VTuvieron lo suficiente. ¿No? Acaso es… lo siento. Lo siento tanto. No puedo…"C¡No me importa! ¡Quiero ser temida, entonces! ¡O respetada!"fTener un lugar al que pertenecer, y poder, y estar en el centro de todo. ¡Quiero ser importante!"-Por favor, no me hagas eso. ¡Lo siento!"CLo siento, y sé que lo merezco. Deberías hacerme mucho peor."fLo siento. Yo sólo… tenía que. Tengo que importar. Necesito que me traten como un ser humano."<Necesito gente que me aprecie, porque – ¡Lo merezco!"~Quiero – necesito – quiero ser como… como Mavis. En el centro de todo… con poder… temida y amada… y lo merecería."eC – Creo que me voy a hartar. ¿Es eso lo que quiero? ¿\PN? ¿Es eso lo que he intentado ser?"3No quiero ser eso. No quiero… lo que quiero." ...OK. Shhh. Respira hondo."<…Seh. Lo es. No tengo que… ser eso. No tengo que…"6…Duele. Todo duele. Estoy cansada. Pero… seh."..."4Lo siento. No debería haber llegado tan lejos."RYo… es diferente, lastimar a alguien que conoces de esa forma. No me gusta."sEs mucho más fácil esconder bajo la alfombra lo que estás haciendo cuando todo es piedra blanca. Lo siento."d…Supongo que nada realmente cambió. No me arreglé. No soy feliz. Jamás me he sentido peor."hPero… no puedo seguir con esto. Gr-gracias por eso. No habría sido capaz de vivir conmigo misma."!Ja. Eres un buen amigo, \PN."/O, supongo que no somos amigos. ¿Rivales?":Lo sé. Eres un héroe altruista, ¿O sólo me odias?"Está bien si me odias."+No – no voy a examinar eso demasiado"XGracias, \PN. También te amo. T-tampoco lo examines demasiado. Sólo lo amo, ¿Ok?"l¿Silencio? Supongo que eso es todo lo que merezco …Aunque, contigo a veces, es todo lo que necesito."No voy a quedarme."MTengo que pensar un par de cosas… y ya no sé si soy bienvenida aquí."RLa historia sigue estando enredada aquí. Creo que sólo… tomaré un paseo."lLo hago. Estuve sola por mucho tiempo, pero ahora realmente necesito estar… sola. Adecuadamente sola."HJa. Gracias, creo. Entiendo si quieres que me vaya. Todos lo hacen."`Por eso es que me fui. Y despues de todo esto… sí. Debería irme, por su bien y el mío."RLo siento. Tengo que hacerlo. A veces uno debe hacer las cosas por uno mismo."KTen tus… pequeñas revelaciones, supongo. Por lo menos yo las tengo."...Mmhmm."Voy a volver."Prometo que voy a volver."�Incluso si nadie me quiere de vuelta, todavía lo haría – este es mi hogar. No sé cuándo, o dónde, pero prometo que lo haré."GDeberías irte de aquí. No creo que este lugar sea muy saludable.":Sólo esperaré aquí un poco, y luego me… me iré."[Dame un poco de tiempo para tomar un respiro, limpiarme estas lágrimas… lo típico."1Gracias, \PN. Por todo. Incluso si me odias."WTe veré de nuevo, ¿Ok? Para una revancha. Pero esta vez, seremos sólo nosotros."Hasta entonces… gracias."No."	Sí."Puedes hacerlo."Por favor, Yezera."Esto está mal."No me importa."¿Estás segura?"Alessa no quiere esto."Lo estás haciendo peor."Voy a parar esto."Mamá."Mavis."¿Qué eres?"Desaparece."¿Tercero?"¿Llevarme?"¿Amoldarme?"Déjame en paz."Está bien."¿Mi mamá? ¿En serio?"Eres amada."¿Y todos los demás?"Eso no es amor."Shhh. Está bien."Es tu elección."¿Lo ves ahora?"De nada."No lo hice por ti."Te amo."No tienes que hacerlo."
Bien."Por favor, no lo hagas.;[�"FYezera is whistling something mournful while the world is reborn."*Are you prepared for the fight ahead?"...I will."I’m sorry."For everything. All of it."I’m not stopping."I can’t – I can’t!"=I couldn’t make myself live another day in this world.""Not one more day as a pariah.""Is that all you have? Please?"JWhere was that appreciation a year ago? Two years ago? Five? Why now?"I deserve to be happy!"@I’m going to be happy! Finally! How can you deny me that?"No. No one ever did."ZGossiping about me, prying, questioning – I hated it. No one ever cared how I felt."SHah... deep breaths, Yez. Deep breaths... you met those wraiths, didn’t you?"?Vestiges of a future that could’ve been. People we know."]I guess they were drawn to us, somehow. It’s – I can’t think about that right now."1Alessa will be fine. I’ll make sure of it."<Yes! I’m only good at one thing, but I AM good at it."GVery, very good. A world ruled by Pokémon is a world ruled by me."#That – that wasn’t Alessa."AYou don’t know her. What would you know? You’re a child."=How long have you been in Makya? ...What would you know?"For you? Maybe."$For all of them? People? Maybe."WBut I’m making things better for me, and for Pokémon, and that’s fair! Right?"Isn’t it fair? Finally?"(...You can try. You can always try."%To be honest, \PN, I’m scared."OI’m scared it’s going to be ripped away from me when I’m this close."eI should never have let you come here. I should’ve lied to you – hurt you – done anything."4But now that you’re here, I have to stop you."KThe world’s blossoming. It’s almost ready. And I’m ready for it."fSo... just a little longer, \PN. I’m sorry for doing this to you, but they couldn’t stop you."rZain, Tamarind, Alessa. Sang. The gym leaders. Every single trainer, every avatar – they don’t scare you."wWhat scares you? All of history flows freely here! Every eon at once, mixing and merging, returning to the source!"/What are you most afraid of, in all of it?"...Oh."JMavis. Come. Ring in the end of this world with me. Fight by my side."0Once more, \PN. Once more, and never again."8Your mother... a version of her, stands before you."1Not... exactly. I have my own \PN back home."BI wish you were mine, though. You’re obviously much better."0\PN. It’s surreal seeing your face again."EMy own \PN... well, they’re gone now. Soon to be gone forever."*Mavis. Not your Mavis, unfortunately."yIf I had all the power in this place, and you as my child – why, I’d be the best of all Mavises. C’est la vie."ANo. No one commands me to do anything, and you least of all."nYou should know you can’t escape me. I created you: mind, body, and soul. You owe your existence to me."V...You really are \PN, aren’t you? Fiercer. More resilient. Even less obedient."ZOh, I wish I could take you back with me! You’re the child every mother could want."NAfter you’ve been broken in a little, that is. I’d make you… third."Third-to-last."<Where and when I’m from, things are looking... bleak."YEverything ends. I want to ensure the most valuable things are kept for the longest."You’d be third-to-last."^Oh, if I could only wrap my arms around you and take you with me. All the way to the end."�That’s where I’m from, of course – end of the line. You deserve better than that... but so do I, and I’d like to have one good child to keep me company."YOh, don’t take it personally. Kids need to learn to grow up fast where I’m from."?I’ve made sure society is very... regimented. Practical."eWhen everything’s coming to a halt, you can’t really afford the luxury of teenage rebellion."dI’m a specter, \PN. My timeline is crumbling to ash. I don’t know if it even really exists."�I’ll either return there shortly, or cease to be. Give me this small mercy of being able to see my child again – the child I wish I’d had."D...Our time is just about up. A word of advice: ditch the girl."5She’s a liability, and she’ll drag you down."�She doesn’t deserve half the kindness she’s gotten, and the other half should’ve been revoked to shape her into something better."}...What? Do you think I don’t have my own Yezera? I said you’d be third for a reason. I’m very proud of my second."�This one’s beyond repair, though. You deserve better than a girl that’d destroy the world over her social anxiety. She’s quite literally insane."}Get rid of her and go back home to your Mavis. She’ll love you even more now that you’ve proven yourself so cleanly."She’ll give you a role in life to fulfill, and protect you forever. Even to the end of the world, you’ll have a place."A place... second-to-last."9Say hi to her for me. Love you, \PN. You deserve it."I’m sorry!"�I’m so sorry. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to. I shouldn’t have. I shouldn’t have done that to you!"AI’m sorry. Please forgive me. I’m so sorry. I’m sorry."DNo! I – I – I can’t believe I would do that. I’m sorry.":I’m sorry... I just. I had to stop you. I had to..."!I’m sorry – I’m sorry!"mPlease, please. I can’t – don’t look at me like that! I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."2I’m sorry. You hate me. You should hate me."XI never should’ve done that. I did the worst thing I could think of. I’m sorry."1I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."I had to. Right?"4I’m sorry. I couldn’t. I need... I need it."7Give me my world! Give me my happiness! I need it!"UI just – I want to be loved. I want them to love me. After everything I did...";...\PN. I know. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry.">But I know. I want everyone to love me. I want to belong."2I want to be with everyone else! I need more!".They – I don’t know! They’re happy!"eThey’ve gotten enough. Haven’t they? Isn’t it... I’m sorry. I’m so sorry. I can’t..."=I don’t care! I want to be feared, then! Or respected!"eJust to have a place to belong, and power, and be at the center of everything. I want to matter!"0Please, don’t do that to me. I’m sorry!"OI’m sorry, and I know I deserve it. You should be doing way worse to me."`I’m sorry. I just... I had to. I need to matter. I need to be treated like a human being."DI need people to appreciate me, because I’m – I deserve it!"�I want – I need – I wanna be like... like Mavis. At the center of everything... with power... feared and loved... and I’d deserve it."hI – I think I’m gonna be sick. Is that what I want? \PN? Is that what I’ve been trying to be?"<I don’t wanna be that. I don’t want... what I want."...OK. Shhh. Deep breaths."J...Yeah. It is. I don’t have to... be like that. Don’t have to..."=...It hurts. Everything hurts. I feel sick. But... yeah."..."3I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have gone that far."PI... it's different, hurting someone you know like that. I don’t like it."jSo much easier to just sweep away what you’re doing when it’s all clean white stone. I’m sorry."p...I guess nothing’s really changed. I’m not fixed. I’m not happy. I feel the worst I’ve ever felt."qBut... I can’t go through with it. Th-thank you for that. I wouldn’t have been able to live with myself."&Hah. You’re a good friend, \PN."-Or, I guess we’re not friends. Rivals?"=I know. Are you a selfless hero, or do you just hate me?"It’s OK if you hate me."7I – I’m not going to examine that too closely."_Thank you, \PN. I love you too. D-don’t examine that too closely, either. I just do, OK?"aSilence? I guess that’s all I deserve. ...Although, with you sometimes, it’s all I need."I’m not staying."\I need to figure some things out... and I don’t know that I’m welcome here anymore."KHistory’s still enmeshed here. I think I’ll just... take a stroll."cI do. I’ve been alone for a long time, but now I really need to be... alone. Properly alone."KHah. Thanks, I think. I understand if you want me gone. Everyone does."_That’s why I left. And after all of this... yeah. I should go, for their sakes and mine."NI’m sorry. I have to. Sometimes you just need to do things by yourself.">Have your... little revelations, I guess. I do, at least."...Mmhmm."I’ll be back."I promise I’ll 