ter."qFlying and Rock are your next best bets. Steel is pretty good as well, since it resists both of her typings."7Best of luck in the final stretch of your Gym run."-Hoho! It's rare to see Samorn so lively."-Watching you two go at it was inspiring."FFor now though... back to work. Gotta earn my second author slot."8Good evening. Can I get you something? Tea? Coffee?"GYou’ve almost certainly wasted enough time here already, though."3Do you get nervous before facing a gym leader?"\I do – get nervous before facing a challenger, that is. I don’t want to disappoint."LI guess I shouldn’t worry. I’m called the Dreadnaught for a reason."KWould you like a bite-sized team or should I break out the good stuff?"PAre you in less of a rush than I thought? If so, feel free to stick around."BOf course. Now, if you’ll excuse me, I have to concentrate."…Let’s begin."…Huh. How clever."3You won, and I have a badge to present to you."Goodbye."R…Oh, excuse me. It takes me a moment to remember my manners after a battle."LCongratulations on your victory. I’d be happy to rematch you any day."I should’ve known."HExcuse me if I seem a bit terse. I’ll have to focus for this one."1You’re not to be underestimated, you know."…Neither am I."F"Wrack and ruin broke our ships/And plucked us from our heavens.""UOh, my apologies! It takes a short while to get my bearings again after a fight."eI get the same way when translating – which I have to assume is why that couplet came to mind.">Let me give you your badge. You’ve more than earned it."UWe don’t have to discuss it – I won’t infantilize you with obvious praise."{Speaking of plucking from heavens, though… you ought to know what that victory means. Shall we chat a little longer?"…Hmm. Regrettable."Take this badge."…Hmph."Ah, what was I saying?")Oh. Congratulations on your victory."fI’d like to apologize for my bluntness. It takes time for me to switch mindsets after a battle."vI’d also like to apologize for not providing more of a challenge. Your leadership and team were both wonderful."FTake advantage of my hospitality any time you’d like a rematch."KAh, \PN! I won’t waste your time by offering something hot to drink."4You’ve got a fight on your mind, don’t you?"&…Hmph. So you… ah, nevermind."[Ignore the ramblings of my battle-jumbled brain. It’s always a pleasure to duel you."DI won’t infantilize you by showering you with obvious praise."+I ought’ve… ah, what was I saying?"LOh. Congratulations on your victory. Again, please excuse my bluntness."yI’d also like to apologize for not providing more of a challenge – your leadership and team were both wonderful."TI’ve spent most of my career carefully breaking into sealed crypts and safes."=Years ago, though, I was also hired to help create them."�The wondrous abilities of the Regis made making nigh-impenetrable doors a cinch… but I’ve broken into a lot of impenetrable doors."=There is an avatar in a cave, high above where we stand."GI’d like to entrust this key to you, so that you can destroy it.".The past belongs in the past – forever."1Hello, \PN. Any good news about that avatar?"hNo? Well, then, I’m afraid I’ll have to withhold your tea and coffee privileges until there is."	Hah!"4Sorry, but I have to have some bargaining chip."!Go destroy that avatar, now."=It hides in a cave above our heads, on the mountainside."9Ah. So it’s done. I just wish we could’ve… no."(History is history. Today is today."OAnd tomorrow is tomorrow – a tomorrow without avatars, if we’re lucky."�Thank you, \PN. I think I’ll take a short break. You’re the last challenger I expected to see before the championship anyways."8You’re always welcome to stop by my home, though!"4You'll have to get through me to fight grandma!"?Guess I'll go bother the scientists at the dig site again."DYou might have beaten me, but grandma's a lot stronger than me."=You must be pretty strong if you're challenging grandma."The PC is turned off."\With how quiet the gym is, you think it'd stand out as rude if you tried to turn it on."Sorry, am I in your way?")Wait, of course I am, I'm a trainer!";I've been reading about ancient Makyan hero- trainers."*You might be even stronger than them!"3I've got to stay here and continue my studies."8Among the books on history, a scrapbook stands out."&The title is "Memories of Hoenn.""<A cute sticker of a Trapinch dominates the front cover."+Beakers of chemicals line the shelves."*The majority appear to be weak acids."Ceremonial iron swords."'They were dated to 1800 years ago!""A fossil of an aquatic plant."dA plaque lists a very long scientific name for it. Your eyes glaze over as you try and read it."4A simple plaque simply states "Armaldo Fossil"."MThe rest of the description plate probably hasn't been manufactured yet."4A trash can made of some sort of tropical wood."It's totally empty."4The Armaldo fossil behind me was just unpacked."1I have to protect it from ruffians like you!"(Must have misjudged your character."7Unlike me, you'd never steal a priceless artifact."
Tata!",I'll be keeping my one good eye on you."fNotes on the chalkboard describe a timeline of the Makyan monarchy, starting from 2800 years ago."3 Shieldon fossils."?One is intact, but the other two are in very poor quality.",Basic archeology techniques are listed."GThey're given in order of most to least destructive and dangerous.";The bookshelf is full of books on science and history.".They seem targeted at a younger audience."uExcuse me if I seem a bit terse. I’ll have to focus for this one. You’re not to be underestimated, you know."J“Wrack and ruin broke our ships/And plucked us from our heavens.”"\Speaking of plucking from heavens, though… you ought to know what that victory means."#Shall we chat a little longer?"[Goodbye. …Oh, excuse me. It takes me a moment to remember my manners after a battle."On second thought…"Let’s do this.[s"¡Hey, aspirante!"YNo podrá parecerlo, pero Samorn fue una de las mejores combatientes del Team Chasm."3Su especialidad son los tipos Dragón y Bicho."jEso hace el tipo tu mejor opción. Ella tiene un par de respuestas para él, pero sigue siendo clave."sVolador y Roca deberían ser tu segunda opción. Acero también es bastante buena, ya que resiste ambos tipos."LTe deseo lo mejor en el último trecho de tu desafío de los Gimnasios."1¡Jojo! Es raro ver a Samorn con tanta vida."2Verlos combatir a ustedes dos fue inspirador."UPero por ahora… de vuelta al trabajo. Debo ganarme el puesto de segundo autor."=Buenas tardes. ¿Puedo conseguirte algo? ¿Té? ¿Café?">Ciertamente ya has desperdiciado suficiente tiempo aquí."7¿Te da nervios enfrentar a un líder de gimnasio?"WA mi sí – antes de enfrentar a un aspirante, me refiero. No quiero decepcionar."PSupongo que no debería preocuparme. Me llaman la Acorazada por una razón."?¿Prefieres un equipo limitado o debería ir con lo mejor?"P¿Tienes menos apuro del que pensé? Entonces, quédate un rato si quieres."=Por supuesto. Ahora, si me disculpas, debo concentrarme."…Empecemos."…Huh. Qué listo."1Ganaste, y tengo una medalla que entregarte."Adiós."R…Oh, disculpa. Me toma un momento recordar mis modales luego de un combate."SFelicidades por tu victoria. Me encantaría tener una revancha cualquier día."Debería haberlo sabido."GDisculpa si parezco un poco cortante. Debo concentrarme para esto."%No debes ser subestimado, sabes."…Y yo tampoco."X"Destrucción y ruina rompió nuestros barcos/Y nos sacó de nuestros paraísos.”"H¡Oh, disculpame! Me toma un tiempo volver a mi luego de una pelea."[Me pasa lo mismo cuando traduzco – por eso asumo es que ese pareado vino a mi mente."6Déjame darte tu medalla. Eres merecedor de ella."PNo tenemos que discutirlo – no voy a infantilizarte con obvia adulación."uHablando de sacar de los paraísos… debes saber lo que esa victoria significa. ¿Podremos hablar un poco más?"…Hmm. Una lástima."Toma esta medalla."…Hmph."Ah, ¿Que decía?"$Oh. Felicidades en tu victoria."jMe gustaría disculparme por mi brusquedad. Me toma tiempo cambiar de mentalidad luego de un combate."sTambién me gustaría disculparme por no proveer un desafío mayor. Tu liderazgo y equipo fueron maravillosos."IAprovecha mi hospitalidad cuando sea que quieras tener una revancha."V¡Ah, \PN! No voy a desperdiciar tu tiempo ofreciendote algo caliente para beber."&¿Quieres una pelea, me equivoco?"*…Hmph. Así que tu… ah, olvidalo."eIgnora las divagaciones de mi cerebro en modo de combate. Siempre es un placer enfrentarme a ti."9No te infantilizaré bañandote de obvia adulación."2Debería haber… ah, ¿Qué estaba diciendo?"QOh. Felicidades por tu victoria. De nuevo, por favor perdona  mi brusquedad."vTambién me gustaría disculparme por no proveer un desafío mayor – tu liderazgo y equipo fueron maravillosos."lPasé la mayoría de mi carrera cuidadosamente forzando mi entrada en criptas selladas y cajas fuertes."EPero hace años, también me contrataron para ayudar a crearlas."�Las asombrosas habilidades de los Regis hicieron que crear puertas casi impenetrales un juego de niños… pero 