h, you don't have a choice on where to go."HEspecially when a Drifloon decides to grab onto you and not let go."^I live in Novo Town, and now I'm here. And I want to make sure this doesn't happen again."OI'm looking for something that might keep me grounded. Like a Ground-type."BCause like, they're, ya know. Like, ground, and like, yeah..."Looking for a trade?"DWell, I guess I'm trying to not go anywhere, so I'll stay here.".Sounds good. I ain't doing anything else."FGlad that I'll have a Pokemon that won't fly me away in my sleep."Best of luck out there."I'm just hanging out here."7I've really enjoyed standing on the ground lately."Being, ya know..."Grounded..."?I heard the Cave of Hatching has a lot of strong trainers."I wonder how you stack up?"yThey say recently Wild Pokemon in the Cave of Hatching have been carving the stones into these beautiful egg shapes!"!I have to see it for myself!"*Look at this pretty egg-shaped stone!"BMy friend got it from the Cave of Hatching and gave it to me!"YesIu;␀�[[J":\PN! Go around the other way! Pincer maneuver, right?"9No second thoughts. She’s probably already inside."1You – you let her by? I – I trusted you!"'Don’t! Don’t you patronize me!"MYes, it is! You heard what she said! She needs to be brought to justice!"@This whole region gave her a chance and look what happened!"Don’t lie to me!"KI listened to that entire conversation. Ugh! You’re such a pushover!"jYou don’t believe in any of this at all, do you? You’re not my friend! You’re not even my ally!"No!"<No, I will not calm down! I’m gonna get even angrier!"...I’m so stupid."No, you aren’t!"HIf you were sorry, you’d do something about it! But you didn’t!"1Yeah, I’m sure you do! And I have my mine!"%I can’t believe I trusted you!"KI’m... oh, \PN. I’m, like, I’m not sorry for being, like, wrong."?I’m sorry for what I’m about to do to you. Hah! Hahah!"Hahahah! Alright!"HLike, fine, Tamarind gets away! But I’ve got someone even better!"Do I look OK, you idiot?"qI’m, like, pretty far down at this point! But I’ve got a shovel and I’m about to dig you down with me!"KYeah. You knew this would happen, you traitor. I hope it’s worth it!"OOh, it is way past time! I can’t believe I let my guard down around you!"#Are you ready? I don’t care."0Jeanne, you were right. Butcher this creep."You beat me. Fine! Fine!"YI don’t care! What does it matter? Of course you’re better than me! Everyone is!"^...You don’t know how, like, completely tempting it is to kick you while you’re down."FYou’d deserve it. But I should let you get up. I know I should."m...So what now? You want to go skitter off and eat treats out of Tamarind’s hand? Fine! See if I care!"3You can burn for all I care. I – I hate you!"3I. Don’t. Care! You’re not better than me!"mEveryone’s always trying to show they’re better than me because they’ve got the law on their side!"|Or they’re older, or bigger, or a better trainer! Well you’re all idiots! You’re all corrupt! You should all just die!"'No you’re not! Shut up! Shut up!"JYou don’t care what you did! You don’t care that you betrayed me!"]Good! I’m glad you hate me! At least that means you have a good reason for hurting me."(I hate you too. I hate you so much."PGo die! I hate you! Ugh – you make my skin crawl, you manipulative creep!",I should’ve trusted Jeanne about you."(...It’s over. Everything is over."-Funny. It’s, like, honestly hilarious.":I was gonna help Yezera end everything! Reset it all!"�And now I don’t even want to! Screw that. You don’t deserve justice. None of you do! Why would I want to make everything good?"xThen I don’t get the pleasure of tearing it down! It’s pointless anyways! Nothing I do is ever going to matter!"SPeople are all just corrupt lapdogs like you, \PN. Thanks for showing me that."eI guess you got what you wanted – screw Yezera. I’ll take care of this world myself. My way."dToodles, \PN. I’d say I hope I never see you again, but, like, honestly? It’s the opposite."1You better PRAY yo