alter, its resolve broken."QThe primordial power within it dies down, and it regards you with calm eyes."lRegigigas considers for a moment, perfectly still. Then it assents, moving with heavy steps to aid you."mRegigigas inclines slightly, perhaps imitating obeisance. Then it rights itself and stands at your side."bRegigigas regards you with an analytical gaze. Then it hums and steps forward with certainty."{Regigigas thrums loudly and violently. Then it clenches one hand and flares with a bright surge of power for a moment.";The titan will fight for you, if you want to catch it."KRegigigas creates a Poké Ball and it willingly lets itself be caught."iThe Poké Ball is abnormally heavy. Even the act of holding it seems to be of historical importance."PYou decline Regigigas’s offer. Regardless, it will not stand in your way."7You decline Regigigas’s offer, at least for now."Is this the right moment?"...You made it."�This is where Regigigas was interred. Where I ended Team Chasm. Where I wandered in my boredom, and where I began to speak to Regigigas."dTold it what I wanted, what I feared, what I planned. And I heard it, lamenting the golden age."�We reached an understanding. And then it started its work within its tomb while I collected the other Regis to finally set it free."{I could fight you now, but, to be honest with you... I don’t want to take the risk. Don’t know what I’d do if I lost."TSo I’ll wait at the heart of the new world and just watch it happen. Goodbye."$A bit of an anticlimax, I know."B...Sorry. I do like you. But I have to protect my own future."-Yes, always. Motivated by fear. Forever."d...Or at least until my work’s finished, and I can finally rest happy in a position of power."aYou think I’d toss away my only chance at real happiness for you? Don’t delude yourself."XBesides, if you were going to change my mind... you know the only language I speak."U...No, I guess it wouldn’t to you. You’ll carve a path anyways, won’t you?"5Well, I’ll make sure it’s paved with thorns."ARegigigas, the future... the past... is quickly approaching."xProtect it. Protect me. I don’t want you to hurt my friend here, but... make sure they wake up in a better world."Help me."This isn't right."For the future."You owe me."Catch Regigigas."Leave Regigigas."No."	Yes."That's it?"Coward."Don't do this."Doesn't matter.[-"8Regigigas parece tambalear, su determinación rota."JSu poder primordial empieza a desvanecerse, y te contempla con calma."}Regigigas considera por un momento, perfectamente quieto. Luego se decide, moviéndose con fuertes pasos para ayudarte ."lRegigigas se inclina levemente, quizás imitando una reverencia. Luego se endereza y se para a tu lado."~Regigigas te contempla con una mirada analítica. Luego da un paso certero al frente, con un sonido similar a un tarareo."�Luego ese tarareo se convierte en uno más fuerte y violento. Con su puño apretado crea una brillante carga de poder por solo un momento.":El titán combatirá a tu lado, si decides atraparlo."JRegigigas crea una Poké Ball y voluntariamente se deja ser atrapado."mLa Poké Ball es anormalmente pesada. Incluso el acto de sostenerla parece tener importancia histórica."QDeclinas la oferta de Regigigas. De todos modos, no se pondrá en tu camino."9Declinas la oferta de Regigigas, al menos por ahora."#¿Es este el momento correcto?"...Llegaste."�Aquí es donde Regigigas fue enterrado. Donde terminé con el Team Chasm. Donde deambulé en mi aburrimiento, y donde empecé a hablarle a Regigigas."eLe dije lo que quería, lo que temía, lo que planeé. Y lo escuché, lamentando su edad dorada."Llegamos a un acuerdo. Y luego empezó su parte en su tumba mientras yo reunía los otros Regis para finalmente liberarlo."Podría combatir contigo ahora, pero, para ser honesta contigo… No quiero tomar el riesgo. No sé qué haría si pierdo."WAsí que esperaré en el corazón del nuevo mundo mientras lo veo suceder. Adiós."$Un poco anticlimático, lo sé."B...Lo siento. Me gustas. Pero debo proteger mi propio futuro."7Sí, siempre. Motivada por el miedo. Para siempre."~ …O por lo menos hasta que mi trabajo haya terminado, así podré finalmente descansar felizmente en una posición de poder."p¿Realmente piensas que tiraría mi única chance de tener verdadera felicidad para ti? No te desilusiones."_De todos modos, si fueras a cambiar mi opinión… tú conoces el único idioma que hablo."g….No, supongo que no funcionará para ti. Vas a hacerte un camino de todos modos, ¿Me equivoco?"?Bueno, me aseguraré de que esté pavimentado con espinas."ARegigigas, el futuro… el pasado… se acerca rápidamente."xProtégelo. Protégeme. No quiero lastimar a mi amigo aquí, pero… aségurate de que despierte en un mundo mejor."Ayúdame."Esto no está bien."Para el futuro."Me lo debes."Atrapar a Regigigas."Dejar a Regigigas."No."	Sí."¿Eso es?"Cobarde."No hagas esto."No importa.;[-"3Regigigas seems to falter, its resolve broken."QThe primordial power within it dies down, and it regards you with calm eyes."lRegigigas considers for a moment, perfectly still. Then it assents, moving with heavy steps to aid you."mRegigigas inclines slightly, perhaps imitating obeisance. Then it rights itself and stands at your side."bRegigigas regards you with an analytical gaze. Then it hums and steps forward with certainty."{Regigigas thrums loudly and violently. Then it clenches one hand and flares with a bright surge of power for a moment.";The titan will fight for you, if you want to catch it."KRegigigas creates a Poké Ball and it willingly lets itself be caught."iThe Poké Ball is abnormally heavy. Even the act of holding it seems to be of historical importance."PYou decline Regigigas’s offer. Regardless, it will not stand in your way."7You decline Regigigas’s offer, at least for now."Is this the right moment?"...You made it."�This is where Regigigas was interred. Where I ended Team Chasm. Where I wandered in my boredom, and where I began to speak to Regigigas."dTold it what I wanted, what I feared, what I planned. And I heard it, lamenting the golden age."�We reached an understanding. And then it started its work within its tomb while I collected the other Regis to finally set it free."{I could fight you now, but, to be honest with you... I don’t want to take the risk. Don’t know what I’d do if I lost."TSo I’ll wait at the heart of the new world and just watch it happen. Goodbye."$A bit of an anticlimax, I know."B...Sorry. I do like you. But I have to protect my own future."-Yes, always. Motivated by fear. Forever."d...Or at least until my work’s finished, and I can finally rest happy in a position of power."aYou think I’d toss away my only chance at real happiness for you? Don’t delude yourself."XBesides, if you were going to change my mind... you know the only language I speak."U...No, I guess it wouldn’t to you. You’ll carve a path anyways, won’t you?"5Well, I’ll make sure it’s paved with thorns."ARegigigas, the future... the past... is quickly approaching."xProtect it. Protect me. I don’t want you to hurt my friend here, but... make sure they wake up in a better world."Help me."This isn't right."For the future."You owe me."Catch Regigigas."Leave Regigigas."No."	Yes."That's it?"Coward."Don't do this."Doesn't matter.Iu;␀�0[[y"A Shiny Corviknight!"4It's too busy watching the ocean to notice you."jYo, yo, yo, what's a Trainer like you doing out here? Ain't nothing out here but sand and salt water."Hey wait a second..."6Oh! You're that Trainer gramps was talking about!"6Heard about you from a couple places. \PN, right?"I'm Praveen."HYou've got a spark of some kind if you took a dub off of ol' Ansel."%I gotta see some of that myself."=I'm always ready to go, boss, you think you can show up?"HMust be the nerves, eh? I get that, can't always be on your A-game."Let's get it started!"<Whoo, a textbook battle. Should've gotten that on tape."VAlright man, you've got me impressed. Taking out Makya's best ain't an easy task."1You look the type that's going places, yeah?"=Gonna want to meet this guy if you're trying to do that."rHe's a bit on the wild side but that ain't anything new for you, I bet. I'm sure you two will get along well."XWell, no use hanging around here. Already got all the workout I needed for the day."SI'll try to catch you around, yeah? If not, well, have a great career I guess."XThe water here can get really deep! If I didn't have this tube, I'd probably drown!"8I must rely on myself! I must get swimming lessons!"$I trust this tube with my life."KDo you know how to swim? Why'd you have to use your board to get here?"0I don't need a ship, I'm a natural swimmer!" A natural sinker as well..."[I work on a boat because I need cash to live. If I could swim instead of eat, I would."-My biceps are beyond your comprehension."West: Canal Desert"Northwest: Split Peaks" Northeast: Sweetrock Harbor""Halt, in the name of justice!"SI really gotta stop using that opening when stopping people for inspections..."hNo, I didn't want to battle you. Here's my badge. We heard that there was suspicious activity here."You see any crime lately?"No? Hmm, suspicious."?I lost my glasses! Here, my Pokemon can help us find them!"(Aha! Found them! Now we can battle!"0...huh? Did my Pokemon battle on their own?"%I still can't find my glasses..."*I should really switch to contacts..."!Maybe get a guide Pokemon..."TCelebi gives you an inquisitive look. It seems like you've peaked its interest."mIt probably wants to join your team. It gives a smile that's hard to read while holding up its Pokeball."&Accept the Celebi onto your team?"8You decide to decline the Celebi's request for now."+You take the Pokeball from the Celebi."8You catch it smirking as it re-enters its Pokeball."<Do you hear the ocean breeze? It listens to us, softly."NThe breeze moves on. It has heard our errors, our dreams, and our hunger."hThe breeze merely refreshes us, but it also gives life and comfort on what would be a barren waste.