rder mi trabajo…"0Muchas gracias, me estás salvando la vida."¡Eres lo mejor!"`Creo que mi jefe estará contento. Haz hecho un gran servicio a mi, mi jefe y a la ciencia.",Aunque lo admito, principalmente a mí."DLos avatares son mucho más agresivos que un Pokémon promedio."/Eso, combinado con su tamaño aumentado…"DEs casi como si no fueran parte de líneas evolutivas modernas."No"Sí"=Em. ¿Podrías no violar nuestra privacidad de ese modo?"^Vivir aquí es lo suficientemente triste sin que extraños miren a nuestras pertenencias."QPuedes ver pilas de ropa y otras necesidades del hogar a través del vidrio.""Es mejor no ver tan de cerca.;["lFossil records show that Pokemon in ancient times were significantly more powerful than they are today."MLarger bones, unique organ structures, and even redundant organ systems."LAt some point though, almost all Pokemon species started to lose these."!My boss is going to kill me."OHe told me go out and find a Pokemon that could "wipe out" a whole team..."#I misheard that as *wimp out*."VNow I just have this Wimpod, which is not going to be useful for our experiments.":I need something with real power--like a Dragon type."QSay, if you have a Dragon type, would you be willing to trade for my Wimpod?"Dang, it was worth a shot.""I hope I don't lose my job..." Thanks, you're a lifesaver."You're the best!"\I think my boss will be happy. You've done a great service to me, my boss, and science.""Though mostly me, I'll admit."@Avatars are much more aggressive than your average Pokemon."/That, coupled with their increased size..."IIt's almost as if they aren't even from modern evolutionary lines..."No"Yes"5Um. Could you not violate our privacy like that?"XLiving here is already deprived enough without strangers staring at our belongings."VYou can see stacks of clothes and other household neccessities through the glass.""Best not to peer too closely.Iu;␀O[[3"Congratulations, Champion!";Take a victory lap around the grounds, you deserv