re, ya?"OI might catch 'em in bulk, but that don't mean none of them ain't special."Sure, I'll take one."I'm good."Feebas."Magikarp."JA brochure rack, advertising a variety of tourist spots across Makya."Pet the Eevee plushie?"2You gently rub the top of the plushie's head.")You decide not to touch the plushie."YesIu;␀�;[[�"0I BRING A WHOLE NEW MEANING TO DEATH METAL!"TNow that I think about it, what I'm doing down here is immensely disrespectful."&TAKE THE G OFF OF GRAVEYARD BABY!""BWAHHHHH BWAAAAHHHHH BWWOOOW!"Are you alright?"Which one are you?"What did you see?"Where's the other one?"..."I'm so sorry."	How?"Yeah, I'd guessed..."You have to remember."Better to know."Then don't remember."I'll prepare."Very well."Catch Imogene."Release Imogene forever."...\PN.",I’m here. And you are as well, I see."...No."!Does it matter? Did it ever?"!Something I should not have."&Something that no one should see."ZDeeper in. Struggling with the burden of the revelation she knew she would find here."mDo you understand yet? Can you see it within my eyes – the reflection of what I have borne witness to?"^At first I journeyed here not knowing why, or what I hoped to find. I simply knew I must."SAnd then... then it fell upon me like some grim scavenger upon a fresh corpse."�Don’t you understand? I walked these graves, pacing with an ever-quickening heart, hunting for the one name I dreaded to find."
Mine."?...There is nothing much to say to a dead woman, is there?"1Don’t be. It’s better to know the truth."...Imogene is dead."XI do not know if I ever did. Countless possibilities plagued me in sleepless hours."8Was this one too elegant to consider? Or too cruel?"RImogene has been dead for years. She died well before my memory on the train."KShe was a hermit and a recluse, a mystic and a witch, and now... gone."_I can feel... memories... bubbling up. They’re seeping in like blood through thin gauze."(I can’t let them in. I mustn’t!"MIf I remember who I am... I won’t be me anymore. I won’t be Imogene."...It is agonizing."{The silence, filled with the beat of my raging heart and the echoes of things I had thought left to blissful oblivion."No! You would kill me?"HIf I remember I will be – I will be undone! Unmade in an instant!"So I believed."pHah! How innocent I was, truly, never having witnessed something so horrible as to make one wish to forget."1I’m trying. I am trying with all my might!":I do not want this identity! I do not want this past!"XIf I witness this revelation it will shatter me! I know this with utmost certainty."And... so did she."�I do not know if she has already given in, but she bestowed upon me a gift before she left my presence for what I fear is the last time."Her Pokémon."?She would not entrust them to me if she planned to return."+...I am prepared. I can run no longer."eWilling or no, the truth descends upon me. I will greet it with all the fury I might yet muster.")Make your preparations, if you must."LAre you ready? I cannot do this alone. I require a mirror to gaze into."PI must dance, must ritualize this, must make into something comprehensible."bI need your support, and I know your adamant core resides within your abilities as a trainer."mMore than that, I know it is how you judge people. I would have you witness my soul, and know the truth."SDo what you must. I may wait a few moments longer... may keep the past at bay."FFor the last time, I take up this identity I have absconded with."I am Imogene."I am an oracle."I am a seeker of truth."@Bare your soul to me, wanderer! Let this be my last battle!"...So be it."I remember."oI remember the house, the old hardwood, the ticking of the grandfather clock, the smell of the river loam!"{The crushing of the drying autumn leaves, the warmth of a soft embrace, the bruising, the bleeding, the burning, the fight!"LThe love of the fight! The yearning to learn, to become something more!"_I remember her. I remember Imogene teaching us, teaching all of us... teaching us to be..."Go on ahead."9Find what has happened to my sister in this torment."RI... I will release our Pokémon, and then I will cease this long masquerade."!I will be trapped no longer."?The name on this gravestone is faded beyond recognition..."$Leave me. I must do this alone."There’s a note."�“I’ve released them. Our Pokémon go readily. I think they know. As for me... I remember. She loved Dittos. She kept dozens."SShe trained them not only in battle, but to imitate humans. To imitate... her."YI found it so curious, to see Pokémon pretending to be people. How lovely. How fun!"sShe took me in as if I was just another pink blob, and she taught me more than I can express, let alone repay."{I am not her, nor is my companion. We are but two mirrors set facing each other, endlessly reflecting a woman that is gone."hWe strayed further and further in our imitations every day. It could not last. Do not mourn for us."aThis is the truth, and it provides suffering and succor in equal measure, as it always does.">We are released from our bonds. We are Imogene no longer."<Now we are Imogene, sisters of a name, and that is all."Thank you."Goodbye."�P.S.: I have done things I should not have, in pursuit of this truth. I have endeavored to cause harm to you, to others, to the world entire."qI do not know if this was my own selfish need to know what in my heart of hearts I already saw yet denied --"Aor if, perhaps, Imogene was not the saint I remember her as."EIn either case, I will take responsibility for what I have done."�I cannot stand against you, and will gladly aid you in your coming trials. Not to aid the flow of fate, but because you are my friend."HBecause it is the right thing to do, and because it is what I want."bI cannot ask for more than a chance to make amends side by side with one such as yourself.”"@P.S.: I will gladly lend my aid to you, no matter who I am."TAsk for my assistance, and I will be there. I have plenty strength yet to give."jI do this not for you, who is of import to the flow of destiny, but for you, my friend and confidant."KBring me with you if you desire my company, or have need of my powers."?It is the least I can do... and the best I can imagine.”"...A Mew."@The infinitely-mutable Pokémon of myth, here in the flesh."3It chitters happily, swimming through the air."�Yet, somehow, there’s a macabre tinge to its movements, a slight touch of gallows humor to the way it darts around gravestones."HThere is a flash of sympathy in its eyes when it stares into yours."MIt knows what it is, and it knows what you are, and you know what it is."SIt stops and coils, floating for a moment to regard you with its vibrant eyes.")You see the conflict in its eyes –"�the desire to explore free and wide, the remembered thrill of the fight, the eagerness to repay its debt, the desire to accompany you."!It leaves the choice to you."%It winks at you as you catch it."lSometimes it will go missing, wandering on flights of fancy through landscapes and thoughtscapes alike."CSometimes in the witching hour objects will move on their own."cSometimes you find notes written in handwriting you can’t read, signed with a question mark."9You know it can leave any time it likes. It won’t."9It flips upside down, then rights itself in mid-air."\Perhaps mockery, perhaps a nod, perhaps just an idle motion of a recently-freed animal."Then, it’s gone."RA mirage that disappears with a strong breeze, dispelled like a waking dream."}If you come back, perhaps it will be here, waiting for you. They’ll say this place is haunted, but you know the truth."`It’s always liked graveyards, and it can afford to wait to make sure you won’t need it.""Now, it has nothing but time."Macabre"Insightful"Ever-Seeking"Humanity"Deception[�"2¡TRAIGO UN NUEVO SIGNIFICADO AL DEATH METAL!"MAhora que lo pienso, lo que estoy haciendo es inmensamente irrespetuoso."2¡ME CEMENTO COMO LA SIGUIENTE ESTRELLA BABY!"$¡BWAHHHHH BWAAAAHHHHH BWWOOOW!"¿Estás bien?"¿Cuál eres tú?"¿Qué viste?"¿Dónde está la otra?"..."Lo siento tanto."¿Cómo?"!Seh, lo habría adivinado..."Tienes que recordarlo."Mejor saberlo."Entonces no lo recuerdes."Me prepararé."Muy bien."Atrapar Imogene."$Liberar a Imogene para siempre."...\PN."0Estoy aquí. Y tú también lo estás, veo."...No."+¿Acaso importa? ¿Alguna vez lo hizo?"&Algo que no debería haber visto."!Algo que nadie debería ver."cMás profundo. Luchando con la carga de la revelación que ella sabía que encontraría aquí."r¿Ya lo entiendes? ¿Puedes verlo a través de mis ojos – el reflejo de la carga de la que he sido testigo?"oPrimero viajé aquí sin saber por qué, o qué esperaba encontrar. Simplemente sabía que debía hacerlo."RY luego... luego me cayó como un adusto carroñero hacia un cádaver fresco."�¿No lo entiende? Caminé a través de estas lápidas, andando con un corazón que no dejaba de latir, buscando por el nombre que temía encontrar."El mío.":...No hay mucho que decirle a una mujer muerta, ¿No?".No lo estés. Es mejor conocer la verdad."...Imogene está muerta."`No sé si alguna vez lo hice. Incontables posibilidades me fastidiaron en horas sin sueño."D¿Era esta muy elegante para considerarla? ¿O demasiado cruel?"VImogene ha estado muerta por años. Murió mucho antes que mi memoria en el tren."ZElla era una ermitaña, una solitaria, una mística y una bruja, y ahora... no está."^Puedo sentir... memorias... reconstruyendose. Se filtran como la sangre en una fina gasa."/No puedo dejar que entren. ¡No tengo que!"@Si recuerdo quién soy... ya no seré yo. No seré Imogene."...Es agonizante."{El silencio, llenado con el ritmo de mi intenso corazón y los ecos de las cosas que pensé que dejé en un dichoso olvido." ¡No! ¿Acaso me matarías?"ISi recuerdo seré – ¡Seré destrozada! ¡Deshecha en un instante!"O eso creí."}¡Ja! Lo inocente que era, verdaderamente, jamás habiendo atestiguado algo tan horrible que hacen desear a uno olvidar."FLo estoy intentando. ¡Lo estoy intentando con todo lo que puedo!"9¡No quiero esta identidad! ¡No quiero este pasado!"Q¡Si atestiguo esta revelación me hará pedazos! Sé esto con toda certeza." Y... también lo hizo ella."No sé si ella ya se ha rendido, pero me otorgó un regalo antes de dejar mi presencia por lo que temo sea la última vez."Sus Pokémon."4Ella no me los confiaría si planeara regresar."-...Estoy preparada. Ya no puedo escapar."mLo quiera o no, la verdad aparece delante de mi. Me saludará con toda la furia que aún debo congregar.""Prepárate, si debes hacerlo."T¿Estás listo? No puedo hacer esto sola. Requiero un espejo al que contemplar."GDebo bailar, debo ritualizar esto, debo hacerlo algo comprensible."gNecesito tu apoyo, y sé que tu firme núcleo reside dentro de tus habilidades como un entrenador."lMás que eso, sé que es cómo juzgas a la gente. Te haría testigo de mi alma, y conocerás la verdad."[Haz lo que debas hacer. Puede que espere un poco más... manteniendo a raya el pasado."EPor última vez, tomo esta identidad en la que me he abscondido."Soy Imogene."Soy una oráculo."$Soy una buscadora de la verdad."K¡Muéstrame tu alma, nómada! ¡Deja que esta sea mi último combate!"...Que así sea."Lo recuerdo."f¡Recuerdo la casa, la vieja madera, el tictac del reloj del abuelo, el olor que emanaba el río!"{El aplastamiento de las hojas secas de otoño, el calor de un suave abrazo, los moretones, el sangrado, el ardor, la lucha!"R¡El amor por la lucha! ¡El anhelo de aprender, de convertirme en algo más!"fLa recuerdo. Recuerdo a Imogene enseñándonos, enseñándonos a todos... enseñándonos a ser..."Continúa."AEncuentra lo que le ha pasado a mi hermana en este tormento."NVoy... voy a liberar nuestros Pokémon, y luego cesaré esta larga farsa."Ya no estaré atrapada."?El nombre en esta lápida está borroso e irreconocible..."#Déjame. Debo hacer esto sola."Hay una nota."�“Los he liberado. Nuestros Pokémon marchan listos. Creo que ya lo saben. En cuanto a mi... lo recuerdo. Ella amaba a los dittos. Ella tenía docenas."`Los entrenó no sólo para los combates, pero para imitar humanos. Para imitarla... a ella."cLo encontré tan curioso, ver a Pokémon fingiendo ser personas. Que bonito. ¡Qué divertido!"zElla me mantuvo como si fuera otra masa rosa, y me enseñó más de lo que puedo expresar, mucho menos recompensarlo."�No soy ella, ni tampoco lo es mi compañera. No somos más que dos espejos mirándonos uno al otro, continuamente reflejando una mujer que ya no está."cNos apartamos más y más de nuestras imitaciones cada día. No podía durar. No nos lamentes."bEsta es la verdad, y provee sufrimiento y socorro en la misma cantidad, como siempre lo hace."=Fuimos liberadas de nuestros lazos. Ya no somos Imogene."<Ahora somos Imogene, hermanas de nombre, y eso es todo."Gracias."Adiós."xPD: He hecho cosas que no debería, en búsqueda de esta verdad. He intentado lastimarte, a otros, al mundo entero."zNo sé si fue mi propia necesidad egoísta de saber lo que en mi interior más profundo ya ví más tuve que negar --"9o si, quizás, Imogene no fue la santa que recuerdo."GEn cualquier caso, tomaré la responsabilidad por lo que he hecho."�No puedo enfrentarte, y con gusto te acompañaré en tus pruebas venideras. No para ayudar el flujo del destino, pero porque tú eres mi amigo."6Porque es lo correcto, y porque es lo que quiero."_No puedo pedirte más que una oportunidad de enmendar ambos lados con alguien como tú.”"<PD: Con gusto te daré mi ayuda, no importa quién sea."IPide por mi ayuda, y estaré allí. Aún tengo mucha fuerza que dar."jNo hago esto para ti, quien es el importe del flujo del destino, pero para ti, mi amigo y confidente."JLlévame contigo si deseas mi compañía, o si necesitas de mi poder."EEs lo menos que puedo hacer... y lo mejor que puedo imaginar.”"...Un Mew."HEl Pokémon infinitamente-mutable de mitos, aquí en carne y hueso."5Canta con felicidad, nadando a través del aire."�Aún así, de algún modo, hay un matiz macabro en sus movimiento, un pequeño toque de humor negro en la forma en que se mueve por las lápidas."KHay un destello de simpatía en sus ojos cuando contempla a los tuyos.";Sabe lo que es, y sabe lo que eres, y sabes lo que es."_Se detiene y se enrosca, flotando por un momento para contemplarte con sus ojos vibrantes."'Notas el conflicto en tus ojos –"�el deseo de explorar sin límites, el recordado entusiasmo para combatir, el afán por pagar su deuda, el deseo de acompañarte."Deja la decisión en ti."#Te guiña el ojo al atraparla."jA veces desaparecerá, deambulando en elegantes vuelos a través de tanto paisajes como pensamientos."LA veces en la hora de las brujas los objetos se moverán por su cuenta."rA veces te encuentras notas escritas en una letra que no puedes leer, firmada con un signo de interrogación."=Sabes que puede irse cuando sea que quiera. No lo hará."8Da un giro al revés, luego se endereza en el aire."kQuizás como burla, quizás asiente, quizás un quieto movimiento de un animal recientemente-liberado."Luego, se va."WUn milagro que desaparece con una fuerte brisa, disperso como un sueño caminante."xSi regresas, quizás estará aquí, esperando por ti. Dicen que este lugar está embrujado, pero conoces la verdad."mSiempre le han gustado los cementerios, y puede permitirse esperar hasta asegurarse que no la necesitas."*Ahora, no tiene nada más que tiempo."Macabra"Perspicaz"Buscadora"Humanidad"Engaños;[�"0I BRING A WHOLE NEW MEANING TO DEATH METAL!"TNow that I think about it, what I'm doing down here is immensely disrespectful."&TAKE THE G OFF OF GRAVEYARD BABY!""BWAHHHHH BWAAAAHHHHH BWWOOOW!"Are you alright?"Which one are you?"What did you see?"Where's the other one?"..."I'm so sorry."	How?"Yeah, I'd guessed..."You have to remember."Better to know."Then don't remember."I'll prepare."Very well."Catch Imogene."Release Imogene forever."...\PN.",I’m here. And you are as well, I see."...No."!Does it matter? Did it ever?"!Something I should not have."&Something that no one should see."ZDeeper in. Struggling with the burden of the revelation she knew she would find here."mDo you understand yet? Can you see it within my eyes – the reflection of what I have borne witness to?"^At first I journeyed here not knowing why, or what I hoped to find. I simply knew I must."SAnd then... then it fell upon me like some grim scavenger upon a fresh corpse."�Don’t you understand? I walked these graves, pacing with an ever-quickening heart, hunting for the one name I dreaded to find."
Mine."?...There is nothing much to say to a dead woman, is there?"1Don’t be. It’s better to know the truth."...Imogene is dead."XI do not know if I ever did. Countless possibilities plagued me in sleepless hours."8Was this one too elegant to consider? Or too cruel?"RImogene has been dead for years. She died well before my memory on the train."KShe was a hermit and a recluse, a mystic and a witch, and now... gone."_I can feel... memories... bubbling up. They’re seeping in like blood through thin gauze."(I can’t let them in. I mustn’t!"MIf I remember who I am... I won’t be me anymore. I won’t be Imogene."...It is agonizing."{The silence, filled with the beat of my raging heart and the echoes of things I had thought left to blissful oblivion."No! You would kill me?"HIf I remember I will be – I will be undone! Unmade in an instant!"So I believed."pHah! How innocent I was, truly, never having witnessed something so horrible as to make one wish to forget."1I’m trying. I am trying with all my might!":I do not want this identity! I do not want this past!"XIf I witness this revelation it will shatter me! I know this with utmost certainty."And... so did she."�I do not know if she has already given in, but she bestowed upon me a gift before she left my presence for what I fear is the last time."Her Pokémon."?She would not entrust them to me if she planned to return."+...I am prepared. I can run no longer."eWilling or no, the truth descends upon me. I will greet it with all the fury I might yet muster.")Make your preparations, if you must."LAre you ready? I cannot do this alone. I require a mirror to gaze into."PI must dance, must ritualize this, must make into something comprehensible."bI need your support, and I know your adamant core resides within your abilities as a trainer."mMore than that, I know it is how you judge people. I would have you witness my soul, and know the truth."SDo what you must. I may wait a few moments longer... may keep the past at bay."FFor the last time, I take up this identity I have absconded with."I am Imogene."I am an oracle."I am a seeker of truth."@Bare your soul to me, wanderer! Let this be my last battle!"...So be it."I remember."oI remember the house, the old hardwood, the ticking of the grandfather clock, the smell of the river loam!"{The crushing of the drying autumn leaves, the warmth of a soft embrace, the bruising, the bleeding, the burning, the fight!"LThe love of the fight! The yearning to learn, to become something more!"_I remember her. I remember Imogene teaching us, teaching all of us... teaching us to be..."Go on ahead."9Find what has happened to my sister in this torment."RI... I will release our Pokémon, and then I will cease this long masquerade."!I will be trapped no longer."?The name on this gravestone is faded beyond recognition..."$Leave me. I must do this alone."There’s a note."�“I’ve released them. Our Pokémon go readily. I think they know. As for me... I remember. She loved Dittos. She kept dozens."SShe trained them not only in battle, but to imitate humans. To imitate... her."YI found it so curious, to see Pokémon pretending to be people. How lovely. How fun!"sShe took me in as if I was just another pink blob, and she taught me more than I can express, let alone repay."{I am not her, nor is my companion. We are but two mirrors set facing each other, endlessly reflecting a woman that is gone."hWe strayed further and further in our imitations every day. It could not last. Do not mourn for us."aThis is the truth, and it provides suffering and succor in equal measure, as it always does.">We are released from our bonds. We are Imogene no longer."<Now we are Imogene, sisters of a name, and that is all."Thank you."Goodbye."�P.S.: I have done things I should not have, in pursuit of this truth. I have endeavored to cause harm to you, to others, to the world entire."qI do not know if this was my own selfish need to know what in my heart of hearts I already saw yet denied --"Aor if, perhaps, Imogene was not the saint I remember her as."EIn either case, I will take responsibility for what I have done."�I cannot stand against you, and will gladly aid you in your coming trials. Not to aid the flow of fate, but because you are my friend."HBecause it is the right thing to do, and because it is what I want."bI cannot ask for more than a chance to make amends side by side with one such as yourself.”"@P.S.: I will gladly lend my aid to you, no matter who I am."TAsk for my assistance, and I will be there. I have plenty strength yet to give."jI do this not for you, who is of import to the flow of destiny, but for you, my friend and confidant."KBring me with you if you desire my company, or have need of my powers."?It is the least I can do... and the best I can imagine.”"...A Mew."@The infinitely-mutable Pokémon of myth, here in the flesh."3It chitters happily, swimming through the air."�Yet, somehow, there’s a macabre tinge to its movements, a slight touch of gallows humor to the way it darts around gravestones."HThere is a flash of sympathy in its eyes when it stares into yours."MIt knows what it is, and it knows what you are, and you know what it is."SIt stops and coils, floating for a moment to regard you with its vibrant eyes.")You see the conflict in its eyes –"�the desire to explore free and wide, the remembered thrill of the fight, the eagerness to repay its debt, the desire to accompany you."!It leaves the choice to you."%It winks at you as you catch it."lSometimes it will go missing, wandering on flights of fancy through landscapes and thoughtscapes alike."CSometimes in the witching hour objects will move on their own."cSometimes you find notes written in handwriting you can’t read, signed with a question mark."9You know it can leave any time it likes. It won’t."9It flips upside down, then rights itself in mid-air."\Perhaps mockery, perhaps a nod, perhaps just an idle motion of a recently-freed animal."Then, it’s gone."RA mirage that disappears with a strong breeze, dispelled like a waking dream."}If you come back, perhaps it will be here, waiting for you. They’ll say this place is haunted, but you know the truth."`It’s always liked graveyards, and it can afford to wait to make sure you won’t need it.""Now, it has nothing but time."Macabre"Insightful"Ever-Seeking"Humanity"DeceptionIu;␀_[[";A mystic force resists your attempts to open the door."0However, the force fades with each attempt."=After three tries, the mystic force dissipates entirely.["AUna fuerza mística resiste tus intentos de abrir la puerta.":Sin embargo, la fuerza se desvanece con cada intento."FLuego de tres intentos, la fuerza mística se disipa enteramente.;[";A mystic force resists your attempts to open the door."0However, the force fades with each attempt."=After three tries, the mystic force dissipates entirely.Iu;␀�[[8")Would you like to catch this Phione?""You leave the Phione for now."MYo! Shoulda known I was gonna find you here. Um, yeah, how’s it going?"Good, good, yeah, me too."CSheesh. I get that. Things are kinda... kinda rough now, yeah."@Hey, I mean, can’t hope for much better than that, right?"6Hah! Yeah, yeah, I get that. Same here, honestly."QBut, um, you competing? I mean, obviously, but, yeah, great to see you here."MSorry, I’m rambling. I’m kind of a nervous idiot before a challenge."`I barely scraped past Samorn, honestly, and I’m not super sure how well this is gonna go."%I, uh, I hope I get to face you."VGood. I want to see you at full power, y’know? Take off those training weights."rI thought of it on the way over and was like, oh, wow, I might actually be squaring off against you properly."hHah! You really take this seriously, huh? But, nah, I wouldn’t bet on me either. I know my place."kAww. Don’t want to hurt my feelings? I mean, it’s not like you have any reason to be scared of me."MIf we do face each other, I... yeah, let’s be clear: I’m gonna lose."MBut I’m going to try my best, and if I make it close, I’ll be happy."tSometimes you just gotta say “well, I’m not the best person in the room, but that isn’t gonna stop me.”"TUm. Yeah. So, uh, I don’t know if you noticed, but… this isn’t my Phione."VYeah. So, uh, my Phione laid an egg, and that egg hatched into this li’l thing."HMy Phione’s napping right now, but this rascal is full of energy."^This one’s a bit more feisty. It’s got this, I don’t know, devil-may-care attitude."dMy Phione’s pretty chill. Maybe it’ll mellow with age? This one just hatched, so who knows."7Yeah, no worries. I didn’t really expect you to."This little rascal just hatched from an egg – my Phione’s a bit more chill, a bit more mellow. This one’s a real fighter."iNo, no, mine is napping. This is a newly-hatched Phione, complete with youthful rebellious attitude."$Which, y’know, cool, I guess.".But, uh, yeah. I’ve got a spare Phione."�I don’t know how useful the squirt will be to you, but if you want it, I’d be more than happy to give it to you. I know you’ll care for it."XI hope it helps you out somewhere, sometime. It’s looking for a fight. I know it."SNo? Alright, well, maybe you’ll get a second chance if you change your mind."]Anyways, yeah, tournament is kicking off, so bye for now. Maybe I’ll see you in there."mHope so. And then – oh, yeah, I almost forgot. My Phione’s been wanting to visit the water recently."@I just... I know it. It needs something. Somewhere special."uI’ve heard about some kind of deep spring or river or something around the <imp>base of the Eleig river</imp>."UI’m gonna try and find it after the Championship wraps up. I owe it to Phione."=So... yeah. So long, friend. Hope I’ll see you around."Take the Phione."Don't take the Phione."
