."@My mom will worry, but she knows I can take care of myself."ZAlessa... she’ll be the first person I talk to when I get back. I miss her already."DBut she’s used to it. She’s a better friend than I deserve."No. I can’t."`Consider this my exile, or my recovery, or my finding myself. However you need to frame it."_Sometimes I just... need to disappear. And I can’t think of a better place to disappear."BLike I said – I’ll return. This wasn’t our last battle."YOh, \PN. You’re going to make me cry again. Don’t – don’t make me cry again."Q...I love you. I don’t mean that in any certain way, I just... I love you."0Thank you. Awww, \PN. I’m crying. *sniff*"Are you ready to go?"Your Pokémon...?"Your friends...?"Please stay."Hug her."Not yet."
