eeing a new face around here! You’re \PN, aren’t you? I’ve heard so much about you!"NI’m Lainie – you might’ve heard about me? I’m kind of a big deal."SOh good! I’d hate to think that NONE of my friends even mentioned me to you."�Lainie! Winner of the Lainie Award for Staving Off Existential Dread ten years in a row! It’s got my name in it for a reason, you know."�The honor is all mine! I knew you’d drop by sooner or later but I’m still giddy I get to see you in person! The one and only!"XSo, we know each other – you know what that means! It’s time to become friends!"2This is what you do with your friends, right?" You can’t escape forever!"vYay! Don’t expect this to be easy, though! I’m the best of all my friends... and I’ve got a lot of friends."TWow! So you ARE good! You could be one of my bestest friends one day, you know." Oh, but I’m running late!"ZI’ve got an appointment to keep – a li’l rendezvous with some old, OLD friends."<Adieu, \PN! It’s been lovely! You can go now, though!"SHey! She told you you could leave now. Don’t disrespect my friend like that."WUgh. Just gonna traipse on through Lainie’s home? Our home? Some friend you are."YYou aren’t gonna get away with this. Think you can just do whatever you want, huh?"^Lainie’s reuniting with some old friends right now. Please leave. Immediately. Or else."tDon’t be surprised if everyone unfriends you after this. Betraying Lainie is beyond the pale. Unforgivable..."@Lainie... I’m sorry. I’ll try better next time, friend."Take it."Don't take it."I've heard of you."	Who?"It's an honor."Uh, I need to go."Let's do this.[,"_¡Hey! ¡Aún estoy llevando la personificación de un vacío cielo sin estrellas conmigo!"e¡Es un recordatorio constante de la permanencia de la muerte! ¡Por favor quitámelo de encima!"�¡Yay! ¡Ahora tengo una oportunidad para ganar el Premio Lainie por Prever Temor Existencial! ¡Vamos por la onceava edición seguida!"!Oh, ¿Qué ocurre, Necrozma?"�¿Algún día no muy lejano vas a consumir los ú