oze most unprepared teams."{Plus, they give you an easy way to shut down the competition’s weathers – just override that sucker with your own."Hey..."Adiue, \PN.">Pick your moves well! It’s not just about hitting hard."�A momentum move like Volt Switch can get a fast Pokémon out before it gets hit or let a slow defensive one take a hit for an ally while switching."LStealing or removing items makes most Pokémon way easier to deal with."*Or just go fast with a priority move!"rThey can stop a sweep from being, um, swept, or just get one last punch in before your slow Pokémon go down."+Could I interest you in a Shiny Charm?"GIts an item that makes shiny Pokemon more likely to appear to you."-I'll part with it for 200 Battle Points."VJust don't ask where I got the charm or what I'm gonna do with the Battle Points."0I'm glad we could come to an understanding."#Shame. Well, the offer stands."+Which... it looks like you don't have."Well, the offer stands."'Oh! This bush has a hidden switch."Press the hidden switch?"'You leave the hidden switch alone."9You sense that a small hole has opened up somewhere!"The Battle Monument"2"The heroes of the past tower over us still.""gA small logo at the bottom right identifies Bogdan Concrete as the company hired for this project."Yes"GThe peeps on the TV are saying that the Avatar Crisis is over now."?I bet you ain't got much to spend your time on, therefore."�Wanna just keep fighting me? I collected a ton of different Pokemon during this journey, so I have a lot of teams I want to try out."dOoh, to spice it up, I should switch to different teams between battles. A surprise every time!"+Yeah, I really love the sound of that."iPlus, I've stocked up on enough medicine at this point to afford healing up your team between bouts."
