nse! I'm sure this Trainer will show us a fighter most valiant!";Whether they win or not, however, is another matter...":What say you Trainer, another round against my troop?"Gentlemen! To arms!"(Yes! Onwards my men, into the fray!"dCowardice? Or strategy? It will be revealed to us which of the two is present here soon enough."SIt would seem that our combined might has been bested once again. What a show!"VI should have surmised as much! All four of us felt your might as you approached."JIt should come at no surprise that our new friend wishes to meet you."QPack it up gentlemen! Our quest into the dark catacombs has reached its end!"..."	...."2nd larper"AMarshadow gives you a confident smirk, puffing up its chest."ZIt probably wants to join your team. It gives gestures while holding up its Pokeball.")Accept the Marshadow onto your team?";You decide to decline the Marshadow's request for now.".You take the Pokeball from the Marshadow."5With a dramatic pose, it re-enters its Pokeball."What serendipity!"WThe Trainer yond did prove themselves worthy hast hath found our merry band again!"4This timeth however, our company is one bigger!"5Findeth us once more for a showdown of the ages!"Let's go."Onwards! Into battle!"Not right now."No."	Yes.0000Iu;␀�W[[�"{Eifion’s Manaphy undulates with excitement upon seeing you. It seems to be more confident than when you saw it last, too."5Perhaps it’s readying itself for a rematch...?"M\PN. I hope you know I had to delay a meeting with the board to be here."zFortunately I have the sway to simply tell people when and where I’ll hold my meetings. I am never late, et cetera."YYou’ve certainly proven yourself. Did you ever get around to demolishing Tamarind?"HI’ll have to ask her about it... perhaps open up some old wounds."
Hmph.">Regardless, you’ve saved our operations in this region."As well as this region."And us."Thank you."~I plan to inquire with you in the future as how best to handle LuxTech and Mavis... but that’s business. Enjoy the ceremony."...An empty seat."eNothing to note here, except for a faint scent. Smells like... clear water, and white flowers..."HYo! Great to see you again! Man, it feels like it’s been forever."kGonna be honest: it’s really damn hard sitting here. Just, like, it was supposed to be me, y’know?"EBut don’t get me wrong: you earned this. You gave 110 percent."9Maybe more like 150, honestly. Glad I got to see it."+Hey. Didn’t expect to see me, right?"kI didn’t expect to be here, honestly. Got the invite from Tamarind and nearly threw it in the trash."4But I figured, ah, why not? So, uh, I’m here.")Good job becoming Champion. I guess?"aGonna be honest: I don’t really know you. But I guess you’re cool, so… yeah, congrats."bFreeing me from being a gym leader is worth a thousand times more to me than this whole mess."AYou done lollygagging? We can get started whenever you want."JYou want me to count the number of seconds we’ve got this room for?"+Because I can. I’ve got a timer set."%Fine, go. Make it quick, though.".Let’s get this started. Quick ceremony."FPurely, uh, ceremonial. I don’t even have a trophy to give you."Alright…"bWith the shockingly broad powers invested in me as Makya’s regional Professor, I hereby –"1Is this the part where I say “I object?”""\PN. You’re looking better."UHelluva lot better than last time I saw you, to be honest. This place suits you."2So does not burning the Litwick at both ends."Damn straight!"xSorry I’m late – my companion here apparently has some outstanding warrants and I needed to grease a few palms."You know how it is."*That’s me! But, seriously, c’mon."^You got the title of Champion the second you beat me. You want her to tell you it, or me?"Hahaha!"1Hey, kiddo. Are you actually glad to see me?"9I can’t even remember the last time that happened.",Oh, but I’m forgetting: this is Zoé."You two’ve met, I know."�After I left, I ran into her. One thing led to another, and now we’re a thing. Sorry to break your heart if you were hoping for an edgy industrial goth GF.">*hiss* The mask’s practical, idiot! And I’m not edgy!"\Ugh. If you want edge, I’ll show you edge. Wait till you see me dressed to the nines."He wishes."<...Ugh. Sorry, that’s reflexive. Yes, we’re dating."$*hiss* Leave Mavis out of this.":I haven’t even met her and I already hate her guts."`You talking to me or him? 'Cause we both disappeared for a few months. It’s a long story."#Oh, no, keep going, you three."rI really want to hear more about which of you is dating the gym leader I forgot existed. We’ve got all day."XActually, you know what, that’s a good point. Fine, Zain, you were the runner-up."`You do the ceremony! I finally get to delegate! Now I know what it feels like to be Helena!"DYou three gremlins get this figured out. I’m done! I’m out!"-OK, I think it goes something like this."uWith the – what’d she say? – shockingly broad powers invested in me? As, what, your jackass older brother?"LWith said powers, I hereby bestow upon you, \PN, the title of Champion."oY’know, for being a spoiled rich brat and a golden child, you’re actually pretty cool. You want a hug?"Aww, kid. Damn..."4*hiss* Sorry. You two are too cute not to join."^\PN, I promise we’re gonna take care of you from now on whether you like it or not, OK?"xZain and I have been talking about you and Mavis and everything and... yeah. We’re gonna adopt you if we have to."uWell, that’s moving a little fast... but, yeah. What she means to say is that I want to make things up to you."(And that means being there for you."zSo, y’know, if things don’t work out with Mavis and you need someone... we’re your family. If you’ll have us."	Hah!"-Don’t worry, I get it. I deserve that."JBut, uh, listen, kid: if you need me, I’m here. Same goes for Zoé."XIf things don’t work out with Mavis, we’ll be your family. If you’ll have us."'You never gotta be alone. Alright?"UOf course. You’re welcome, kiddo. Champion. \PN. Whatever you’re called now."\I can’t promise much, but I’ll be there for you. Things are gonna be different now."GLove you too. Can’t believe I didn’t for a little while there."eBut, hey, we can’t change the past, right? Only the future. Things are gonna be different now."9I know you will. You’re tough, and you’re smart."?But if you ever aren’t fine, I’m here for you. We are."'Things are gonna be different now."WIt would be totally disrespectful to leave now, while everyone is waiting for you!"Hello, nondescript friend!"VI am studiously not remembering any prior interaction we may or may not have had!"aI am present at this location to support you in whatever endeavor you are here to undertake!"RI do this because you are my friend and Lainie does not let her friends down!"}Even if sometimes she really wishes she could just forget about them and the incredibly awkward things they witnessed..."Hello, \PN."{The importance of the Champion title is lost on me, but I received an invitation, and had no intention of refusing it."^Consider this minor show of moral support repayment for your assistance. Congratulations."Hey! \PN! Great work!"�I am absolutely STOKED that you got an actual ceremony. I sent Tamarind five letters telling her how disappointed I was that the whole thing got ruined!"oI, uh, also tried to see if Zoé would show up, but she’s still gone. Starting to get worried about her."/But that’s a me problem! You just relax!"0Howdy. Hope you ain’t feelin’ stood up."]I plan on buyin' you a drink, never you worry. Just ain't been feelin' it with Yez gone."�Part of my mind just ain’t in the here and now. Figured I’d show up for this, at least. I’ve been thinkin’ 'bout you more than I’d like to admit. Hah!"cDon’tcha go givin’ me that look. Go on. Git. We’ll have time enough for chit-chat later."Hah. Damn kid..."GHey! Lookin’ pretty good. Sorry this took so long to get set up."~We were supposed to get you officially coronated as Champion right after the tournament, but then there was The Incident."wAnd since it takes eight billion years to get anything through bureaucracy limbo here, it’s... how late is this?""Three months? Two and a half?"DOh, and we only have thirty minutes, so let’s keep it moving."iThanks. Can’t help but notice you didn’t say I was lookin’ good... but that’s fair, I guess."kFor one, I’m like twenty-five years older than you. And, uh, for two I’ve got some grey coming in.",Never let it be said I aged with grace."pBut who’s counting? You want me to tell you I’m sorry? You know me well enough to know I’m not gonna."TI’ve had enough on my plate without trying to set up your little victory lap."You’re very welcome."TAt least someone appreciates the monumental effort I put into this damn region."]You know how hard it is to get even a single person in a room for half an hour in Makya?"AEveryone’s always scheming or brooding or committing sins."@But like I said, we’re on a timer, so let’s get moving."nI know certain individuals who will remain unnamed will have their eyes on their watches the entire time."uHonestly I can’t believe the stars aligned to get everyone I needed in one place for this long. Minor miracle."%Anyways! Let’s go, let’s go!"gThere’s a letter on the table. The paper smells faintly of perfume, and you know it’s for you."R“Congratulations. You deserve this. You’re this region’s gleaming star."LMake them respect you. Make them worship you. They don’t deserve you."gPlease accept my utmost apologies for not being able to attend. I still have matters to attend to."gLoose ends to be wrapped up – or severed. We’ll be together soon, and then never parted again."Ever yours, S.”"&Hmph. Nice to see you doing well."}It was only a walk to get here, and I needed an excuse to get out anyways. I don’t really keep up with current events."BGuess you did pretty well, though. That tracks. I can see it."3Takes a lot to impress me. You do. Keep at it."�There’s a Ditto in attendance. It roils amicably, seemingly glad that its mythical counterpart is taking the attention off of it."It gleams up at you with pinpoint eyes. You’re sure in its head it’s making a joke about you, but not at your expense."eHats off to you, champ. The moment you first beat me, I knew you were in this for the long haul."FIf only I knew how right I was. I would’ve made some bets! Hah!".Hey, Champion! Didn’t expect to see me?"rI’ve been, like, superglued to Tammy’s side the past few months. Couldn’t get away even if I wanted to."]But, like, I wouldn’t miss it for the world, dummy! Love ya way too much to miss this!"oAh, my dear \PN. I’ve been watching your ascendance with prying eyes ever since I eloped unto the night."ZYou show such grace and strength! No one could be disappointed with your performance."<But there’s someone you wish was here, isn’t there?"^Never fear! A late entrance is a dramatic entrance, wouldn’t you agree, darling? Ahaha!"NThere’s a Mew in attendance. Nobody seems to know what to make of that."�Personally, the Mew seems to be exulting in being an enigma. It also seems rather proud of you, and its similarly-mutable companion."pYour suffering has reached its end! The long, arduous climb has culminated with you at the zenith of Makya!"JI hope beyond hope that my tempering has contributed to your victory."XNow that role belongs to you! Test all challengers! Test them with fury and frenzy!"(Oh, \PN, I’m so happy to see you!"aYou deserve to have your victory celebrated. You’ve done so much for all of us. Thank you."kNow go enjoy your time in the spotlight – even if this ceremony is a little smaller than I’d like."One sec."Yeah, I'm ready."
Zain."You made it!"Jackass."Hey, kiddo."Sure you aren't."You're dating?"Mavis know?" That's where you’ve been?"Hug him."Don't hug him."Thanks, Zain."Love you."I'll be fine."Good to see you too."Two months, twenty days."Thanks."2Things are going to be different from now on.[�"wEl Manaphy de Eifion se ondula con emoción al verte. También parece más seguro que la última vez que lo viste."8¿Quizás se está preparando para una revancha...?"\\PN. Espero que sepas que tuve que retrasar una reunión con la junta para estar aquí."�Afortunadamente tengo la influencia para simplemente decirle a la gente donde y cuando tendrés mis reuniones. Nunca llego tarde, etcetera."VCiertamente has demostrado tu valía. ¿Alguna vez llegaste a demoler a Tamarind?"STendré que preguntarle al respecto... quizás abrir un par de viejas heridas."
Hmph."IEn cualquier caso, has salvado nuestras operaciones en esta región."Al igual que esta región."Y a nosotros."Gracias."}Planeo inquirirte en el futuro sobre cómo manejar a LuxTech y a Mavis... pero esos son negocios. Disfruta la ceremonia."...Un asiento vacío."aNada que notar aquí, más que un leve aroma. Huele como... agua limpia, y flores blancas..."F¡Hey! ¡Genial verte de nuevo! Hombre, cuánto tiempo ha pasado."xVoy a serte honesto: es realmente díficil sentarse aquí. Sólo, no sé, se supone que tenía que ser yo, ¿Sabes?"GPero no me malentiendas: te ganaste esto. Diste el 110 por ciento."EMás bien como el 150, la verdad. Me alegra poder haberlo visto."'Hey. No esperabas verme, ¿Cierto?"hNo esperaba venir aquí, la verdad. Recibí la invitación de Tamarind y casi la tiré a la basura."?Pero pensé, ah, ¿Por qué no? Entonces, eh, estoy aquí.";Buen trabajo en convertirte en el Campeón. ¿Supongo?"nVoy a serte honesto: realmente no te conozco. Pero supongo que eres genial, así que... seh, felicidades."`Liberarme de ser un líder de gimnasio vale mil veces más para mí que todo este desastre."I¿Ya terminaste de perder el tiempo? Podemos empezar cuando quieras."U¿Quieres que cuente el número de segundos en los que tenemos esta habitación?"0Porque puedo. Tengo un temporizador puesto." Bien, vamos. Pero apúrate.")Empecemos con esta. Ceremonia veloz."FPuramente, eh, ceremonial. Ni siquiera tengo un trofeo que darte."Muy bien…"iCon los sorprendemente amplios poderes que poseo como la Profesora regional de Makya, te declaro –"3¿Es esta la parte en la que digo "Me opongo"?"\PN. Te ves mejor."UMuchísimo mejor que la última vez que te vi, la verdad. Este lugar te va bien."+Al igual que no trabajar sin descanso."¡Bien directo!"}Disculpa mi tardanza – mi compañera aquí aparentemente tiene unos asuntos pendientes y tuve que hacer un par de sobornos."Ya sabes como es.")¡Ese soy yo! Pero, en serio, vamos."fObtuviste el título de Campeón el segundo que me venciste. ¿Quieres que ella te lo dije, o yo?"¡Jajaja!"-Hey, chico. ¿Realmente te alegra verme?"@Ni siquiera puedo recordar la última vez que eso ocurrió."/Oh, pero lo estoy olvidando: esta es Zoé.""Los dos nos conocimos, sabes."�Luego de irme, me encontre con ella. Una cosa llevó a la otra, y ahora somos algo. Disculpa romper tu corazón si estabas esperando un novia industrial gótica EDGY."@*hiss* ¡La máscara es práctica, idiota! ¡Y no soy edgy!"TUgh. Si quieres ver eso, te lo mostraré. Sólo espera a verme vestida de gala."Ya él quisiera."B...Ugh. Lo siento, eso fue un reflejo. Sí, estamos saliendo."'*hiss* Deja a Mavis fuera de esto."(Aún no la conozco y ya la detesto."p¿Estás hablando conmigo o con él? Porque ambos desaparecimos por un par de meses. Es una larga historia."&Oh, no, continúen, ustedes tres."�Realmente quiero escuchar más sobre cúal de ustedes está saliendo con la líder de gimnasio que olvidé su existencia. Tenemos todo el día."YDe hecho, sabes qué, eso es un buen punto. Bien, Zain, tú fuiste el segundo lugar."i¡Tú haces la ceremonica! ¡Finalmente puedo delegar algo! ¡Ahora sé lo que se siente ser Helena!"QUstedes tres gremlins ya resolvieron esto. ¡Ya terminé con esto! ¡Me voy!"Ok, creo que va algo así."tCon los – ¿Qué dijo? – sorprendemente amplios poderes que poseo, como, ¿Qué? ¿Tu idiota hermano mayor?"ECon estos poderes, te declaro a ti, \PN, el título de Campeón."vYa sabes, por ser un rico mocoso malcriado y un niño de oro, eres de hecho bastante genial. ¿Quieres un abrazo?"Oww, chico. Maldita sea..."L*hiss* Lo siento. Ustedes dos son demasiado lindos como para no unirse."X\PN, prometo que a partir de ahora vamos a cuidarte ya sea que te guste o no, ¿Ok?"pZain y yo hemos estado hablando sobre ti y Mavis y todo y... seh. Vamos a adoptarte si tenemos que hacerlo."rBueno, eso es moverse un poco rápido, pero, seh. Lo que ella se refiere es que quiero reconciliarme contigo.")Y eso significa estar allí para ti."~Así que, ya sabes, si las cosas no funcionan con Mavis y necesitas a alguien... somos tu familia. Si nos permites serlo."
¡Ja!".No te preocupes, lo entiendo. Lo merezco."SPero, eh, escucha, chico: si me necesitas, estoy aquí. Lo mismo va para Zoé."TSi las cosas no funcionan con Mavis, seremos tu familia. Si nos permites serlo.")Nunca debes estar solo. ¿Entendido?"OPor supuesto. De nada, chico. Campeón. \PN. Como sea que te llames ahora."eNo puedo prometerte demasiado, pero estaré allí para ti. Las cosas van a ser diferentes ahora."CTambién te amo. No puedo creer que por un momento no lo hice."nPero, hey, no podemos cambiar el pasado, ¿Cierto? Sólo el futuro. Las cosas van a ser diferentes ahora.":Sé que lo estarás. Eres fuerte, y eres inteligente."HPero si alguna vez no estás bien, estoy aquí para ti. Lo estamos."*Las cosas van a ser diferentes ahora."Y¡Sería totalmente irrespetuoso irte ahora, mientras todos están esperando por ti!"¡Hola, insulso amigo!"i¡Estoy deliberadamente no recordando cualquier interacción anterior que podamos o no haber tenido!"h¡Estoy presente en esta ubicación para apoyarte en cualquier actividad que vayas a empezar aquí!"M¡Hago esto porque eres mi amigo y Lainie nunca decepciona a sus amigos!"�Incluso si ella a veces realmente desea que pudiera sólo olvidarlos y las increíblemente extrañas cosas que hayan presenciado..."Hola, \PN."yNo le veo la importancia al título de Campeón, pero recibí una invitación, y no tenía intención en rechazarla."eConsidera esta pequeña muestra de apoyo moral una compensación por tu asistencia. Felicidades.""¡Hey! ¡\PN! ¡Gran trabajo!"�Estoy absolutamente EMOCIONADO de que hayas obtenido una ceremonia de verdad. ¡Le envié a Tamarind cinco cartas diciendo lo decepcionado que estaba de que todo esto haya sido arruinado!"tEh, también intenté que Zoé apareciera, pero sigue estando perdida. Me estoy empezando a preocupar por ella.";¡Pero eso es un problema mío! ¡Tú sólo relájate!"8Buenas. Espero que no te estés sintiendo plantado."lPlaneo comprarte una bebida, no te preocupes. Sólo no me he sintiendo tan bien desde que Yez no está."�Parte de mimente no está conmigo ahora mismo. Supuse que tenía que venir para esto, al menos. He estado pensando en ti más de lo que me gustaría admitir. ¡Ja!"\No estés mirándome así. Vamos. Fuera. Tendremos suficiente tiempo para hablar luego."Ja. Maldito chico..."M¡Hey! Te ves bien. Disculpa que esto haya tardado tanto en organizarse."Se suponía que teníamos que oficialmente coronarte Campeón justo después del torneo, pero luego ocurrió El Incidente."�Y ya que toma ocho mil millones de años en hacer cualquier cosa en el limbo burocrático que es este lugar, ¿Han sido... qué tan tarde ha sido esto?"!¿Tres meses? ¿Dos y medio?"AOh, y sólo tenemos treinta minutos, así que apuremos esto."_Gracias. No pude evitar notar que nodijiste que me veo bien... pero eso es justo, supongo."nEn primer lugar, soy veinticinco años más vieja que tú. Y, eh, en segundo lugar tengo un par de canas."1Nunca podré decir que envejecí con gracia."�¿Pero quién está contando? ¿Quieres que te diga que lo siento? Me conoces lo suficientemente bien para saber que no lo estoy."QTuve suficiente de mi parte sin intentar organizar tu pequeña celebración."De nada."WAl menos alguien aprecia el esfuerzo monumental que pongo en esta maldita región."k¿Sabes lo díficil que es conseguir si quiera una persona en una habitación por media hora en Makya?"GTodos están siempre maquinando o taciturnos o cometiendo pecados."MPero como dije, no tenemos todo el tiempo del mundo, así que empecemos."eSé que ciertos individuos que no voy a nombrar tendrán sus ojos en sus relojes todo el tiempo."�Honestamente no puedo creer que los astros se alinearan para conseguir a todos los que necesitaba en un lugar por todo este tiempo. Milagro menor." ¡Como sea! ¡Vamos, vamos!"^Hay una carta en la mesa. El papel tiene un leve aroma a perfume, y sabes que es para ti."O“Felicidades. Te mereces esto. Eres la estrella brillante de la región."AHaz que te respeten. Haz que te adoren. Ellos no te merecen."ePor favor acepta mis más sinceras disculpas por no poder estar. Aún tengo asuntos que atender."hCabos sueltos que atar – o arrancar. Estaremos juntos pronto, y luego nunca más nos separaremos."Siempre tuyo, S.”""Hmph. Bueno verte estar bien."�Sólo era una caminata para llegar aquí, y necesitaba una excusa para salir de todos modos. Realmente no estoy al día de los eventos actuales."JSupongo que lo hiciste bastante bien. Eso tiene sentido. Puedo verlo."CToma demasiado para impresionarme. Tú lo haces. Sigue a ello."�Hay un Ditto presente. Se agita amistosamente, aparentemente contenta de que su contraparte singular esté tomando toda su atención."Mira hacia ti con sus ojos de punto. Puedes asegurar que en su cabeza está haciendo una broma sobre ti, pero no a costa de ti."Me quito el sombrero ante ti, campeón. En el primer momento en que me venciste, sabía que te iba a ir bien en el futuro."]Si sólo hubiera sabido qué tanta razó tenía. ¡Habría hecho algunas apuestas! ¡Ja!"1¡Hey, Campeón! ¿Acaso no esperabas verme?"zHe estado, como, superpegada al lado de Tammy durante los últimos meses. No podría haberme ido incluso si quisiera."o¡Pero, como, no me perdería esto por nada ne el mundo, bobo! ¡Te amo demasiado como para perderme esto!"mAh, mi querido \PN. He estado observado tu dominio con curiosos ojos desde que me fugué hacia la noche."X¡Muestras tan gracia y fuerza! Nadie podría estar decepcionado con tu actuación."HPero hay alguien que desearías que estuviera aquí, ¿Me equivoco?"k¡Nunca temas! Una entrada tardía es una entrada dramática, ¿No estás de acuerdo, cariño? ¡Jaja!"EHay un Mew presente. Nadie parece saber qué opinar al respecto."�Personalmente, el Mew, parece regocijarse en ser un enigma. También parece estar orgullosa de ti, y su similarmente-mutable compañera."q¡Tu sufrimiento ha llegado a su fin! ¡La larga, ardua escalada ha culminado contigo en el cénit de Makya!"PEspero con todo mi ser que mi temperamente haya contribuído a tu victoria."p¡Ahora ese rol te pertenece! ¡Pon a prueba a todos los aspirantes ¡Ponlos a prueba con furia y frenesí!")¡Oh, \PN, estoy tan feliz de verte!"]Mereces que tu victoria sea celebrada. Has hecho demasiado para todos nosotros. Gracias."}Ahora ve y disfruta tu tiempo en el estrellato – incluso si esta ceremonia es un poco más pequeña de lo que me gustaría."Un segundo."Seh, estoy listo."
Zain."¡Llegaste!"Idiota."Hey, chico."Seguro que no."¿Están saliendo?"¿Mavis sabe?"!¿Ahí es dónde has estado?"Abrazarlo."No abrazarlo."Gracias, Zain."Te amo."Estaré bien."También es bueno verte."Dos meses, veinte días."Gracias."9Las cosas van a ser diferentes de ahora en adelante.;[�"{Eifion’s Manaphy undulates with excitement upon seeing you. It seems to be more confident than when you saw it last, too."5Perhaps it’s readying itself for a rematch...?"M\PN. I hope you know I had to delay a meeting with the board to be here."zFortunately I have the sway to simply tell people when and where I’ll hold my meetings. I am never late, et cetera."YYou’ve certainly proven yourself. Did you ever get around to demolishing Tamarind?"HI’ll have to ask her about it... perhaps open up some old wounds."
Hmph.">Regardless, you’ve saved our operations in this region."As well as this region."And us."Thank you."~I plan to inquire with you in the future as how best to handle LuxTech and Mavis... but that’s business. Enjoy the ceremony."...An empty seat."eNothing to note here, except for a faint scent. Smells like... clear water, and white flowers..."HYo! Great to see you again! Man, it feels like it’s been forever."kGonna be honest: it’s really damn hard sitting here. Just, like, it was supposed to be me, y’know?"EBut don’t get me wrong: you earned this. You gave 110 percent."9Maybe more like 150, honestly. Glad I got to see it."+Hey. Didn’t expect to see me, right?"kI didn’t expect to be here, honestly. Got the invite from Tamarind and nearly threw it in the trash."4But I figured, ah, why not? So, uh, I’m here.")Good job becoming Champion. I guess?"aGonna be honest: I don’t really know you. But I guess you’re cool, so… yeah, congrats."bFreeing me from being a gym leader is worth a thousand times more to me than this whole mess."AYou done lollygagging? We can get started whenever you want."JYou want me to count the number of seconds we’ve got this room for?"+Because I can. I’ve got a timer set."%Fine, go. Make it quick, though.".Let’s get this started. Quick ceremony."FPurely, uh, ceremonial. I don’t even have a trophy to give you."Alright…"bWith the shockingly broad powers invested in me as Makya’s regional Professor, I hereby –"1Is this the part where I say “I object?”""\PN. You’re looking better."UHelluva lot better than last time I saw you, to be honest. This place suits you."2So does not burning the Litwick at both ends."Damn straight!"xSorry I’m late – my companion here apparently has some outstanding warrants and I needed to grease a few palms."You know how it is."*That’s me! But, seriously, c’mon."^You got the title of Champion the second you beat me. You want her to tell you it, or me?"Hahaha!"1Hey, kiddo. Are you actually glad to see me?"9I can’t even remember the last time that happened.",Oh, but I’m forgetting: this is Zoé."You two’ve met, I know."�After I left, I ran into her. One thing led to another, and now we’re a thing. Sorry to break your heart if you were hoping for an edgy industrial goth GF.">*hiss* The mask’s practical, idiot! And I’m not edgy!"\Ugh. If you want edge, I’ll show you edge. Wait till you see me dressed to the nines."He wishes."<...Ugh. Sorry, that’s reflexive. Yes, we’re dating."$*hiss* Leave Mavis out of this.":I haven’t even met her and I already hate her guts."`You talking to me or him? 'Cause we both disappeared for a few months. It’s a long story."#Oh, no, keep going, you three."rI really want to hear more about which of you is dating the gym leader I forgot existed. We’ve got all day."XActually, you know what, that’s a good point. Fine, Zain, you were the runner-up."`You do the ceremony! I finally get to delegate! Now I know what it feels like to be Helena!"DYou three gremlins get this figured out. I’m done! I’m out!"-OK, I think it goes something like this."uWith the – what’d she say? – shockingly broad powers invested in me? As, what, your jackass older brother?"LWith said powers, I hereby bestow upon you, \PN, the title of Champion."oY’know, for being a spoiled rich brat and a golden child, you’re actually pretty cool. You want a hug?"Aww, kid. Damn..."4*hiss* Sorry. You two are too cute not to join."^\PN, I promise we’re gonna take care of you from now on whether you like it or not, OK?"xZain and I have been talking about you and Mavis and everything and... yeah. We’re gonna adopt you if we have to."uWell, that’s moving a little fast... but, yeah. What she means to say is that I want to make things up to you."(And that means being there for you."zSo, y’know, if things don’t work out with Mavis and you need someone... we’re your family. If you’ll have us."	Hah!"-Don’t worry, I get it. I deserve that."JBut, uh, listen, kid: if you need me, I’m here. Same goes for Zoé."XIf things don’t work out with Mavis, we’ll be your family. If you’ll have us."'You never gotta be alone. Alright?"UOf course. You’re welcome, kiddo. Champion. \PN. Whatever you’re called now."\I can’t promise much, but I’ll be there for you. Things are gonna be different now."GLove you too. Can’t believe I didn’t for a little while there."eBut, hey, we can’t change the past, right? Only the future. Things are gonna be different now."9I know you will. You’re tough, and you’re smart."?But if you ever aren’t fine, I’m here for you. We are."'Things are gonna be different now."WIt would be totally disrespectful to leave now, while everyone is waiting for you!"Hello, nondescript friend!"VI am studiously not remembering any prior interaction we may or may not have had!"aI am present at this location to support you in whatever endeavor you are here to undertake!"RI do this because you are my friend and Lainie does not let her friends down!"}Even if sometimes she really wishes she could just forget about them and the incredibly awkward things they witnessed..."Hello, \PN."{The importance of the Champion title is lost on me, but I received an invitation, and had no intention of refusing it."^Consider this minor show of moral support repayment for your assistance. Congratulations."Hey! \PN! Great work!"�I am absolutely STOKED that you got an actual ceremony. I sent Tamarind five letters telling her how disappointed I was that the whole thing got ruined!"oI, uh, also tried to see if Zoé would show up, but she’s still gone. Starting to get worried about her."/But that’s a me problem! You just relax!"0Howdy. Hope you ain’t feelin’ stood up."]I plan on buyin' you a drink, never you worry. Just ain't been feelin' it with Yez gone."�Part of my mind just ain’t in the here and now. Figured I’d show up for this, at least. I’ve been thinkin’ 'bout you more than I’d like to admit. Hah!"cDon’tcha go givin’ me that look. Go on. Git. We’ll have time enough for chit-chat later."Hah. Damn kid..."GHey! Lookin’ pretty good. Sorry this took so long to get set up."~We were supposed to get you officially coronated as Champion right after the tournament, but then there was The Incident."wAnd since it takes eight billion years to get anything through bureaucracy limbo here, it’s... how late is this?""Three months? Two and a half?"DOh, and we only have thirty minutes, so let’s keep it moving."iThanks. Can’t help but notice you didn’t say I was lookin’ good... but that’s fair, I guess."kFor one, I’m like twenty-five years older than you. And, uh, for two I’ve got some grey coming in.",Never let it be said I aged with grace."pBut who’s counting? You want me to tell you I’m sorry? You know me well enough to know I’m not gonna."TI’ve had enough on my plate without trying to set up your little victory lap."You’re very welcome."TAt least someone appreciates the monumental effort I put into this damn region."]You know how hard it is to get even a single person in a room for half an hour in Makya?"AEveryone’s always scheming or brooding or committing sins."@But like I said, we’re on a timer, so let’s get moving."nI know certain individuals who will remain unnamed will have their eyes on their watches the entire time."uHonestly I can’t believe the stars aligned to get everyone I needed in one place for this long. Minor miracle."%Anyways! Let’s go, let’s go!"gThere’s a letter on the table. The paper smells faintly of perfume, and you know it’s for you."R“Congratulations. You deserve this. You’re this region’s gleaming star."LMake them respect you. Make them worship you. They don’t deserve you."gPlease accept my utmost apologies for not being able to attend. I still have matters to attend to."gLoose ends to be wrapped up – or severed. We’ll be together soon, and then never parted again."Ever yours, S.”"&Hmph. Nice to see you doing well."}It was only a walk to get here, and I needed an excuse to get out anyways. I don’t really keep up with current events."BGuess you did pretty well, though. That tracks. I can see it."3Takes a lot to impress me. You do. Keep at it."�There’s a Ditto in attendance. It roils amicably, seemingly glad that its mythical counterpart is taking the attention off of it."It gleams up at you with pinpoint eyes. You’re sure in its head it’s making a joke about you, but not at your expense."eHats off to you, champ. The moment you first beat me, I knew you were in this for the long haul."FIf only I knew how right I was. I would’ve made some bets! Hah!".Hey, Champion! Didn’t expect to see me?"rI’ve been, like, superglued to Tammy’s side the past few months. Couldn’t get away even if I wanted to."]But, like, I wouldn’t miss it for the world, dummy! Love ya way too much to miss this!"oAh, my dear \PN. I’ve been watching your ascendance with prying eyes ever since I eloped unto the night."ZYou show such grace and strength! No one could be disappointed with your performance."<But there’s someone you wish was here, isn’t there?"^Never fear! A late entrance is a dramatic entrance, wouldn’t you agree, darling? Ahaha!"NThere’s a Mew in attendance. Nobody seems to know what to make of that."�Personally, the Mew seems to be exulting in being an enigma. It also seems rather proud of you, and its similarly-mutable companion."pYour suffering has reached its end! The long, arduous climb has culminated with you at the zenith of Makya!"JI hope beyond hope that my tempering has contributed to your victory."XNow that role belongs to you! Test all challengers! Test them with fury and frenzy!"(Oh, \PN, I’m so happy to see you!"aYou deserve to have your victory celebrated. You’ve done so much for all of us. Thank you."kNow go enjoy your time in the spotlight – even if this ceremony is a little smaller than I’d like."One sec."Yeah, I'm ready."
