h this much literature."mDo you think you can search LuxTech for any servers hosting data from before Team Chasm was established?"VI’ll keep on searching here in the meantime for something hidden in the stacks."7Let me know if you find something over at LuxTech."PI’ve only been finding fun facts, the kind you’d see on a moving truck."IDid you know that hexagons were an important symbols of the Seekers?";That’s apparently what inspired Team Chasm’s logo."You’re back! Excellent.":I managed to make a breakthrough while you were away."9Would you mind showing me what you’ve found first?"%You hand over the Old USB Drive.")Nora loads the device on her laptop."Fascinating."�This one file, Project Chrysopoeia Albedo, goes into great detail of a large volcanic eruption thousands of years ago which heavily impacted the region."uIt makes sense that the large clouds of ash would be devastating to a civilization in its technological infancy."BThis must be the "great darkness" that the Seekers mentioned."qPerhaps that’s also why they built what would become the underground ruins; like those found in Mt. Kilna?"CMaybe those places were meant to be safe spaces from the smog?"KWait, no. Why would they have built shelters if they had the guardian?"2Hahaha. This is the rush I’ve been seeking."0Questions whose answers are more questions."tAs for my own findings: I found references to an aboveground ruins site which might lead to what we’re after."GI’ll be waiting for you in <imp>Svait, on the upper level</imp>."sGuess I forgot to keep the door locked… but I can’t really turn away the esteemed Champion \PN, now can I?"sI don’t know why you’re here but, if I had to make a guess… you’re searching for something; like I am.Iu;␀�[[0";Wow! It's a Volcanion, trapped inside a large boulder!"(Hey, \PN! Come around to the front."~It’s still so striking to me that at any time, Team Chasm could’ve added this protector of the region to its arsenal."oSure, they managed to capture Heatran, the 