opias del mismo cartel, todos publicitando un paquete de seguros que será disponible en el futuro.;["vMultiple copies of the same sign, all advertising an insurance package deal that will be available in the future.Iu;␀�	[["6A golden fruit glistens in a space atop the tree."HA gleaming silver tree. The space at the top is empty of any fruit."\Behind me stand two sides of a similar coin – An arrogant child and a cowardly elder."IBoth too fearful to recognize the harm they cause our King of Kings."WBut not I! With vigor and wit interwoven, <i>I see the world as it always was.</i>"eA wonderful battle – nothing short of greatness! But to what do I owe this sudden late.. ness?"DNo matter! <i>You are but a grain of sand against His will.</i>"HFrom above, from above! Our great King revealed Himself from above!"�Mere prey, my critters and I both - but with a whispered edict and a gentle hand, <i>the meek will rise, by every means they can muster.</i>"SAwwww… I thought <i>my</i> team was perfect! Oh well, time to go back home!!"bNeither heedless trainer nor winged creature <i>shall ever pluck away at His great reign.</i>"BFear, guilt, and shame - a trinity of self-imposed suffering."CThey stood as my lifelong companions, but no longer must they."7<i>Fear means nothing under His watchful gaze.</i>"O-Oriel..?"OHow foolish of you, <i>rejecting greater purpose with such conviction.</i>"Harvest the golden fruit?["<Una fruta dorada brilla en una espacio sobre el árbol."PUn árbol de plata brillante. El espacio en la punta está libre de frutos."iDetrás de mí se paran dos lados de una moneda similar – Un niño arrogante y un anciano cobarde."VAmbos demasiados temorosos para reconocer el daño que le causan al Rey de Reyes."\¡Pero no yo! Con vigor e ingenio entretejido <i>veo el mundo como siempre ha sido.</i>"uUn maravilloso combate – ¡uno que no se queda corto de grandeza! ¿Pero a qué debo esta súbita... tardanza?"P¡No importa! <i>No eres más que un grano de arena contra S