ake the target flinch."hThe user bites the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect."cThe foe is attacked with powdery scales blown by wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."bWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, the user's Attack stat rises by five steps."kWhile resisting, the user attacks the opposing Pokémon. The targets' Sp. Atk is reduced by two steps."]The target is slashed with scythes or claws. Its power doubles if it hits in succession."bSharp spikes are shot at the target in rapid succession. They hit two to five times in a row."YThe user summons bugs to swarm the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."qThe user calls its underlings to shield it, raising its Defense and Sp. Def by two steps. Always goes first."VThe user calls out its underlings to heal it. The user regains 60% of its max HP."SThe user raises their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps, and Speed by one step."kWeaves a sticky net around the opposing team, which lowers their Speed by two steps upon switching in."pThe foe is bound with silk blown from the user's mouth. This silk reduces the target's Speed by four steps."bThe user stares at flashing lights to focus its mind, raising its Sp. Atk stat by five steps."lThe user skitters behind the target to attack. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat by two steps."�Unleashes a barrage of multi-arm attacks, skipping and destroying protections. Always hits. Lowers the user's Defense by two steps."UTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Attack stat."[The user swings both arms and hits the target. Ignores the target's stat step changes."\The user crunches up the target with sharp fangs. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."cThe user releases an aura imbued with dark thoughts. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."\The user slashes the target the instant an opportunity arises. Can random critical hit."kThis move enables the user to attack first. It fails if the target is not readying an attack, however."7The user slaps the target to knock off their item."bIf the target has already taken some damage in the same turn, this attack's power is doubled."dThe target is bitten with viciously sharp fangs. It has a 30% chance to make the target flinch."_The user swings its body around violently to inflict damage on everything in its vicinity."lThe user draws up to the foe disarmingly, then throws a sucker punch. Can't miss and skips protections."pThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."fThe user gets all the party Pokémon to attack the foe. The more party Pokémon, the more damage."dThe user throws its held item at the target. Some items deal more damage or have extra effects."[The user boasts of its strength. Power increases the more the user's stats are raised."[This attack's power increases by 10 for every one of the target's positive stat steps."jTargets are dragged into a world of total darkness that makes them sleep. This move always goes last."kIt prevents the target from using its held item. Its Trainer is also prevented from using items on it."ZThe user feigns crying to worry the target,  lowering its Sp. Def stat by four steps."QThe user sharpens its claws to raise its Attack and Accuracy by three steps."_The user lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."^The user steals the effects of any healing or stat-changing move the foe attempts to use."OThe user trades held items with the target faster than the eye can follow."eThe target is taunted into a rage that prevents it from using status moves for three more turns."kAll stat step changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were."fThe user torments and enrages the foe, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."dPrevents the user and target from switching out until either of them faints or is switched out."mThe user fakes the target out and stabs them with its disheveled hair. Can't miss and skips protections."jProtects the user from all attacks. Physical attacks lower the attacker's Defense stat by four steps."^The user strikes with a fierce blow of Dark Mastery. It always results in a critical hit."YIf the user's stats were lowered during the turn, the power of this move is doubled."rThe user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. It has a 50% chance to make the target flinch."hThe user blasts the target with power that distorts even time. The user must rest on the next turn."TComets are summoned down from the sky. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."1The user rampages and attacks for two turns."iThe user rubs its scales and makes a huge noise. Also lowers the user's Defense stat by three steps."UIf the target has already moved this turn, the effect of its Ability is negated."WThe user tears the target along with the space around it. Can random critical hit."RThe user uses its body like a hammer to attack the target and inflict damage."SThe target is attacked with a shock wave generated by the user's gaping mouth."8The user slashes the target with huge, sharp claws."VThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."ZThe user forces the target to switch out, to be replaced at random. Always goes last."eThe user attacks its target by hitting it with brutal strikes. The target is hit twice in a row."XA small tornado hits the opposing team. It has a 30% chance to make targets flinch."jThis attack hits the target with a shock wave of pure rage. This attack always inflicts 40 HP damage."kThe user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance, raising its Attack by two steps and Speed by 1."mThe user swings its tail wildly and attacks opposing Pokémon, lowering their Attack stats by two steps."dThe user attacks twice using Dreepy. If there are two targets, this move hits each target once."4The user unleashes a strong beam from its core."aEternatus's most powerful attack in its original form. The user can't move on the next turn."TThe user raises all its stats by two steps, at the cost of 1/3rd of its max HP."�Attacks all enemy Pokémon with pure vitality. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP, at its weakest when the user is at half or less."aThe user charges at its foe, surrounding itself with lightning. It has a 20% chance to numb."rThe user charges at the foe while electrified. The user also takes 33% recoil. This has a 10% chance to numb."XThe user fires an electric blast like a cannon to inflict damage and cause numbing."ZCan't miss in rainstorm. It has a 30% chance to numb. Can hit targets flying high up."fThe user throws down a giant thunderbolt. It does more damage if influenced by an enormous flame."^The user attacks with electrically charged fists. Normal-type moves become Electric-type."RA strong electric blast is loosed at the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."eThe user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."fA flare of electricity is loosed to strike the area around the user. It has a 30% chance to numb."gA strong electric blast crashes down on the target. It has a 60% chance to make the target flinch."QThe target is punched with an electrified fist. It has a 10% chance to numb."_The user attacks everything around it. The user's HP is restored by half the damage dealt."_The user throws an electrically charged tackle at the target. It has a 30% chance to numb."cThe user bites with electrified fangs. It has a 10% chance to flinch and a 10% chance to numb."dThe user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. Can't miss and skips protections."mThe user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which lowers their Speed stat by two steps."gThe user fires a concentrated bundle of electricity, raising the user's Sp. Atk stat by two steps."_A jolt of electricity is hurled at the foe to inflict damage. It has a 10% chance to numb."dThe user nuzzles its electrified cheeks against the target. This also leaves the target numbed."[The user hurls an electric orb at the foe. It does more damage the faster the user is."yThe user becomes energy charged, doubling its next Electric-type attack. Also raises the user's Defense and Sp. Def."`The user's body generates an eerie impulse. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat by four steps."NThe user levitates using electrically generated magnetism for five turns.";A weak electric charge is launched to numb the target."CAttacks opposing Pokémon by twanging a guitar or bass guitar."LType changes depending on the user's form. It has a 10% chance to numb."cAttacks with an electrified beak. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."iThe user kicks the target with lightning-like movement. It lowers the target's Defense by two steps."gThe user throws a cage of electricity around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."OThe user unleashes a strong beam. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."TThe user emits a powerful damaging flash. It has a 10% chance to lower Sp. Atk."gThe user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."\The user does emotional damage to foes. This attack never misses and skips protections."jThe user stirs up a fairy wind and strikes the target with it. There's a 10% chance it becomes dizzy."mThe user raises the Defense and Sp. Def stats of an ally Pokémon by two steps using a mysterious aroma."vThe user stares with its baby-doll eyes, which lowers the target's Attack stat by three steps. Always goes first."[The user gazes charmingly at the target. The target's Attack is lowered by four steps."WThe user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power."dBy locking down the battlefield, the user keeps all Pokémon from fleeing during the next turn."SThe user restores the target's HP by 50% of its max hp, or 2/3rds in moonglow."gThe user absorbs energy and raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed by four steps on the next turn."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."SThe user decorates the target, raising their Attack and Sp. Atk by five steps."QThe user attacks the target by emitting steam. It has a 20% chance to dizzy."kThe user focuses its mind before launching a punch. It will fail if the user is hit before it is used."aThe target is attacked with a knee kick from a jump. If it misses, the user is hurt instead."uThe user fights the foe up close without guarding itself. This lowers the user Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."AThe user heightens its mental focus and unleashes its power."iThe user attacks the target with great power. However, it also lowers the user's Attack and Defense."QThe user delivers a chop with its forearms crossed. Can random critical hit."aThe user punches the target with full, concentrated power. It dizzies the target if it hits."UThe user dives down onto the target from the sky. This move is also Flying-type."cThe user swings and hits with its strong and heavy fist. Lowers the user's Speed by two steps."aThe user jumps up high, then strikes with a kick. If the kick misses, the user hurts itself."]The user attacks by slicing with its long horns. Ignores the target's stat step changes."eThe user cuts with its long horn. The odd power contained in it does physical damage to the foe."VThe user attacks with an uppercut. Deals double damage to targets flying high up."bThe user looses a blast of aura power from deep within its body. This move is certain to hit."cThe user grabs the target and recklessly dives for the ground. The user also takes 33% recoil."eThe user attacks with a swift chop. It can also break anys Screens protecting the target's side."eAn energy-draining punch. The user's HP is restored by one third the damage taken by the target."\The user attacks last. In return, it's guaranteed not to miss and bypasses protections."cThis attack inflicts double damage on a sleeping target. It also wakes the target up, however."_The user attacks the target's legs swiftly, reducing the target's Speed stat by two steps."KThe target is attacked with a shock wave. It has a 30% chance to numb."jAn attack move that inflicts double the damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."dThe user lashes out with a quick, spinning kick. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."bThe user strikes the target with a fierce blow. This attack always results in a critical hit."GThe target is attacked with a sharp chop. Can random critical hit."NThe user throws a punch at blinding speed. It is certain to strike first."nStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack stat by two steps."PThe user attacks with a strong punch. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."hThe user whirls its fists to send a wave of pure vacuum at the target. This move always goes first."FThe target is quickly kicked twice in succession using both feet."]The user looses a flurry of open-palmed arm thrusts that hit two to five times in a row."YA consecutive three-kick attack that becomes more powerful with each successive hit."^A retaliation move that counters any physical attack, inflicting double the damage taken."[The user risks all to attack the foe. The user faints but does damage equal to its HP."bA powerful low kick that makes the foe fall over. It inflicts greater damage on heavier foes."KAn all-out attack that becomes more powerful the less HP the user has."cThe target is thrown using the power of gravity. It inflicts damage equal to the user's level."YThe user tenses its muscles to bulk up, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps."qThe user protects itself and allies from damaging moves. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."nThe user protects itself and its allies from priority moves. It always fails if it is used in succession."kLocks the target in and prevents fleeing. Lowers target's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps every turn."WAttacks wildly with swords or fists. The user must rest on the next turn, however."VThe user traps itself into the battle and raises all of their stats by two steps."WThe user coaches its ally Pokémon, raising their Attack and Defense by two steps."WThe user slams into the opponent, dealing damage based on the user's Defense stat."yWith a fiery forehead, the user hurls itself at the foe. Lowers the user's Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps."The user attacks in an explosive fury. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP, at its weakest when the user is at half or less."dThe user attacks everything by causing its own head to explode. The user also takes 50% recoil."kThe user sets a shell trap. If it is hit by a physical move, the trap explodes and hurts the attacker."pThe user attacks by engulfing the foe in a beautiful, yet intense, blue flame. It has a 20% chance to burn."ATo inflict massive damage, the user uses up its Fire-typing."XThe user attacks the target at full power. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."nThe user charges at the foe while on fire. The user also takes 33% recoil. This has a 10% chance to burn."bThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."fThe user brings down a giant flame. It does more damage if influenced by an enormous thunderbolt."cThe user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense fire. It leaves the target with a burn."VThe user spews magma around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."SThe target is razed with a mystical fire of great intensity. Burns the target."bAn inferno of scarlet flames torches everything around the user. It has a 30% chance to burn."_The user attacks by exhaling hot breath on the opposing team. It has a 30% chance to burn."WThe target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."TThe user launches a kick. Can random critical hit. It has a 10% chance to burn."nThe user strikes the target with a burning lash. This also lowers the target's Defense stat by two steps."jA column of fire hits opposing Pokémon. When used with its Grass equivalent, it makes a sea of fire."JThe target is punched with a fiery fist. It has a 10% chance to burn."pThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat by two steps."eThe user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. It has a 10% chance to flinch and a 10% chance to burn."[The user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the target. It has a 20% chance to burn."fThe user attacks the foe with fire. The target's held Berry or Gem becomes burnt up and unusable."eThe user cloaks itself in flame and attacks. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."KThe target is attacked with small flames. It has a 10% chance to burn."\The user engulfs the target in fierce flames, trapping and damaging it for three turns."cThe user slams the foe with its flaming body. The heavier the user is, the greater the damage."ZSummons sunshine for six turns, boosting Fire-type attacks and hindering most others."TThe user shoots a sinister, bluish-white flame at the target to inflict a burn."eAttacks by igniting a small stone and launching it as a fiery ball. It has a 10% chance to burn."ZAttacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get burned."aThe user tucks in its wings and charges from a low altitude. The user also takes 33% recoil."mThe user soars upward and drops at high speeds. This lowers the user's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."VA vortex of air is shot at the target to inflict damage. Can random critical hit."fThe user heats up its beak before attacking. Physically attacking in this time results in a burn."5The user soars, then strikes on the second turn."eThe user bounces up high, then drops on the foe on the second turn. It has a 30% chance to numb."ZA corkscrewing attack with the sharp beak acting as a drill. Can random critical hit."\The user absorbs its target's HP. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."mThe user attacks with a blade of air that slices even the sky. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."cThe user attacks using a sound wave based on words it has learned. It also dizzies the target."[The user confounds the foe with speed, then slashes. Can't miss and skips protections."[The user launches razor-like wind to slash the opposing team. Can random critical hit."hThe user pecks the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect."UThe target is struck with large, imposing wings. The user also takes 20% recoil."mThe user nimbly strikes the foe through an elaborate routine. Doubles in damage if the user has no item."XThe user whips up a gust of wind at the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."WThe target is jabbed with a sharply pointed beak or horn. Can random critical hit."oThe user whips up a wind to blow away the target's protective Screens. Also removes hazards on both sides."eThe user covers the target's body with a mass of down that lowers its Attack stat by five steps."FThe user counters the target by mimicking the target's last move."ZRestores the 