 status problems affecting the user's party."jThe user protects itself by wrapping its body in soft cotton, raising its Defense stat by five steps."dThe user releases cotton-like spores that cling to the foe, reducing their Speed by four steps."VThe user puts a forest curse on the target. The target is now Grass type as well."hThe user lays roots that restore 1/8th HP on every turn. Because it is rooted, it can't switch out."CA seed is planted on the target, causing it to become leeched."MProtects the user from attacks. Physical attackers take 1/8th HP damage."SThe user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep. Only one use per battle."VLowers the target's Attack stat, then restores its own HP by the target's Attack."<The user restores 1/2 of its HP, or 2/3rds in Sunshine."fA seed that causes worry is planted on the foe. It prevents sleep by making its Ability Insomnia."LThe user attacks the target by poking it with a sharply pointed branch."tThe user controls the drum's roots to attack the target. This also lowers the target's Speed stat by two steps."JAttacks by gliding on the ground. This move always goes first in sun."cRestores HP and heals status of itself and its ally Pokémon in battle by using Jungle Powers."`The user attacks its foes by manifesting the power of the land in fearsome blades of stone."[The user sets off an earthquake that strikes every Pokémon around it and underground."@The user fiercely attacks the target using its entire body."dThe user makes the ground under the foe erupt with power. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."[The user gathers the energy of the land and focuses that power on foes to damage them."eThis move also hits Pokémon that are in the air. Those Pokémon are knocked down to the ground."eThe user attacks with a wave that crawls along the ground. Those it hits can't flee from battle."7The user burrows, then attacks on the second turn."dThe user crashes into its target while rotating its body like a drill. Can random critical hit."UThe user attacks driven by frustration. Power increases if previous move failed."ZThe user clubs the target with a bone. It has a 50% chance to make the target flinch."fThe user strikes everything around it by stomping on the ground. It reduces hit Pokémon's Speed."oThe user attacks by shooting a beam of mud at the target. It also reduces the target's Speed by two steps."aThe user throws the bone it holds. The bone loops to hit the target twice, coming and going."\The user spins a sandstorm around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."MThe user strikes the target with a hard bone two to five times in a row."`The user looses a ground-shaking quake affecting everyone around. Its power varies greatly."OThe user regains up to half of its max HP. It restores 66% in a sandstorm."hThe user lays spikes at the foe's feet. Foes that switch into battle are hurt a bit for each layer."PThrows scorching sand at the target to attack. It has a 10% chance to burn."jOn the second turn, the user hits the foe with electrically charged ice. It has a 30% chance to numb."dOn the second turn, an ultracold, freezing wind surrounds the foe. It has a 30% chance to burn."SA blizzard strikes all near foes. Can't miss in hail. 30% chance to frostbite."`The user swings and hits with its strong, heavy fist. Lowers the user's Speed by two steps."\The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."pThe user attacks by harshly dropping an icicle onto the foe. It has a 30% chance to make the target flinch."NThe target is punched with an icy fist. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."XThe target is hit with a rainbow-colored beam. It has a 30% chance to lower Attack."yThe user attacks by blowing freezing cold air at all near foes. This attack reduces the targets' Speed by two steps."iThe user bites with cold-infused fangs. It has a 10% chance to flinch and a 10% chance to frostbite."^The user blows a cold breath on the target. This attack always results in a critical hit."fThe user attacks with a gust of chilled air. It also lowers the targets' Speed stat by two steps."dThe user flash freezes chunks of ice and hurls them at the target. This move always goes first."]The user attacks with a chilling gust of powdery snow. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."PThe user rolls into the target. Its power doubles if it hits in succession."ZThe user launches sharp icicles at the target. It strikes two to five times in a row."`This move reduces damage from attacks for five turns. This can be used only in a hailstorm."MSummons hail for six turns. Damages non-Ice, non-Ghost-types every turn."YA consecutive three-kick attack that becomes more powerful with each successful hit."VThe user attacks by hurling a blizzard-cloaked icicle lance at opposing Pokémon."bThe user explodes to inflict damage on those around it. The user faints upon using this move."fThe user charges at the target using every bit of its power. The user must rest on the next turn."hThe foe is attacked with a powerful beam. The user must rest on the next turn to regain its energy."eThe user attacks everything around it with the destructive power of a terrible, explosive sound."cThis move can be used only after the user has used all the other moves it knows in the battle."mThe user tucks in to raise its Defense by four steps in the first turn, then rams the foe on the second."EA reckless, life-risking tackle. The user also takes 33% recoil."_The user charges its head into the foe. As a result, it takes 2/3 of the damage as recoil."jThe user fires a beam of light at its target. The type changes depending on the Drive the user holds."NA large egg is hurled at the target with maximum force to inflict damage."lThe user releases countless shots of light. Its type varies with the kind of Plate the user is holding."SThe user lets loose a horribly echoing shout with the power to inflict damage."qCloaking itself in high energy, the user slams into the target. This move's type depends on the held memory."hThe user attacks the target by dancing very hard. The user's type determines the type of this move."iThe user attacks the target by smashing into it with incredible force. It has a 20% chance to dizzy."YA full-body charge attack for slamming into the foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."mThe user attacks in an uproar, going on a rampage for two turns. Over that time, no one can fall asleep."[The user drops onto the target with its full body weight. It has a 30% chance to numb."bThe user charges the target at blinding speed. This attack always goes before any other move."jThe user bites hard on the target with its sharp front fangs. It has a 40% to make the target flinch."FThe target is slugged by a punch thrown with muscle-packed power."_A two-turn attack. Blades of wind hit the foe on the second turn. Can random critical hit."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 15% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."bThe user slashes the target with hard and sharp claws, lowering their Defense by three steps."XAn ancient song appeals to the hearts of those listening. Switches Meloetta's form."^Seeking an opening, the user strikes continually. Ignores the target's stat step changes."ZThe target is hit with rhythmically launched punches that have a 20% chance to dizzy."kDoubles its power if the user has a status condition. Ignores damage reduction from Burn or Frostbite."dThe user sticks out its head and attacks by charging into the foe. It has a 20% chance to numb."jGets revenge for a fainted ally. If an ally fainted in the last turn, this attack's damage increases."fThe user attacks with a secret power. Its added effects vary depending on the user's environment."UThe target is attacked with a slash of claws or blades. Can random critical hit."eThis attack inflicts double damage on a numbed foe. It also cures the target's numbing, however."HThe target is jabbed with a sharply pointed horn to inflict damage."