age."eThe user retaliates with much greater power against the target that last inflicted damage on it."^The user sheds part of its body to make itself lighter and raise its Speed by four steps."[The user hardens its body's surface like iron, raising its Defense stat by four steps."_Protects itself from damage. It also lowers the Attack of physical attackers by two steps."ZA horrible sound like scraping metal reduces the target's Sp. Def stat by four steps."KThe user rotates its gears, raising its Attack and Speed by two steps."BThe user becomes a gigantic shield and slams into the target.";The user becomes a gigantic sword and cuts the target."JThe user snares the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."fFires a beam of steel that it collected from its entire body. The user loses half its current HP."�The user spouts water to damage the foe. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP, at its weakest when the user is at half or less."SThe target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure."jThe user attacks opposing Pokémon with countless beams of light that glow a deep and brilliant blue."VThe user immerses the target in superheated steam. This has a 30% chance to burn."IThe target is hammered with a large pincer. Can random critical hit."ZThe user attacks by swinging its tail as if it were a vicious wave in a raging storm."lThe user bursts into song, emitting many bubbles. Any burning Pokémon will be healed by these bubbles."USlams into the target using an aquatic blast with a 20% chance to lower Defense."rDiving on the first turn, becoming invulnerable, the user rises and hits from below water on the second turn."TThe user shoots boiling hot water at its target. This has a 30% chance to burn."fA column of water strikes the target. When combined with its fire equivalent, it makes a rainbow."KThe user charges at the target and has a 40% chance to make it flinch."SThe user cuts the foe with sharp shells. It has a 50% chance to lower Defe