e target with just force. Guaranteed critical hit on foes with boosted stats."dThe user attempts to humble the target, guaranteeing a critical hit on foes with boosted stats."iThe user lays poison spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."EVenom is strategically introduced into the target, poisoning it."jThe user thrashes while infused with elements. It has a 15% chance each to poison, waterlog or leech."lThe user syncs its mind with its teammates, raising its Sp. Atk by three steps, and its allies' by one."ZThe user uses gunpowder to rocket at its foe. It has a 30% chance to raise its Speed."^The user draws power to attack by using a held Berry. The Berry used determines its type."\The user harnesses its jealousy to attack the opponent with ghostly hugs, cursing them."LThe user becomes a pain train. This raises the user's Speed by 2 steps."RThe user becomes a pain train. It has a 10% chance to raise the user's Speed."@The target is irritated by allergenic plants, poisoning it."?The user applies anesthetic substances, numbing the target"YThe user pulls the target under the waves, trapping and damaging it for three turns."]The user dazzles nearby foes with light or sound. Their Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."OThe user smirks with confidence. The Sp. Def of nearby enemies is reduced."mThe user conserves for future attacks. This raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and accuracy by two steps each."UThe target is struck by a pulse of negative energy. It has a 30% chance to numb."\The user slashes at the target with a steel blade. Super effective versus Dragon-types."?The user strikes the target's pressure points, numbing it."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Numbs any attackers. Fails if used successively."hThe user lays burning spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers burns."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."2The target is hit two to five times in a row."PThe user slams itself into the target with absurd force, taking 50% recoil."lAvenging bugs everywhere, the user crushes the target. It has a 20% chance to lower their Defense stat."[The user and target bathe in acid. Lowers the user's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."gThe user calms itself and its teammates, raise its Sp. Def by three steps, and its allies' by one."YTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Sp. Attack stat."oThe user skillfully blasts the target, then steals their item. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."_Lures an enemy into its jaws, draining 2/3 of damage dealt if they hit the user this turn."JThe user strikes with an acidic punch that destroys Gems and Berries."YThe user forces itself or the target to make a substitute by turning it into a doll."OThe user hacks at the target with great violence. Can random critical hit."cThe user opens its soul to unleash massive energy. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk and Sp. Def."eThe user reinvigorates itself, healing to full. Only works the first turn the user is in battle."?Small bugs swarm the target, causing it to become leeched."GThe user spits venom at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."qThe user crushes the target with evil intent. This deals double damage if the target has a status condition."bThe target is crushed in the user's shell or claws, trapping and damaging it for three turns."WThe foe is pulled into a huge whirlpool, trapping and damaging it for three turns."RThe foe is engulfed in a firestorm, trapping and damaging it for three turns."HBinds the foe with vines, trapping and damaging it for three turns."`The user removes the energy and light around the target. Super effective vs Electric-types."cThe user attacks the target with the power of a warding charm. Super effective vs Ghost-types."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."jThe user and the target both fall asleep, fully restoring their HP and healing any status conditions."iThe user lounges around with decadent laziness, restoring its HP by 66%. This move always goes last."cThe user jabs the target with electric charges. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."TThe user creates a storm using its flaming body, damaging everything around it."XDeals more damage the less HP the user has. After attacking, the user switches out."kThe user rips the target, lowering their Defense by two steps. After attacking, the user switches out."\Protects the user from attacks. Also burns any attacker who specially attacks the user."lThe user lays frozen spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers frostbites."PThe user tosses hot desert sand on the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."^The user whips up a hot desert twister to attack the target. It has a 20% chance to burn."XThe target is consumed by a desert storm, trapping and damaging it for three turns."jThe user creates a puzzling area for 8 turns in which Pokémon's base Attack and Sp. Atk are swapped."WThe user drains heat from the air around the target, afflicting it with frostbite."`Attacks with emotion from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get frostbitten."kAstral energy explodes around the target. This move always goes first. The user also takes 50% recoil."oUnveiling its ears, the released psychic power causes the user to rampage 2 to 5 times each for two turns."jThe user takes an entire grid of power into its belly to slam the target. The user takes 100% recoil."ZThe user prepares its dual cannons. Until switch out, each special attack hits twice."WThis move raises all the user's stats by two steps. Can only be used while asleep."lThe user sends vines to ensnare all enemies, lowering the Speed of any that moved first by three steps."pThe target is pranked by an electric jolt. They are taunted and unable to use status moves for three turns."aThe user slices with claws of light that have a 50% chance to numb. Can random critical hit."fChanneling fear, the user bites the target. Deals double damage if the user is below half health."uThe target is put to sleep, and the user's Attack is raised. Fails unless the target is at or below half health."jThe user spins sugar into a ball launched at the target. The slower the user, the greater the damage."bThe user attacks with a wave of murky water, which hits all near foes and lowers their Speed."fThe user attacks the target with a sword. If it faints, lots of money is earned after the battle."TThe user demands tribute from their subjects. Money is earned after the battle."^The user makes an offering, then attacks two to five times. Money is earned for each hit."ZThe user attacks with the full force of The Market. Money is earned after the battle."aEnergy is sent through a conduit, erupting under the target. This move is also Psychic-type."mThe user slams the target into a nearby hard object. Increases power the higher the Defense of any ally."`Doubles target ally's Attack and Speed. However, if the user faints, so too does that ally."pThe user roars with the force of a volcano, raising the Attack of itself by three steps and allies' by one."fThe user charges the target at blazing-fast speed. This attack always goes before any other move."jSummons rainstorm for five turns on the first turn, then overwhelms the foe with water on the second."nThe user attacks with heat, creating an obscuring wall of haze. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."TRestores a fainted Grass-type party member to full HP. Only one use per battle."XThe user licks the target, numbing them, or cursing them if they're already numbed."_The user flings the dirty oil on its fur. It transfers any status condition to the target."kIf the user is faster than the target, puts the target to sleep, 