l nearby foes. User becomes a Ghost-type."PThe user raises its Attack and Speed by two steps, and becomes Dragon-type."cThe user focuses intently, making every future attack critical. The user becomes a Steel-type."lThe user creates a Puzzle Room for 8 turns, raises both of its Attacking stats, and becomes Fairy-type."eA cloud of poison gas is sprayed at all nearby foes, poisoning them. User becomes a Poison-type."`The user prepares to defend itself. It'll survive the next three hits which would faint it."JThe user inflicts burns on all nearby foes. User becomes a Fire-type."JThe user TODO, boosts its Atk. and Sp. Def, and becomes a Water-type."bThe user embeds its roots to heal by 1/4th every turn for four turns, and becomes Grass-type."NThe user inflicts numb on all nearby foes. User becomes an Electric-type."VSummons eclipse for 5 turns, resets lowered stats, and user becomes Psychic-type."hSummons moonglow for 5 turns, buffs the defending stats of all allies, and user becomes Fairy-type."VThe user restores 1/8th of its HP, summons an allied Combee, and becomes Bug-type"iThe user resets all stats, prevents stat changes, increases their defenses, and becomes Poison-type."\The sharply raises its speed, gains an extra two moves per turn, and becomes Rock-type."NAll near foes are forced to switch out, and the user becomes Flying-type."mThe enemy side is prevented from using items for the rest of the battle, and the user becomes Dark-type."NThe user inflicts frostbite on all nearby foes. User becomes an Ice-type."bAttackers against the user suffer recoil for the rest of the battle. User becomes Ghost-type."�The user restores 1/8th of its HP, but begins eroding. At the end of each turn, its defensive stats are lowered and its attacking stats are raised. User becomes Ground-type."OThe user harshly lowers each near foes best stat, and becomes Dragon-type."RThe user takes 50% less attack damage for 3 turns, and becomes Fighting-type."UThe user sharply boosts their Sp. At