 gem-like ray, dizzying the target."YThe user forcefully shoots 6 seeds in rapid succession, spread among nearby enemies."=The user attacks twice using Dreepy, spreading the hits."aA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by all the damage taken by the target."WIt swamps the area with a giant wave, hitting every battler nearby and underwater."\It swamps the area around the user with a giant sludge wave, poisoning everyone struck."NThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage and numbs the target."ZThe user strikes the target with 3 punches like bullets. This move always goes first."kThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat by six steps."dA move that only the avatar of Rayquaza can use. All enemies struck lose their flinch immunity."xA move that only the avatar of Kyogre can use. The user commands a Luvdisc avatar and a Remoraid avatar to join it."�A move that only the avatar of Groudon can use. Gravity is intensified for five turns and enemy Pokemon have their weight doubled."QA parasitic seed leeches the target and reduces both its Attack and Sp. Atk."PSummons moonglow for eight turns and raises the user's Attack by two steps."jCloaking itself in light energy, the user shocks the target, raising the user's Sp. Def by two steps."jThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by 2 steps. Fails if used in succession."aThe user bites with added telekinetic force. During eclipse, the target also becomes numbed."rThe user mutates its genetic code, transforming into any of its 3 other forms. Only useable as Deoxys Normal."iThe user attacks with courage. Sets spikes if Full. If Hangry, deals double damage and is Dark-type."jThe user crushes the target in its metallic vises, breaking any screens protecting the target's side."rThe user emits a wave of green energy to strike near foes. Deals double damage to those slower than the user."nThe user harms the target with gemlike light. Deals double damage if the user has used a gem this battle."NThe user creates two to five giant bubbles to explode against the target."XThe user sends two to five waves of cosmic energy to overwhelm the target's senses."]The user summons two to five apparitions that dance around hypnotically before striking."LThe user fires off two to five explosive rounds in a beautiful display."pThe target is hit with an electric current two to five times in quick succession. Has a 10% chance to numb."PThe user attacks fueled by ire. Deals double damage if it's a critical hit."}A large spike is shot at the target. If this causes the target to faint, a layer of spikes is set on the ground beneath them."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."QThe user hits a pitch that turns earth and stone to dust, damaging its foes."JWind rapidly spins the target in place to hit them two to five times."jThe user leeches the target's life. The user's HP is restored by half the damage taken by the target."TThe user gets all the party Pokémon to attack the foe with aerial projectiles."eThe user vibrates its wings to make a damaging sound wave. It has a 30% chance to lower Sp. Def."jDisables the target's last used move for four turns, then reduces a relevant stat on them by 4 steps."xGrips the target with its entire mouth. The user can’t attack next turn unless the target faints or switches out."[The user assists an ally by boosting the power and Accuracy of its next attack by 50%."|This move creates a directional magnetic field which reduces damage from attacks with 100 or more base power for five turns."nThe user hides its blade. If it is hit by a special move, it unsheathes it quickly slashes all near foes."fA distinguished attack that motivates nearby allies to follow, letting them act immediately after"jThe user attacks with bitter emotion. This lowers the target's attacking stats by 2 steps if in hail."]The target is subjected to a violent and frightening prank. It has a 10% chance to numb."gThe user sings with reckless abandon, annoying the target. There's a 30% chance they become dizzy."�The user creates a bubble to shield their ally. The next time they're hit, 50% of the move damage is instead dealt back as recoil."WThe user launches a fist with extreme force. This attack is popular with children."iThe user expresses a hidden potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."�The user summons a ton of electricity to shock the target. If it deals less than 50% of the target’s max health, the user takes the difference as recoil."_Welds heavy steel onto the target, giving it Steel type and reducing its Speed by 4 steps."TFor the rest of the round, the target's healing is reversed. Always goes first."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."]The user shakes the target with a deep, rumbling roar. This attack does physical damage."^The user concentrates to stabilize its mood. It raises the user's Sp. Def by three steps."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."VThe user crashes into the target on a ripping current. This waterlogs the target."VThe user hops high up to land on the target's head. It has a 10% chance to dizzy."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."OThe user and the target each share their highest stat step with the other."WThe user shoots the target with a small bolt of fire. This move always goes first."WThe user flashes colorful light to damage the target. This move always goes first."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of poison. This move always goes first."^The user inspires a sudden dread in the target, damaging it. This move always goes first."^The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe is below half health."aThis attack deals 50 percent more damage if the target has any raised or lowe