e sky. This move is also Flying-type."cThe user swings and hits with its strong and heavy fist. Lowers the user's Speed by two steps."aThe user jumps up high, then strikes with a kick. If the kick misses, the user hurts itself."]The user attacks by slicing with its long horns. Ignores the target's stat step changes."eThe user cuts with its long horn. The odd power contained in it does physical damage to the foe."VThe user attacks with an uppercut. Deals double damage to targets flying high up."bThe user looses a blast of aura power from deep within its body. This move is certain to hit."cThe user grabs the target and recklessly dives for the ground. The user also takes 33% recoil."eThe user attacks with a swift chop. It can also break anys Screens protecting the target's side."eAn energy-draining punch. The user's HP is restored by one third the damage taken by the target."\The user attacks last. In return, it's guaranteed not to miss and bypasses protections."cThis attack inflicts double damage on a sleeping target. It also wakes the target up, however."_The user attacks the target's legs swiftly, reducing the target's Speed stat by two steps."KThe target is attacked with a shock wave. It has a 30% chance to numb."jAn attack move that inflicts double the damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."dThe user lashes out with a quick, spinning kick. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."bThe user strikes the target with a fierce blow. This attack always results in a critical hit."GThe target is attacked with a sharp chop. Can random critical hit."NThe user throws a punch at blinding speed. It is certain to strike first."nStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack stat by two steps."PThe user attacks with a strong punch. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."hThe user whirls its fists to send a wave of pure vacuum at the target. This move always goes first."FThe target is quickly kicked twice in succession using both feet."]The user looses a flurry of open-palmed arm thrusts that hit two to five times in a row."YA consecutive three-kick attack that becomes more powerful with each successive hit."^A retaliation move that counters any physical attack, inflicting double the damage taken."[The user risks all to attack the foe. The user faints but does damage equal to its HP."bA powerful low kick that makes the foe fall over. It inflicts greater damage on heavier foes."KAn all-out attack that becomes more powerful the less HP the user has."cThe target is thrown using the power of gravity. It inflicts damage equal to the user's level."YThe user tenses its muscles to bulk up, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps."qThe user protects itself and allies from damaging moves. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."nThe user protects itself and its allies from priority moves. It always fails if it is used in succession."kLocks the target in and prevents fleeing. Lowers target's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps every turn."WAttacks wildly with swords or fists. The user must rest on the next turn, however."VThe user traps itself into the battle and raises all of their stats by two steps."WThe user coaches its ally Pokémon, raising their Attack and Defense by two steps."WThe user slams into the opponent, dealing damage based on the user's Defense stat."yWith a fiery forehead, the user hurls itself at the foe. Lowers the user's Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps."The user attacks in an explosive fury. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP, at its weakest when the user is at half or less."dThe user attacks everything by causing its own head to explode. The user also takes 50% recoil."kThe user sets a shell trap. If it is hit by a physical move, the trap explodes and hurts the attacker."pThe user attacks by engulfing the foe in a beautiful, yet intense, blue flame. It has a 20% chance to burn."ATo inflict massive damage, the user uses up its Fire-typing."XThe user attacks the target at full power. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."nThe user charges at the foe while on fire. The user also takes 33% recoil. This has a 10% chance to burn."bThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."fThe user brings down a giant flame. It does more damage if influenced by an enormous thunderbolt."cThe user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense fire. It leaves the target with a burn."VThe user spews magma around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."SThe target is razed with a mystical fire of great intensity. Burns the target."bAn inferno of scarlet flames torches everything around the user. It has a 30% chance to burn."_The user attacks by exhaling hot breath on the opposing team. It has a 30% chance to burn."WThe target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."TThe user launches a kick. Can random critical hit. It has a 10% chance to burn."nThe user strikes the target with a burning lash. This also lowers the target's Defense stat by two steps."jA column of fire hits opposing Pokémon. When used with its Grass equivalent, it makes a sea of fire."JThe target is punched with a fiery fist. It has a 10% chance to burn."pThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat by two steps."eThe user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. It has a 10% chance to flinch and a 10% chance to burn."[The user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the target. It has a 20% chance to burn."fThe user attacks the foe with fire. The target's held Berry or Gem becomes burnt up and unusable."eThe user cloaks itself in flame and attacks. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."KThe target is attacked with small flames. It has a 10% chance to burn."\The user engulfs the target in fierce flames, trapping and damaging it for three turns."cThe user slams the foe with its flaming body. The heavier the use