ng around the target."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."eThe user slashes the target with aura-enriched wings. This boosts the user's Speed by two steps."ZThe user raises all of their stats by two step. Fails unless a foe fainted last turn."wThe user charges at the target, sweeping away hazards in the with its armored jaw. The user also takes 33% recoil."tThe user schemes to raise its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. During moonglow, also raises Speed by two steps."FThe user rampages and attacks while spewing flames for two turns."sThe user launches its amassed chlorophyll to inflict damage on the target. The user loses half its current HP."WThe user lashes out with its claws. 50% chance to poison. Can random critical hit."_Protects itself from damage. It also lowers the Sp. Atk of special attackers by two steps."sExlodes, dealing an extra 50 base power to all foes for each layer of spikes underneath them. The user faints."DThe user switches out using a cruel illusion. Always goes last."_The user curls its metal hair around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."�The user calls all rocks to join it, summoning sandstorm for five turns and laying a trap of levitating stones around the target."^The user questions the existence of the target, dealing psychic damage and dizzying them."YThe user chomps hard, cutting the target's HP by half, and healing for half of that."�The user and its allies are protected from wide-ranging attacks this turn, and enemies can only target the user. Fails if used in succession."aThe user freezes the target in place, dealing damage and minimizing their Speed and Evasion."vInflicts physical or special damage, whichever deals more. Then, raises Attack or Sp. Atk, whichever wasn't used."[The user finds the highest base power move among your able party members, and uses it."_Invokes the aspects of multiple dragons, striking with a physical move and a special move."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."QCloaked in flames, the user dances wildly, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps."mThe user attacks the target using graceful fluid movements, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves."jSummons sun for five turns on the first turn, then overwhelms the foe with fiery light on the second."`The user strikes the target while magnetizing it, trapping and damaging it for three turns."WConductive materials ensnare the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."^The user grabs the target with a conjured hand, trapping and damaging it for three turns."bThe user conjures a giant fist to crush the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."YThe user launches up high, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."\Injects supercold liquid into the target, damaging them and halving all future healing."oThe user restores 1/2 of their HP and raises their Defense, Sp. Def, and critical hit chance by two steps."gThe user hunts with its allies. The more party Pokémon, the more damage. Can random critical hit."VThe user attacks with dark illusions. This also lowers the target's Defense stat."jThe user slashes using woven silk, lowering the user's Attack by four steps. Can random critical hit."mThe user uses all their might to attack their opponent, forcing the user to use Rest on their next turn."aThe user doubles its critical strike chance and raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."`Changes type based on machine haunted. 30% chance of extra effect based on machine haunted."OThe user dismisses the target, forcing it to switch out. Always goes last."ZIf the target is the last able member of their party, this attack's power is doubled."lThe user causes the air around the target to explode. It's type is changed based on the active weather."dThe user looses a flash of energy from its polished body. It has a 30% chance to lower Sp. Def."kThe user imparts knowledge on it