 by three steps. It then hurts itself in its mental turmoil."xThe user withdraws its body into its hard shell, raising both defensive stats by two steps and gaining Shell Armor."YThe user amps itself up for performance, raising its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps."OThe user focuses its aim to raise its Sp. Atk and Accuracy by three steps."eThe user spends 1/4th of their max HP to curse the target, damaging their HP by 1/4th each turn."XLowers the target's Sp. Atk stat, then restores its own HP by the target's Sp. Atk."nAn apple falls from high up to strike the foe. Always goes first. Deals double damage in intense Gravity."cThe user dazzles the target with celestial visions that lowers its Sp. Atk stat by five steps."nThe user assists an ally's next move, boosting its power by 50% and letting it move right after the user."QThe user meditates, raising both its Attack and Sp. Atk stats by four steps."iClad in souls, the user crashes into the target. The user takes 33% recoil, but can't faint from it."|The user transforms into a cloud of vermin evading all attacks on the first turn. On the second turn it ambushes the target."�The user imprisons all near foes, reducing their attacking stats by one step each and trapping them until the next time they take a hit."cThe target is barred by rules which prevent it from using off-type moves for three more turns."SAttacks with dragon energy. Power increases and damages all nearby in eclipse."RThe user steadies its eyes, mind, and body in order to maximize its Accuracy."vThe user attacks by flattening the target into the ground. The target's stat step changes are returned to normal."qThe user scratches the target with rough rocks. If in sandstorm, the target's Defense is lowered by 3 steps."aAttacks by blasting dirt and debris at the target. This move always goes first in sandstorm."kThe user dances rapidly, emitting tropical heat. Any frostbitten Pokémon will be healed by this heat."dThe user curls up to conceal weak spots and raise both of its Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."EThe user invokes forbidden celestial powers to smite the target."[The user attacks the target with a pulsing blast of fire. It has a 20% chance to burn."mThe user launches volcanic debris, dealing damage and setting a layer of flame spikes around the target."RThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in Rain."<The foe is stabbed once by each of the user's stingers."SStrikes the target with harbor waters, then summons rainstorm for eight turns."ZThe user steals blood, lowering the target's Attack. If so, raises the user's Attack."nThe user indulges its love of battle by striking a foe. Both of the user's Attack and Sp. Atk are raised."`The user bites with playful abandon. This deals double damage on the user's first turn out."jThe user burns the target if they're a foe, or raises the target's Speed by 4 steps if their an ally."qThe user charges at the target to strike it squarely. If it misses, the user's Accuracy and Speed is raised."dThe user strikes while inviting the power of seasons. The user changes form to the next season."^The target is plastered with irritating scales, damaging it and changing its type to Bug."aThe user makes a scary sound by shaking, forcing the target to switch out. Always goes last."sThe user chooses between the three most recent moves used by the opposing team, and uses that move themselves."gThe user psychically modifies its own genes, transforming into either Overmatter or Overmind form."aAn aurora borealis flashes brightly at the target, lowering their Attack. Always goes first."aAn electrified cloud zaps the target, lowering their Speed. This has a 50% chance to flinch."{A lance of fire pierces the target from above, lowering their Sp. Atk. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."dThe user pins the target down with icy spikes, applying frostbite and making it unable to flee."KRound objects are hurled at the target to strike three times in a row."[The user hits the target with each of its heads from underground. Strikes three times."xA diamond-tough force-field protects the user's side for 5 turns from critical hits, and reduces move damage taken."ZThe user dances to encourage its ally. Their attacks this turn will be critical hits."^The user dances to restore an ally by 50% max HP. They're cured of any status conditions."dThe user makes a dreadful bell noise, harming all near battlers with visions of impending doom."UThe target is blasted with an unsettling wind. Can't miss and skips protections."�The user spends 25% HP to lay down evil roots. This curses all foes. The user becomes trapped, but heals by 1/8th HP every turn."jThe user rides onto the field on a huge wave of mud, damaging all nearby and raising their own Speed."The user engages the target in a head-to-head fight. The damage is based on the target's Attack rather than their Defense."nThe user growls fiercly, lowering each foe's Attack by two steps and raising its own Attack by two steps."sThe user gleams with light, lowering each foe's Sp. Atk by two steps and raising its own Sp. Atk by two steps."_The user summons sunshine for 5 turns, boosts its Atk. and Sp. Atk, and becomes Fire-type."iThe user summons rainstorm for 5 turns, surrounds itself with healing water, and becomes Water-type."SPlants seeds on all near foes, draining HP each turn. User becomes Grass-type."SThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps, and becomes Electric-type."tThe user summons a hail storm for 5 turns, reduces the speed of all enemies by two steps, and becomes Ice-type."^The user boosts its Attack and Defense, gains a lot of weight, and becomes Fighting-type."VThe user lays 3 layers of spike traps at the foe's feet, and becomes Ground-type."[The user ups the Speed and attack count of itself and allies, and becomes Flying-type."_The user raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def, maximizes its Accuracy, and becomes Psychic-type."qNearby foes are bound with silk, 