 nearby allies to follow, letting them act immediately after"jThe user attacks with bitter emotion. This lowers the target's attacking stats by 2 steps if in hail."]The target is subjected to a violent and frightening prank. It has a 10% chance to numb."gThe user sings with reckless abandon, annoying the target. There's a 30% chance they become dizzy."�The user creates a bubble to shield their ally. The next time they're hit, 50% of the move damage is instead dealt back as recoil."WThe user launches a fist with extreme force. This attack is popular with children."iThe user expresses a hidden potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."�The user summons a ton of electricity to shock the target. If it deals less than 50% of the target’s max health, the user takes the difference as recoil."_Welds heavy steel onto the target, giving it Steel type and reducing its Speed by 4 steps."TFor the rest of the round, the target's healing is reversed. Always goes first."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."]The user shakes the target with a deep, rumbling roar. This attack does physical damage."^The user concentrates to stabilize its mood. It raises the user's Sp. Def by three steps."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."VThe user crashes into the target on a ripping current. This waterlogs the target."VThe user hops high up to land on the target's head. It has a 10% chance to dizzy."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."OThe user and the target each share their highest stat step with the other."WThe user shoots the target with a small bolt of fire. This move always goes first."WThe user flashes colorful light to damage the target. This move always goes first."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of poison. This move always goes first."^The user inspires a sudden dread in the target, 