 with bitter emotion. This lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps if in hail."mDisables the target's last used move for four turns, then reduces a relevant stat on them by four steps."PDisables the target's last used move for five turns, and cuts 5 PP from it."ZA reckless charge that forces the user to switch out if it misses. Always goes first."^The target is hit by a wave of magnetic energy. It has a 20% chance to lower their Speed."fThe user attacks the target with a sword. If it faints, tons of money is earned after the battle."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Sp. Atk of special attackers by two steps."hThe user chains its heavy anchor to the target. A flying Pokémon will fall to the ground when hit."fWelds heavy steel onto the target, giving it the Steel type and reducing its Speed by four steps."oSummons Sunshine for five turns on the first turn, then overwhelms the foe with fiery light on the second."pThe user launches up high, becoming invulnerable, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."gA distinguished attack that motivates nearby allies to follow, letting them act immediately after."�The user dives deep on the first turn, becoming invulnerable, then rises and strikes with explosive strength on the second turn."oThe user attacks with a wave of murky water, which hits all near foes and lowers their Speed by two steps."@The user applies anesthetic substances, numbing the target."pThe user hides its blade. If it is hit by a special move, it unsheathes it quickly, slashing all near foes."�The user surges with electricity. If it deals less than 50% of the target's max health, the user takes the difference as recoil."WThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in rainstorm."jThe user slows the target's mind with a psychically infused blow. This has a 30% chance to frostbite."eBy sacrificing half its total HP, the user jinxes the target with a kiss, making it fall asleep."lThe user psychically modifies its own genes, transforming into either Overmatter form or Overmind form."lProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Sp. Def of special attackers by four steps."gThe user picks up an iceberg and slams it into the target. Lowers the user's Attack by four steps."SAttacks all near others with dragon energy. Power increases by 50% in eclipse."pThe user roots itself, then strikes at the target with serpentine strength. This has a 30% chance to leech."bDarkness rolls over the field, damaging all other Pokémon and setting Grey Mist for 5 turns."NDeftly sets a layer of damaging Spikes around the foe, then switches out."cThe user attacks with dark illusions. This also lowers the target's Defense stat by two steps."PThe user demands tribute from the target. Money is earned after the battle."tExplodes, dealing an extra 30 base power to all foes for each layer of spikes underneath them. The user faints."�The user transforms into a cloud of vermin, becoming invulnerable to attacks on the first turn. On the second turn it ambushes the target."bPower increases by 20 each time it's used in succession. User heals for half of damage dealt."`The user doubles its critical strike chance and raises its Attack and Defense by two steps."mThe user raises their Speed by 4 steps, quadruples their critical hit chance, and becomes Fighting-type."yThe user intensifies gravity for five turns, damages all enemies for 1/4th of their max HP, and becomes Ground-type."JThe user attacks with a prehistoric power which raises all its stats."oThe user creates a Polarized Room for 8 turns, raises both of its Defensive stats, and becomes Steel-type."ZThe user creates an Odd Room for 8 turns, raises its Speed, and becomes Psychic-type."gThe user torments all near foes, preventing them from repeating moves. The user becomes Dark-type."ZThe target is hit with rhythmically launched punches that have a 30% chance to dizzy."TAn energy-draining punch. The user's HP is 