 light and sound. It has a 30% chance to lower the target's Attack and Sp. Atk."\The user stabs the target, injecting a painful chemical. It has a 30% chance to poison."[The user leeches the target's life. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."`The user loses 25% of their max HP to curse the target, damaging their HP by 25% each turn."eThe user soothes the target, lowering its Speed by 4 steps. If in hail, they also become drowsy."oThe user snips the target's connection to life in order to curse them, damaging their HP by 25% each turn."[The user drags the target into the water with a heavy anchor. They become waterlogged."oSummons sunshine for five turns on the first turn, then overwhelms the foe with fiery light on the second."fThe user pulls the target under the waves with crushing force. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."NThe user waterlogs the target, then welcomes in rainstorm for four turns."wThe user opens a spring to blast the target, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."�The user rests in a riverbed, restoring its HP by half of max, and forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."cThe user rams the target while splashing up a lot of water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."ZThe user wields tidal power to grab at the target. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."=The target is doused with water in order to waterlog it."mThe user crashes into the target with the force of a large wave. This has a 30% chance to lower Defense."�The user attacks the target using graceful fluid movements, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."�The user's song heals the status problems of all the party Pokémon, and forms an Aqua Ring around itself, healing 10% HP per turn."YThe target is inundated with a wave of seaweater. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."VA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."uLures an enemy into its jaws. If they hit 