reat in Lumiose City. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."kShalour City's famous shortbread. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."tThe Alola region's specialty--fried bread. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."kA capsule that allows a Pokémon with two Abilities to switch between these Abilities when it is used."qA watering can shaped like a Lotad. It helps promote the healthy growth of any Berries planted in soft soil."AA machine to fuse Necrozma, which needs light, and Solgaleo."?A machine to fuse Necrozma, which needs light, and Lunala."[An item holding Zygarde's Cores and Cells. You can use it to change Zygarde's ability."QRaises Speed sharply when a Pokémon misses with a move because of accuracy."nAn item to be held by a Pokémon. When the holder's stats are lowered, it will be switched out of battle."EThese boots prevent the effects of traps set on the battlefield."`Raises Sp. Atk by two steps when the Pokémon uses a sound move the first time each battle."_Raises Attack by two steps when the Pokémon uses a blade move the first time each battle."OA held item. The holder is protected from the negative effects of weather."hA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 250 Exp. Points."iA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 1000 Exp. Points."jA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 4,000 Exp. Points."kA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 16,000 Exp. Points."kA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 50,000 Exp. Points."jThe fossil of an ancient Pokémon that once soared through the sky. What it looked like is a mystery."dThe fossil of an ancient Pokémon that once lived in the sea. What it looked like is a mystery."cThe fossil of an ancient Pokémon that once roamed the land. What it looked like is a mystery."yIt is said that a hero used this shield to halt a terrible disaster in ancient times. But it's grown rusty and worn."xIt is said that a hero used this sword to halt a terrible disaster in ancient times. But it's grown rusty and worn."tReins that people presented to the king. They enable Calyrex to connect and communicate with its beloved steed."tA charm that increases the Exp. Points that Pokémon can get by 10%. A machine-like object is inside the charm."AA charm that doubles the chance of getting a critical catch."OA long, durable rope. Use it to escape instantly from a cave or a dungeon."JA token which can be exchanged for a Grass-type at the Starter Store."JA token which can be exchanged for a Water-type at the Starter Store."ZA peculiar ore that makes certain species of Pokémon evolve. Associated with Arceus."IA token which can be exchanged for a Fire-type at the Starter Store."^An abandoned Dratini egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."\An abandoned Bagon egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."\An abandoned Gible egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."\An abandoned Deino egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."\An abandoned Goomy egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."_An abandoned Jangmo-o egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."]An abandoned Dreepy egg that is cold and calm. Only an expert would be able to hatch it."IA ticket that can be exchanged for an Eevee at the Skeevy Eevee Pub."aHeals your whole team a limited number of times. Restocked at PokeCenters and after resting."UA pack for holding medicine. If you use it, your Aid Kit will gain a max charge."RA suite of medicines. If you use it, your Aid Kit will heal more efficiently."LA stick of dynamite, perfectly suited to destroying small bits of rock."DA peculiar stone that makes certain species of Pokémon evolve."1A surf board, allowing you to surf on water."BA set of climbing gear, allowing you to climb on white rocks."SA teleporter which brings you to your last safe spot using the power of Abras."OA 3D printer which automatically copies consumed held items after battles."aIt's a cup filled with warm coffee. You probably shouldn't be keeping this in your backpack."EA package containing an important shipment destined for LuxTech."`A machine that stores excess EXP. You can activate it to turn that stored EXP into candies."BUse on a Pokémon to switch it into another one of its forms."<A suspicious package. Probably best not to look inside."KA forged ID card. It will let you pretend you work at Aegis Insurance.":A device containing evidence against Aegis Insurance."XIf reversed, gym leaders and story fights will become harder through unique curses."@Proof of ownership for the house you bought in Prizca East."jA small vial of gleaming powder. Can be used once to ensure the next wild Pokémon you find is shiny."jInfinitely mutating alien DNA. It allows a Pokémon with two abilities to switch abilities when used."QA pass that grants you access through the locked door in Victoire's factory."QA device which creates then launches regular Poké Balls, never running out."YA colorful keycard. It grants access to elevator at the Sweetrock Harbor Lighthouse.":It would be a delicious treat if you were a Pokémon."RA slip of paper with one digit of the code for the lock to Rafael's gym door."nA hi-tech recording device which increases your Pokémon's experience gained from Trainer battles by 40%."mAn upgraded, hi-tech recording device which increases the experience gained from Trainer battles by 50%."tA detailed report on how to improve as a trainer. If you decide to read it, your level cap will be raised by 5."_An ID card which unlocks Team Chasm gates and doors, giving access to dangers and rewards."aA miniature Avatar Totem. Use it to teleport to any unlocked Avatar T