r a keycard."'You insert the Team Chasm ID Card."0A locked door. It has a slot for a keycard."The door was unlocked."Take One"Take All"Swap Order"	Take"	Move"Do what with an item?"%{1}'s {2} and {3} swapped order."Move {1} to where?"	Back"Mark your Pokémon."Party: {1}"No ability"No item"You're holding a Pokémon!"Continue Box operations?"Exit from the Box?")That Pokémon is not a valid choice!"*You cannot select a donated Pokémon!"
