gin to bend towards #{user.pbThis(true)}."8An air of authority surrounds #{user.pbThis(true)}."3#{user.pbThis} looks to the Ozone Layer above!"*#{user.pbThis}'s rage is at its peak!"/The avatar of Deoxys turns to Attack Form!"0The avatar of Deoxys turns to Defense Form!".The avatar of Deoxys turns to Speed Form!"@#{user.pbThis} aims its stinger at #{target.pbThis(false)}!"JThe avatar of Genesect is analyzing your whole team for weaknesses..."##{user.pbThis} can't find any!" #{user.pbThis} loads a {1}!"&A Shadow creeps into the dream…";#{user.pbThis} is fully charged. Its about to explode!"##{user.pbThis} is charging up."$#{turnsRemaining} turns remain!"U#{user.pbThis} eyes #{target.pbThis(true)}'s #{target.itemCountD} with jealousy!",#{user.pbThis}'s shroom stalks perk up!"=#{user.pbThis} is flying erratically. It looks unstable!"The season shifts!"The avatar swaps machines!"<#{user.pbThis} aims to burn #{targets[0].pbThis(true)}!"?#{user.pbThis} is jealous of #{targets[0]}'s good fortune!".#{user.pbThis} shuns the cave's darkness!"'#{user.pbThis} is feeling exposed!"G#{user.pbThis} is looking to butter up #{targets[0].pbThis(true)}!"I#{user.pbThis} is studying #{targets[0].pbThis(true)}'s personality!"K#{user.pbThis}'s wind whips in #{targets[0].pbThis(true)}'s direction!"=#{user.pbThis} is molding its clay for physical defense!"<#{user.pbThis} is molding its clay for special defense!"Boss using struggle!"/#{user.pbThis} is winding up a big attack!"5An Avatar has been inserted into Yezera's party!"JThe battle begins with sunshine. The effects of sunshine are doubled."GThe battle begins with rain. The effects of rainstorm are doubled."BThe battle begins with hail. The effects of hail are doubled."LThe battle begins with sandstorm. The effects of sandstorm are doubled."MThe battle begins with sandstorm. The foe has extra sandstorm abilities!"KYour Pokemon lose 10 levels for this fight. EXP goes to the Dispenser."5Enemy Pokemon have all of their legal abilities!"DYour Pokemon don't get extra damage on their same-type attacks."*Enemy Pokemon all have an extra type."*Enemy Pokemon all have an extra item."?Yezera won't leave the battle early. This is a true fight!"DBence and Zoé are using 5 battlers each. This is a big battle!"NYezera and Shadow Mavis are using 6 battlers each. This is a huge battle!"<Enemy attacks always activate their additional effects."GYour Pokemon gain the "Perish Song" status when they enter battle."WAfter your Pokemon attack, the attacking stat that was used is lowered by 4 steps."?#{spikesCount} layers of Spikes were scattered around you!"NStatus conditions ignore Safeguard and affect your Pokemon twice as much!"LWhenever an enemy Pokemon enters at full health, it forms a substitute."KOpposing Pokemon hold super-powerful items. Stolen items turn to dust.")Your Pokemon are Tormented on entry."FNeutral attacks against your Pokemon are instead Super Effective."<Your Super Effective attacks become Not Very Effective."`When enemy Pokemon faint, they deal a quarter of their HP as damage to their last attacker."+#{battler.pbThis} takes its vengeance!"${1}'s {2} made {3} ineffective!"It doesn't affect {1}..."!{1} is pained by its dreams!"{1} found a {2}!"{1} transformed!"){1} luxuriated in its fine clothing." {1}'s inner fire flared up!"{1} finally cooled off!"-#{battler.pbThis} grows one size bigger!"&#{battler.pbThis} is fully grown!"{1} harvested one {2}!"{1} withdrew another {2}!"{1} was delivered one {2}!"){1} incorporates hail into its body."{1} soaks up the rain."){1} incorporates sand into its body.""{1} was hurt by the sunlight!"#{1} was hurt by the moonlight!"{1} soaks up the heat."{1} was hurt by the rain!"){1} caramlizes slightly in the heat."*{1} revels in the unusual conditions."{1} rests in safety."{1} absorbs the moonlight."8{1} sends out a signal, healing #{healTarget.name}!"${1}'s {2} made it the {3} type!"4{1} heals itself with energy from {2}'s attack!"{1} is damaged by recoil!"