s looking to {2} for some kind of cue."={1} is staying in place, waiting for {2} to make a move."+{1} obediently sat down at {2}'s feet."{1} jumped in surprise!"{1} jumped a little!"D\wm<i>You get the sense that you've collected enough light.</i>"0\wm<i>Your friend will be very pleased.</i>";\wm<i>You should visit her in her very nice house.</i>"Q\wm<i>You get the sense that you've found about half the light you need.</i>"8\wm<i>Your friend is waiting with anticipation.</i>"(\wm<i>Continue your collection.</i>")\wm<i>You're getting close, now.</i>"/\wm<i>A vision appears in your mind...</i>"8Groceries from the south, Customers from the north."HThe path is full of crates. Not that he minds, he's out of the way."KA lab opens its door to bones. Just next door is closed shut, however."2A place of learning. It has its secrets, too."3Green grass fades to brown...but Jade remains."=Broken houses and broken wills, tough ones linger still.".Grass, mud, and weeds taller than people."/Verdant forest. Layers of land and leaves."?A pitiful town, it's all fallen down. She's got her place."BA bit of order planted in the chaos. Visitors must be pruned."9A musician makes their mark in the Medusa's mandate."=Statues, statues, eerie indeed. But the show must go on."6A city of chain links. Why not go somewhere else?";A road with no cars. Must you buy your way to freedom?"?Old bricks look down upon you. You're not in charge, here."6Big city, big buildings. The halls of government.">A tiny bit of cliff. You can just barely smell the honey."4Seas of wheat beckon you to cross. What a view!"4The rocky path less traveled. Southern brother."6The easy way is a whole forest away. Take a hike!"1Sun on sand on water. A maze of tributaries."1One man works to keep back the tide of sand."4A view of where the First Champion was hatched."@A proving ground, underground. A home for would-be mothers."3Past the guardian dragon. Climb, climb, climb!"FThick clouds and stars not right. But you're above all that, now.">A maiden of the east. Poor clothes for mountain-climbing."7Think you can handle whatever strategy I'm hiding?"5Ah, my dear friend \PN, care for another battle?"<Hey there, \PN! How about a friendly Pokémon showdown?"HThe time has come for us to engage in yet another thrilling battle!"EGreetings, esteemed champion! Fancy a clash of Pokémon prowess?"F\PN, my rival, I humbly request your presence on the battlefield."YThe stage is set, and my new team is eager to take you by surprise. Shall we battle?"I\PN, the champion of Maya, a challenger awaits you. Will you accept?"(The thrill of surprise is imminent!"MHark! Brace yourself for a battle of wonder, where victory is uncertain!"QWell, well, well! Fancy a sparring session, with a dash of unpredictability?"GHey, you! Up for a surprise Pokemon battle? Or are you too scared?"5Champion, huh? You got the to face my surprises?"OGet ready to unravel the enigma of my team. Will it be a treat or a trick?"ZWarning! Battling me may cause trembling, excessive sweating, and a memorable defeat."TNo point in saying much. I've come to expect this sort of performance from you."CHaha, you got me this time! But I'll be back with a vengeance!"VYou've mastered the art of surprise attacks! I bow down to your wacky brilliance."NMy perfectionism failed me. But if I can just perfect my perfectionism..."YUtterly defeated... I'm at a loss for words. I'll need to find some new inspiration.":\PN, you really knows how to bring out my weaknesses."\Defeated, but at least I can pursue my dream of becoming a professional pillow fighter."FMy Pokémon must have been practicing their synchronized failing."FI'll try to laugh about that loss. It's the best medicine, right?"@Well, at least I'll be known for being a unique individual."WI must confess, you're like a puzzle I just can't solve. Kudos for the mind games!"4Ouch! That defeat hit harder than a Hyper Beam."eDefeat stings like a Poison Jab to the heart. Time to reevaluate my strategy and lick my wounds."MYou've shown me the true meaning of humiliation. Frankly, it does stink.".....dang."9Sometimes I regret deciding to never use held items."QThe surprise play must have worked, since I took some of yours down with me!">Oh, well, my perfect plan went awry. Time to recalculate."WDefeat? No worries, I'll just add it to my collection of almost-perfect victories!"WBravo! Your team concoction was like a spicy curry that set my taste buds on fire."8\PN, your battles are a roller coaster of emotions."LSometimes even the best fall short. I'll dust myself off and try again!",Looks like you're still a worthy rival!"GWell, that was a close call! My heart was pounding with each move."]I gave it my all, but luck wasn't on my side. At least I'm gonna blame that one on luck."TA loss? How unexpected! It's not like I meticulously planned for this scenario."$Well, at least I lost in style."JHats off to you, my friend. You battled like a true Pokemon virtuoso."9Bravo! Your battle strategy was truly a work of art."RAh, my dear Pokémon, we were so close to achieving flawless victory. Alas..."[Congratulations, \PN! You've proven that even the best can be outshone... temporarily."ZOh, look! A defeat. Just what I needed to keep my ego in check. Thanks for that, \PN."FEscorted by, Enthroned upon, Ensconced within this Empty Eminence""A Sky Scoured of Star and Sun"*Forevers Traversed yet Ever No Better"=Ought Not the Foxtrot to Double Aught of What We Sought?"DA Portrait of the Opposition in Radiant Ulfire and Stygian Blue"8The Visitation of the Illusive Inevitable: Landfall">In Our Equality, Disparity; from Injustice Settled Scales"A Fool's Errand"UDeterminism I Defer to Thee, Free Will I Freely Give. Let Thy Die Remain Uncast."'A Litany of Lullabies, Seldom Sung"*Every Beat Betrays the Beast's Burden"IGored Upon the Horns of the Dilemma - Boredom or the Path of Thorns?"CYour side gains spikes each turn, except if removed that turn."+You were spared from spikes this turn!"<Pyres raised
