in your collection?"7Return to me if you encounter any in your travels."Critical Hits"4What are critical hits and when do they happen?"What are Critical Hits?"zA critical hit deals 50% more damage than a regular hit. These naturally happen at random times on any damaging move.""How common are Critical Hits?"pThe base critical hit chance is 1 in 16. This chance can be raised by abilities, items, or special effects."Other Effects"�Critical hits ignore stat steps (on the user or the target) that would lower their damage. They also ignore protective screens like Reflect and Light Screen."Preventing Criticals"|Certain abilities prevent critical hits against that Pokemon. The Lucky Chant effect protects their side from critical hits."Guaranteed Criticals"�Some moves or abilities are not random, but guarantee a critical hit under certain conditions. Otherwise, these act the same as random critical hits."}Avatars cannot perform random critical hits. However, they can perform guaranteed critical hits from moves or abilities."${1} overpowers type immunities!"Do you wish to battle?"'Achievement Unlocked:\r\n\\c[2]{1}"0\wmThe words of a poem appear in your mind.",\ss\wm"Watchful eye, a towering sight.""-\ss\wm"Budding hope, with 3-fold might.""&\ss\wm"We await you, o slayer...""-Negative generation numbers are invalid.";You shake the Rusted Compass, but it remains stagnant."8You get a sense of a piece of loot hidden nearby..."6You receive a vision of a piece of nearby loot..."The hidden loot"{1} is very far away!"{1} is far away!"!{1} is at a medium distance!"{1} is close by!"{1} is very close by!"8{1} is EXTREMELY close! You're nearly on top of it!"SPECIAL/D to"hide shinies"show shinies"OTHER MOVES"[Every PokéCenter and every Ranger Station will contain the 3 Team Customization NPCs.";Speak to them to learn how they can upgrade your team!"Game State"Documents"Achievements"�Some Avatars have Empowered attacks, which are powered-up versions of other attacks