Catacombs can be found in the Sewers underneath Prizca East."�Continue to delve into the Chamber of Regigigas, so you can finally put a stop to Yezera's plan. The Chamber of Regigias is behind a large door in the eastern side of the Hollowed Layer."Bulky Attacker"Bulky Physical"FBut it failed, because #{user.pbThis(true)} cannot eat its berry!"_Looking inside the journal, you see that the only page that hasn't fallen out is page {1}."7\i[RAGGEDJOURNAL]You've found page {1} of the {2}!"<You slot the page into its proper place in the journal."Read it now?"Page {1}"'Which page would you like to read?" You clamber out of the den!":Welcome to the Poké Ball Depot! How may I serve you?"/What pattern would you like me to give it?" Wow, it's a shiny Pokémon!"GSpirit Guardian Sonya is using 12 battlers. This is a huge battle!",The Corviknight stares at you intently."High King Calyrex"Except, what's this!?"9The Avatar of Calyrex has arrived to save its steed!"'{1} reers up its hooves above {2}!"1{1} raises a hand towards the thunderclouds."0{1} opens its bulb towards the shining sun."The inscription reads:"Part 1, X for Next Page"Part 2, X to exit"N...Maybe you should transcribe this, just in case it does mean something."<i>What!!?</i>"!<i>How... how could you?</i>"d<i>Insolent fool! Treasonous wretch!!! Usurping the King of All in your desperate attemp–</i>"MCalyrex's protests fade away, leaving an echoing silence in its absence.".<i>Drink the regal blood if you must.</i>"C<i>Indulge in your <b>traitorous nature</b> if you insist.</i>"<i>Repulsive flea...</i>"0<i><b>I will swat you from the sky.</b></i>"Can Evolve by Method"Evolved From Method"No Evolutions"No Prevolutions"Split Evo"${1} notices how healthy {2} is!"&{1} is jealous of {2}'s strength!""{1} is jealous of {2}'s mind!"�Ah, to be on solid ground again. Away from Galar's suffocating industrial sprawl. Stable. Connected. Tranquil. No cold steel shifting and rocking beneath my feet. No stench of smoke and oil to burn my lungs."&Just me, my companion, and Makya."May 22nd"�I wonder if it's just me. So sentimental and wistful over little things I thought I knew. Is nostalgia tainting my perceptions? Or is the world truly as broken as it looks?"}My new friend makes me expect the latter. A sad story. But... inspiring nonetheless. Maybe I'll meet them again someday."May 26th"�Life. Not just Life as life – Life as creation. Life as energy. Life as imagination, and falsehood, and memory, and motion. Over six days in Makya, this is the one place that seems to be governed by Life... and not its negation."]The world is dead. And Makya stands as little more than a polished mirror. What a shame."May 29th"tI left last night when the earth began to rumble. I only returned for my companion, despite my... reservations."dA great pit separates me from yesterday's memories. A dozen blackened eyes study my every step."What's done is done."June 4th"�At every turn, a set of eyes. On every perch, a silver scout. But... surely they cannot see everywhere? My friend at the Monument seemed to imply as much."�But with every step I take, I find a new reason to check over my shoulder. Whether it's guilt or fear that guides me to that great tower... well. I'd rather not dwell on that yet."June 6th"9This was a mistake. This was <i>all</i> a mistake..."�A set of silver eyes rests atop Carnation Tower today. I couldn't shake the feeling that it expected me... He must know I stole His reign. Nothing makes sense if He doesn't."�To anyone reading this, I urge you: Speak to my friend at the Monument. As long as He stands without rule, we can act without fear."June 11th"I can't afford to speak."I can't afford to trust."'I can barely afford to write this."�A woman with hollow eyes and an uncanny smile approached me today. She asked about my history. She asked about Makya. She asked... about Him."1Tomorrow. All of this ends tomorrow morning."June 13th"!This can't be a coincidence."SMy best hope of escaping His grasp... but I can tell we're not moving anymore."uNobody seems to believe me. We can't even see the waves! And I've heard four hooves circling my bed for hours..."He won."June 15th"—Oriel"<You get the sense that you've failed some sort of test."Green-thumbed"Savior"Scornful"Grand Design"Treason"7<i>Let this act as a lesson in humility, worm!</i>"T<i>To think!! My gift to the world, in the hands of the <b>undeserving</b>!</i>"5It has no effect on Pokémon other than Calyrex."BY LEVEL"BY OTHER"MATCHUPS"DETAILS"ANIMATION"	Text"Search move description"Which category?"Tag"Effect Chance"Priority"Signature"Has Notes"'Physical moves that can be called:"&Special moves that can be called:",<u>150 BP</u>: Pearl of Fate, Iron Ball"9<u>100 BP</u>: Choice Items, Weather Rocks, Life Orb""<u>75 BP</u>: Everything else"<u>Poison</u>: Poison Orb"<u>Burn</u>: Burn Orb" <u>Frostbite</u>: Frost Orb")<u>Leech</u>: Big Root, Binding Band"Form effects:"<u>Heat</u>: Burn"<u>Wash</u>: Numb"<u>Frost</u>: Frostbite"<u>Fan</u>: Dizzy"<u>Mow</u>: Leech"Moves that can be rolled:"<Can't call focusing moves, moves that call other moves,"LCan't call moves that alter the moveset, moves that counter, moves that"RCan't call moves that affect the moveset, moves that redirect or steal moves,"?Can't call Signature moves, moves that affect the moveset,"6There's no one near by to use the Poké X-Ray on!",Point the Poké X-Ray at which trainer?"(You point the Poké X-Ray at {1}..."6Victoire notices you glancing at the Poké X-Ray.";She smiles slightly and gives you an inscrutable look."	zero"one"two"
